INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3070537', 'Shawntay Dalon and her six sisters and two brothers were born to Elijah & Marie (deceased) and were raised on the east side of Detroit, Michigan. Shawntay and her twin sister attended the Detroit High School for the Fine & Performing Arts. Shawntay majored in Drama. Her twin Janay, majoring in Music. This was the same high school that her childhood inspiration "Aaliyah " attended. Shawntay graduated from Finney High School and went on to attend Wayne State University with a major in Speech Communications and Theater.::Management', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Shawntay Dalon');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8175842', 'Mike Dargatis III was born in Scranton, Pennsylvania to parents Michael and Laura. At the age of 6, he moved to Clarks Summit, Pennsylvania, where he spent the remainder of his youth. Mike attended Abington Heights High School. Upon graduation, he went on to attend Clarion University. After 2 years, he transferred to Wilkes University, where he graduated with a degree in Communications Studies.Upon moving to Pittsburgh, PA, Mike gained an interest in acting after appearing as a waiter in the TV series "Those Who Kill". He has since appeared in various commercials, print ads, and short films. His first supporting role came in the film "Night Zero".::TG', NULL, NULL, '1989-07-21', NULL, 'Mike Dargatis');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1778284', 'Producer and Director, Christopher De Stefano is a native Floridian independent filmmaker born in Miami Beach, Florida to an Italian-American New York City father and a British mother in 1971. Christopher is the youngest sibling of out of four. A summa cum laude 2006 graduate from Miami-Dade College: North Campus with an A.S. degree in Film Production. Christopher also holds an A.A. degree in Commercial Art from International Fine Arts College and a B.S. degree in Communications from St. Thomas University and a certification in International Government & Cultural Relations from Tver State University in Moscow, Russia.For nearly 20 years, Christopher has been in the film production field in South Florida area in-front and behind the camera. Christopher has worked on such motion picture shoots as Magic City, Burn Notice, Charlie''s Angels (2011), The Glades, Graceland, Step Up: Revolution, Pain and Gain, IronMan 3, Spring Break Reunion II, True Lies, Just Cause, Wild Things, Any Given Sunday, 2Fast 2Furious, A Miami Tail, From Justin To Kelly, Transporter 2, Gold Rush and more.Christopher has served as producer for his own companies of School Boy Productions, LLC, and New Vision Films, LLC. Under his third company, De Stefano Studio Films, LLC, Christopher has written, produced, edited and directed several short films, Cole, The Proposal, Vengeance, The Coffee Shop Robbery, All Hallowe''en Eve, Coming Out, Saudade and It''s About Time!Christopher De Stefano''s short films, "It''s About Time!" is the 2008 Communicator Awards ~ Sliver Award winner for Producer, 2008 Telly Awards ~ Bronze Award winner for Best Cinematography & Producer, and the 2006 Aurora Awards® ~ Platinum Best of Show winner in "Student Film." "The Coffee Shop Robbery" is the 2007 Aurora Awards® ~ Gold Award winner in the "Student Film."::Christopher De Stefano', 'Christopher Richard', 'De Stefano', NULL, NULL, 'Christopher De Stefano');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1004260', 'Christopher DerGregorian is an actor and writer, known for Brother (2000), Scrambled Eggs (2004) and Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Christopher DerGregorian');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0220717', 'Judy Dery is an actress, known for Polish Wedding (1998), The Pickle Recipe (2016) and Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Judy Dery');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4035707', 'A native of Grand Rapids, Michigan. David began acting in 2001 when he was cast on the spot as a baseball player in Billy Crystal''s 61. It was that first project where David received encouraging advice from actor "Anthony Michael Hall" that gave him the drive to take acting to another level. Several years later he was cast in 2 more feature films, and started getting recognition for his appearance''s in several commercial''s and a book trailer for "Edge of Apocalypse" written by New York Times best selling author Tim Lahaye. David is in talks for future projects.::N.L', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'David Scott Diaz');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5981505', 'Christine A. Donnelly is an actress, known for Who Gets the Dog? (2016), Not Another Zombie Movie....About the Living Dead (2014) and The Last Generation to Die (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Christine A. Donnelly');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4115748', 'Andrew James Dubats is a Specs Howard School of Media Arts graduate who has spent years in digital media production. Early in his career Andrew made television appearances in two 30 second spots for Specs Howard which aired on both CBS and ABC television networks. He has also worked with high profile Michigan Radio stations such as WRIF and 89X in helping to produce online videos. During his time working with the Specs Howard promotional department he filmed interviews backstage with the biggest names in rock music. With an extensive background in marketing and sales Andrew is utilizing his diverse skill set to work toward a career in the entertainment industry.::Andrew Dubats', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Andrew Dubats');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4740158', 'Steven Dutton is known for his work on Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016), American Idol (2002) and Empire (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Steven Dutton');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3266358', 'Lewis Duval is the son of mother Francine and Father Gene. Lewis grew up in a middle class area in Harlem, New York City, where he later moved to Hershey, Pa to further his education and steer free from the drugs and violence in the mid 80''s. He graduated from Milton Hershey School and went on to Attend Cheyney Univesity, where he began Studying theater under the direction of Jann Elis-Scruggs.Pursing his acting career, he began doing such plays as "Lysistrata", "Fences", and "A Raisin in the Sun" and his break out play "Amen Corner", which he received Best Actor for his performance as the character Luke.Lewis is now active as Film Director, Producer and Visual Effects Supervisor for Soulmagik Studios. His first film Twichters, received high acclaim amongst his fellow film maker peers and viewers across the coast. His efforts are to continue create films and running his visual effects workshop.::Lewis Tillman <ifilmslimtied@hotmail.com>', 'Lewis D', 'Tillman', '1977-01-08', NULL, 'Lewis Duval');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5702423', 'Bethany Eastman is an actress, known for Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016) and The Grand Rapids LipDub Video (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bethany Eastman');
