INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5876420', 'Mikey Pobuda is a native New Yorker. Ever since the age of 12 Mikey became immersed in theater, preforming in various off-Broadway plays. After studying at numerous schools, he picked up and made the move to Los Angeles. Mikey has, since then, been involved in television, commercial, and Improv Theatre. Mikey is currently enrolled in UCB, further enhancing his improvisation skills and craft. Mikey loves coffee, creepy crawlers, and pogs.::Mikey Pobuda', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mikey Pobuda');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5964337', 'LaTrallo Presley is an actor, known for The End of the Tour (2015), SJ Dennison Must Die! (2014) and Grain (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LaTrallo Presley');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4432494', 'Mark Rademacher has lived and worked in the Detroit area most of his life. He is in the process of relocating to Atlanta, GA. He has appeared in numerous motion pictures and more than 50 regional theater productions, garnering numerous awards. He is also an accomplished artist. He is married to Mary Rademacher and the proud father of Kelli Rademacher Hector and Kathryn Kein, two formidable women in the academic and business world.::Mark Rademacher', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mark Rademacher');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3080419', 'Ardeshir Radpour is known for his work on Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016), Westworld (2016) and American Sniper (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ardeshir Radpour');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4516095', 'Diezel Ramos Actor / Writer / ProducerDiezel Ramos, A 5 Time World Champion Powerlifter turned actor. Born in South Bronx NY on February 21 1977, to Italian and Puerto Rican/African American parents. Coming from a broken home and a troubled past, he managed to get himself out of the city and into Ocean City NJ where he met his daughters mom, Kim Richards and where life as he knew it would change for the best.In 2010 Diezel''s unique looks, size, and innate talent, was discovered by industry veterans. He was cast in his first principal role, in North Jersey, as a hit-man on Minikin. From that moment on his love for acting grew. With hard work, determination and a few challenges along the way, Ramos has landed many roles and voice-overs one would be proud of, such as,White House Down Fast and The Furious The Last Which Hunter Transformers G.I Joe Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles Get Hard Olympus Has Fallen The Equalizer and Into The StormNot only did he manage to land great roles. He also became one of the few actors to portray characters for bothMarvel Studios & DC EntertainmentThe Dark Knight Rises Man Of Steel Suicide Squad Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice Kingsman: The Secret Service and 20th Century Fox production Fantastic FourRamos is definitely a talent on the rise and is a force to be reckoned with. He continues to thrive through his hard work and perseverance. It is no surprise that Hollywood is pounding on his rising star door!With upcoming productions in the next couple of months, Ramos will be keeping busy getting himself into character. One character being his first leading role, on the set of Garotte, is (Tiny) the mob bosses right hand man who''s determined to find the truth, no matter the cost. Directed by Leo Sanderson. He''ll also portray (Jose) on Messenger of Wrath Directed by Ryan Callaway (The Enforcer) on Streets of Philly and (Samson) on Vector III Retribution Directed by Micheal Farenilli. Thanks to Ellie B. Brown, he''s also been added to her list of lead cast members for the Ellie B Block Party Show coming this fall of 2017.Not only is he keeping busy with new roles and an upcoming show. He''s also producing his first web production called "Small Screen to Big Screen and Cooking in Between". Which consists of reviewing & comparing featured films and Classic movies. All while preparing classic favorite foods and new foods with a twist.Ramos isn''t just passionate about acting, he also has a passion to help those in need. He has big plans to give back to his community by providing the homeless with care packages and meals. As well as help women, children and teens, that have been broken through different types of abuse, poverty and bullying. All by sharing his own personal story, to give them back hope and help them see the light at the end of the tunnel, the way he was once helped.With his daughter Brianna Ramos as his #1 fan and his main inspiration, she gives him more of a reason to do great in this industry. He is determined to push forward and inspire as many people as he can through his work and personal character. One would say he''s more than just an inspiration, some even say he''s like a father or big brother, but he''s definitely a friend to all. Those who know Diezel would say he is the most humble, hard working, persistent, wise, caring, straight forward kind of guy you''d ever meet. He puts God first and goes above and beyond for those he loves and cares for which makes him a true Super Hero to many.Check out Diezel Ramos on IMDB Facebook Instagram LUKE_CAGE_77 Writer / Producer::Felicita Cosme', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Diezel Ramos');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6616713', 'Andy Randhawa is an actor and writer, known for The Untold, Paradisum and Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Andy Randhawa');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5054622', 'Elizabeth Reiners is known for her work on Johnny (2014), Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016) and Animals (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Elizabeth Reiners');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3943574', 'Nicholas Ritz is an actor and producer, known for Deadline: Medium Rare (2011), Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016) and Freaky Deaky (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nicholas Ritz');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('9042807', 'Bryant Christopher Rue was born in Wichita, Kansas. He comes from a home schooled family of 9, with 3 brothers and 3 sisters. He grew up in Fort Wayne, Indiana and began acting in local plays and short films in early high school. His first paying job was with a Fort Wayne performing group (All for One) as they preformed at a number of local elementary schools, for the Indiana Character Counts program, teaching kids how to deal with bullies in the school setting. Bryant Rue worked with the program for two years in a row.After high school and on his 18th birthday, Bryant walked into the US Army recruiting office for the first time. Two weeks later he would live for Fort Benning, Georgia to begin his basic training in the United States Army as an infantryman. After basic training he was stationed at JBLM (Joint Base Lewis-McChord, formally known as Fort Lewis) in Washington State, in an infantry Stryker battalion 5-20. During his military service he would spend a 1 year combat deployment in Iraq.After leaving the military in 2012, he went back to film and acting, re-emerging in films such as Batman vs. Superman: Dawn of Justice and Submerge: Echo 51. He continues to act in films with a number of upcoming projects, while pursuing his own goals of producing and directing his own films.Both Bryant Rue and his brother Harason Rue began their early stages of production (2017) for their animated series (Dominion: Twin Gods) as co-writers and producers.::Bryant Rue', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bryant Rue');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4306632', 'Yessenia Monge is an actress, known for Runner Runner (2013) and No Seas Pendejo (2010).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yessenia Monge');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6755509', 'Debbie was born and raised in Cleveland, Ohio. On a whim, she auditioned for the Marvel movie, The Avengers (2012), and was booked for a background role. Since then, she has been booked in over 20 major and independent films, several commercials, and more recently, theater. Under the tutelage of James Madio, (Band of Brothers, Jersey Boys, Basketball Diaries), Debbie recently performed in an Actors Showcase highlighting her skills as an actress. Debbie is also a member of the Greater Cleveland Film Commission.::Ron S', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Debbie Scaletta');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5927312', 'Robert B. Schneider IV is an actor, known for The Avengers (2012), Captain America: The Winter Soldier (2014) and A Murder in the Park (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Robert B. Schneider IV');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6930874', 'Epic Scon is an actor, known for Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016), Imperfections (2016) and A Cartel Story (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Epic Scon');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3693512', 'George Edward Seder was born in Saginaw, Michigan and lived out his childhood in the East Central region of the state. He is of French/Swedish and Irish/English descent. He attended Whittemore-Prescott Public Schools until he finished his senior year and received his high school diploma from Vassar Adult Education in Vassar, Michigan. George became interested in acting at a very early age when, after a particularly saddening film scene, his Grandfather, Richard, explained that the scenes being portrayed were not real events. These people on television were actors pretending to be other people. The actors had "moved" him emotionally and he wanted others to experience the same empathy. There was no doubt that he wanted to be an actor someday. He wasn''t sure how to make it happen but, from that moment on, he never watched films and television the same way ever again. He "always watched the actors and the subtle things that they did to give their performance realism." His early acting influences included Clark Gable, Andy Griffith, Marlon Brando, Raymond Burr, Michael Caine and Clint Eastwood. As a teenager, his acting influences included Michael Landon, Bill Bixby, Alan Alda, Lee Majors and Jack Nicholson. As an adult, he learned that becoming a great actor required a rather large commitment and personal sacrifice. With a family to raise, George enlisted in the military and didn''t actively pursue an acting career until 2008. He nailed his very first audition; making his acting debut in the independent feature film "Harmless Thoughts." After two unsuccessful auditions following his first success, he began to perfect his audition technique, build his confidence as an actor and study the finer details of his craft.::George Seder', 'George Edward', 'Seder', NULL, NULL, 'George Seder');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3070968', 'Life has been an unlikely journey for Actor/Writer/Artist Kimani Shillingford. Born and raised by a single mother just outside of Detroit, Kimani has always dreamed of great things. An energetic youngster, he showed an early affinity for the arts and performance. Acting, drawing, singing, and writing took up most of his free time outside of school. Raised in the church, God became the foundation that would mold him into the artist and man that he is today. A Business/Pre-Law graduate of Michigan State University, Kimani initially sought out a career in the business sector, but after a short detour through corporate America the yearning to express his creativity and utilize his God-given gifts became too loud to ignore. In the relatively short time since abandoning his first career and venturing into the arts he has racked up an impressive list of accomplishments. Seeing initial success in major advertising and television campaigns for numerous brands, Kimani switched the focus of his energy to honing his acting talents. Since that time he counts lead and supporting roles in a number of independent feature and short films and on stages in New York, Chicago, and Los Angeles as highlights of his burgeoning career. He recently appeared on-screen alongside industry veterans Keith David and Harry Lennix in the first black Shakespearian film H4, directed by Paul Quinn and starred in the narrative short film Kickstart Theft, co-directed and shot by Academy Award-winner Vilmos Zsigmond. Kimani can be seen next in a small, yet memorable, role in the Warner Brothers blockbuster Batman V Superman: Dawn of Justice directed by Zack Snyder. His studies have included method work at The Studio and British technique with Dr. Ruth Kulerman in New York and at Krater Studios and with Eric Kline at the Film Actors Workshop in Los Angeles among others. In addition to his performance work, Kimani writes, paints, and volunteers his time weekly with children and other social causes and has an intense love for travel that has taken him around the world. One thing that has remained constant, however, is his love for God and belief in Jesus Christ without whom none of his blessings, experiences, and accomplishments could have been and which continues to give him a unique perspective when approaching life and a variety of acting roles.::GGt', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kimani Shillingford');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1156393', 'Jennifer studied at the prestigious Actors'' Studio in Los Angeles and graduated from the Lee Strasberg Theater Institute. She grew up in Pennsylvania and studied at Penn State with a dual major in Theater and Biochemistry. She worked for a little while at the Centers for Disease Control as a biochemist before she broke out and started performing in theatre productions throughout the east coast. She then moved to Los Angeles where her film/TV career started to blossom. She now lives and works in Atlanta, GA; where the business is booming.::C. M.', 'Jennifer Lynn', 'Shumaker', NULL, NULL, 'Jennifer Shumaker');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7123019', 'Kevin Herbert Slone was born on September 13, 1992 in Akron, Ohio to Sheryl Slone, an EPA engineer, and Herbert Slone, an architect. He has one older sister Kimberly. Kevin became interested in acting during his days at Theodore Roosevelt High School in Kent, Ohio where he was often selected by his English teacher to read for the lead part in class plays. Kevin was also an accomplished football player in high school garnering all-conference honors and interest from several small colleges.Kevin''s acting career began in the summer of 2012 when his father encouraged him to attend an open audition for the high school football film Underdogs (2013) which happened to be filming in nearby Canton, Ohio. It was at this audition where Kevin''s "tough" appearance and athletic experience caught the eye of the casting director who decided to cast him as a player on the antagonist team. Although the movie had limited distribution, it received favorable reviews at many film festivals nationwide and has enjoyed a substantial run through online streaming media.Building on his first acting experience, Kevin began to attend open casting calls regularly. While attending college as an accounting major at Kent State University and working part time as a bus driver, he managed to land an uncredited appearance in Captain America: The Winter Soldier (2014). In the summer of 2014, he decided to quit his part time job and pursue casting opportunities full time. During this period, he managed to land small parts in 3 major films including Southpaw (2015), Concussion (2015), and Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016).::Kevin Slone', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kevin Slone');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4831612', 'Chris Slonske is known for his work on The End of the Tour (2015), Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016) and Ten Miles Back (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chris Slonske');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6896715', 'Samantha Sookdeosingh is an actress, known for Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016), Chicago P.D. (2014) and Sirens (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Samantha Sookdeosingh');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7786556', 'Sharon Spencer is an actress, known for Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016) and The Pickle Recipe (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sharon Spencer');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8767675', 'Joseph Stewart is an actor, known for Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016) and Hunting Lands (2017). He has been married to Durinda Stewart since January 13, 2017.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Joseph Stewart');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4266302', 'Morgan Strebler is an internationally recognized, award-winning mentalist, psychological illusionist, and actor, writer, and director. As one of the world''s foremost entertainers, his performances leave spectators jaws dropped, speechless, and wanting more. Further, Morgan creates almost all of his spellbinding effects. And, he is one of the most sought after inventors of new and innovative routines for use by other world-class performers. A portion of Morgan''s international fame has been built over two decades of television performances, talk shows, series, interviews, and championship competitions in 107 countries on five (5) continents before millions of viewers. Morgan has performed live at many major Las Vegas casinos, including Hard Rock, Venetian, two (2) years at Caesar''s Palace, and four (4) years at Bellagio. Earning the moniker, "Celebrity Mentalist", he has given personal performances for some of Hollywood''s greatest stars and celebrities, such as Tom Hanks, Ben Stiller, Jude Law, Quentin Tarantino, Michael Jordan, David Blaine, Paris Hilton, Carson Daly, Lisa Marie and Priscilla Presley, Ice T, Anna Nicole Smith and Michael Jackson at his Neverland Ranch Estate.::Morgan Strebler', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Morgan Strebler');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5902505', 'Dennis Styles is known for his work on Past Due, Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016) and Garroter (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dennis Styles');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4209639', 'John E.L. Tenney has been actively involved in the field of anomalistic, conspiratorial and occult research since the mid 1980''s and he has lectured on strange phenomena and folklore since the early 1990''s. His open skepticism of odd phenomena has gained him respect from both believers and skeptics. Aside from his lectures and due to his extended time involved in anomalistic research he has acted as a consult for numerous companies including, but not limited to, NBC, A&E, Fox, SyFy, Discovery Channel, Huffinton Post, Men''s Health and The New York Times.::M. Muirhead', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'John E.L. Tenney');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6628843', 'Justin M. Tolliver is an actor, known for A Walk Through the Woods (2015), The Judas Run (2016) and Not Another Zombie Movie....About the Living Dead (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Justin M. Tolliver');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5869721', 'Alfredo Torella is known for his work on Brotherhood (2014), Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016) and The Route (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Alfredo Torella');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1773028', 'Lynch R. Travis is an actor, known for The Butterfly Effect 3: Revelations (2009), Standing in the Shadows of Motown (2002) and The Ghost of Saint Aubin (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lynch R. Travis');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8430122', 'Tom Vallis is an actor, known for Rush: Inspired by Battlefield (2016), The Pickle Recipe (2016) and Old Man and the Gun (2018).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tom Vallis');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2340362', 'Underground Film Critic and Cult Director Markus James was born Mark James Van Woert early 1971 in Owosso, Michigan.At the age of 19 Markus was bit by the acting bug when 20th Century Fox landed on his home town''s door step of Alpena, Michigan. Where they filmed several scenes for Die Hard 2: Die Harder. He skip several days of his senior year during the frigid dead of winter just for a chance to be in the film.Then sometime later in 1998 the world got it''s first taste of Markus with the inception and extreme popularity of his horror/sci-fi film news and gossip website entitled HorrorManiacs.com.During its four year run the site was noticed and given honors by such organizations as Paramount Pictures, Troma Entertainment, and Newline Cinema. It was one of the first independent run websites to be offered the opportunity by Hollywood production companies to promote their main stream horror films with licensed swag like movie posters, DVDs and VHS tapes.At the peak of its popularity, the site received a minimum of 8,500 unique visits daily, and employed four freelance writer/film reviewers. The website was up on the latest news, gossip and housed thousands of film reviews which help pave the way for Markus as a legitimate Film Critic... aka "The b-Critic.The website''s popularity also gave Markus the opportunity to conducted numerous personal interviews with such stars as Debbie Rochon, Robert Z''Dar, and Bruce Campbell, and not to mention many popular Indie and mainstream film directors.In late 2000 Markus was hired by the then Cracked Magazine owner and publisher Dick Kulpa as Cracked''s official webmaster. From there Markus moved up the corporate ladder to Promotions Editor, then to Contributing Editor, while during the same time moonlighting as a contributing writer. In early 2005 Cracked Magazine was sold and the old regime retired.Markus also teamed with Kulpa on many other popular projects. Like being a freelance writer (under an alias) and a contributing webmaster for the ever popular tabloid - Weekly World News. Which during the same time Kulpa held the reigns as senior editor and creative consultant.Later Markus went on to design, host and maintain several other popular websites that include official movie sites like "Nowhere Man", "The Fullmoon Fan Club" and "Death Defying Acts". Plus a few official celebrity websites like DebbieRochon.com, for actress Felissa Rose, actor Robert Z''Dar, later Byron Cherry; Coy Duke of The Dukes of Hazzard TV series, and Don Pedro Colley, also from the Dukes.From 2002 to 2014 Markus owned and operated the national talent agency called The Talent Bin - which represented several celebrities like Sonny Shroyer, the Dukes duo Byron Cherry and Christopher Mayer, who sadly passed away July 23, 2011.Along with Don Pedro Colley, also best known for his role in the The Dukes of Hazzard tv series. Markus had a short stint working as Robert Z''Dar''s agent (Maniac Cop, Tango and Cash.) Robert passed away March 30, 2015.Don Pedro passed away October 11, 2017.More recently Markus has appeared as an extra in a few box office hits like - Transformers 3: Dark of the Moon, Transformers 4: Age of Extinction, Real Steal, RoboCop (2014) and Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice.::Christine Van Woert - Manager', 'Mark', 'Van Woert', '1971-03-07', NULL, 'Mark Van Woert');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7471735', 'Michael A. Villegas is a writer and producer, known for Killer Shades (2016), Hello and Return of the Killer Shades (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Michael A. Villegas');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2458030', 'Stephanie Fraser is known for her work on Prisoners (2013), Ride Along (2014) and Vacation (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Stephanie Fraser');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0634300', 'Attended Loyola Academy in Wilmette, Illinois, graduating in 1994.Graduated from Georgetown University in Washington, D.C. in 1999. Majored in English.Shortly after graduating from Georgetown University, Jonathan Nolan served as a production assistant on Memento (2000).Wrote the short story, "Memento Mori", on which the film Memento (2000) is based.Was co-writer, with his brother Christopher Nolan, on The Prestige (2006), The Dark Knight (2008) and The Dark Knight Rises (2012). Also co-wrote the Terminator Salvation (2009).::Peter A.', NULL, NULL, '1976-06-06', NULL, 'Jonathan Nolan');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1577637', 'Joshua Regnall Stewart was born in Diana, West Virginia, to Margie (Skidmore) and Charles Regnall Stewart, a teacher and Baptist pastor. He studied at the T. Schreiber studios in New York City and was a company member of the 13th Street Repertory Theatre. He continued his work in theater in Los Angeles performing in ''Light Bulb,'' and ''Beacon'' alongside ''Robert Forster'' and Brooke Shields. He is a competitive snowboarder and boxer.::anonymous', 'Joshua Regnall', 'Stewart', '1977-02-06', NULL, 'Josh Stewart');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5059683', 'Alexa Gengelbach is an actress, known for Man of Steel (2013), Spirit Stalkers (2012) and The Caretakers (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Alexa Gengelbach');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6136445', 'Harley Wallen grew up in a very creative household with music and performing all around him. Growing up an actor as he was a social butterfly and not shy at all. He started his journey as a Martial Artist early with Judo at age 7 and is now a 5th degree black belt. Harley also spent time learning other arts (Jiu-Jitsu, Tae Kwon - Do black-belts as well). His other love at a young age was dance as he was an outstanding break dancer in his teen years, and that is what landed him his first opportunity in acting as a dancer at the syndicated Swedish TV cult hit ''Solstollarna''! Harley soon after realized he''d got bitten by the acting bug. Harley then moved from Sweden to the United States to pursue his dreams, after a short stint these plans got sidetracked by business opportunities as Harley climbed the career ladders. After a very difficult divorce Harley needed to reconnect with his creative past and started again getting back into acting. It wasn''t long before the roles started coming and the growth he had experienced in the business world started happening to him in the acting world. After the film incentives ended in Michigan he decided to partner up and start making films of his own.. not having a film school background with only limited experience he decided to go online to further his education in filmmaking and acting. In 2016 Harley and his wife Kaiti formed the film production company ''Painted Creek Productions''. The one thing he really takes pride in is his commitment to the character he is playing regardless the size of the role or the paycheck. Harley is now writing, producing, acting and directing and has found his purpose!::Friends and family of Harley', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Harley Wallen');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3065315', 'Roger Wiggins is an actor, known for Boss (2011), Chicago P.D. (2014) and Crisis (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Roger Wiggins');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4398809', 'Leroy S. Williams III is an actor, known for Beyond the Edge (2016), Beyond the Mask (2015) and Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016). He has been married to Tara Shadd-Williams since June 21, 2002. They have two children.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Leroy S. Williams III');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6879405', 'Janellyn Woo aka "J Woo" is a SAG-eligible multi-lingual Asian American actress, dancer, host, model and singer. She was born in Royal Oak, MI into a Chinese (father) and Filipino (mother) family. She loves performing on camera, radio as well as any stage and was the Lead Dancer in her Ballet/Jazz dance recital. She has completed 17 radio/TV/web commercials within the past 2+ years of pursuing her professional acting career since April 2014. You can find her local, national and regional commercials in Vimeo or YouTube by searching under Consumers Energy "Energy Efficiency: Heating", Emagine Theaters "Summer Time", Ford "Take Your Kids To Work Day", Jet''s Pizza "Let''s Rediscover", Magformers "When I Grow Up", Pure Michigan "Detroit Soul", The Henry Ford "Buy One Get One Half Off", and Zoombezi Bay Waterpark "Baboon Lagoon".Janellyn began acting, dancing and singing in 2011 with her local community (musical) theatre while she was still in Kindergarten. She has performed in 13 Live theatre productions over the past 6 years now. You can see her in Seasons 1-3 of the EMMY & NETA Award-winning PBS Kids science show, Curious Crew, airing Monday nights at 5:30pm on WKAR-TV locally in the Lansing, MI area and on PBS as well as PBS Kids channels regionally throughout MI since November 2014. In March 2015 she can be seen Sunday nights at 10pm on WADL, playing a Lead role as Robby in a New TV sitcom called, My Step Kid''z.Janellyn is on the Straight A+ Honor Roll in the 6th Grade, but is reading/writing at a high school Senior level already. She also enjoys art, biking, drawing, fashion design, fight training, journaling, karaoke, piano, reading, spending time with her BFF and swimming in her spare time.::Howard Y. Woo', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Janellyn Woo');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3761814', 'Trevor Zhou is an actor and director, known for The Sitter (2011), The Waltz (2015) and Control (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Trevor Zhou');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4332852', 'Ron Zill is an actor, known for Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice (2016), Freaky Deaky (2012) and Have a Little Faith (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ron Zill');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0703028', 'The identical twin Brothers Quay (the other being Timothy) were born near Philadelphia in a town with a large European immigrant population, which fuelled their interest in European (especially Eastern European) culture. They moved to London in the late 1960s to study at the Royal College of Art where they made their first short films (now lost), and after spending some time in Holland in the 1970s they returned to London to team up with fellow RCA alumnus Keith Griffiths who would act as producer on all their subsequent films. They spent the 1980s making TV commercials (Honeywell, Walkers Crisps, Dulux Wood Protection) and music videos (most famously, part of Peter Gabriel''s ''Sledgehammer'') in order to support their personal projects, mostly based around their trademark puppet animation and typically drawing on obscure literary sources (Bruno Schulz, Robert Walser Michel de Ghelderode). 1995 saw the premiere of their first feature, the almost entirely live-action (but still distinctively Quayesque) ''Institute Benjamenta''.::Michael Brooke <michael@everyman.demon.co.uk>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Stephen Quay');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0703029', 'The identical twin Brothers Quay (the other being Stephen) were born near Philadelphia in a town with a large European immigrant population, which fuelled their interest in European (especially Eastern European) culture. They moved to London in the late 1960s to study at the Royal College of Art where they made their first short films (now lost), and after spending some time in Holland in the 1970s they returned to London to team up with fellow RCA alumnus Keith Griffiths who would act as producer on all their subsequent films. They spent the 1980s making TV commercials (Honeywell, Walkers Crisps, Dulux Wood Protection) and music videos (most famously, part of Peter Gabriel''s ''Sledgehammer'') in order to support their personal projects, mostly based around their trademark puppet animation and typically drawing on obscure literary sources (Bruno Schulz, Robert Walser Michel de Ghelderode). 1995 saw the premiere of their first feature, the almost entirely live-action (but still distinctively Quayesque) ''Institute Benjamenta''.::Michael Brooke <michael@everyman.demon.co.uk>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Timothy Quay');
