INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4427785', 'Samuel Caruana (pronounced Car-OOO-One-Ah) is best known for the role that got him his SAG card, " Sheldon " a New York City bad boy , who confronts " Riley Matthews " (Rowan Blanchard) , " Maya Hart " (Sabrina Carpenter) and " Farkel Minkus " ( Corey Fogelmanis ) in a New York City subway station in the ABC/Disney series Girl Meets World, episode " Girl Meets Farkle''s Choice " . Samuel hasn''t limited his acting performances to Girl Meets World. He''s portrayed characters on Fox Shortcoms directed by Rusty Cundieff starring Anjelah Johnson as well as the Primetime ABC series The Neighbors, Executive Produced by Dan Fogelman (Executive Producer of the hit series , " This Is Us " ) . Samuel has garnered starring roles in films like the acclaimed " Kickstart Theft " with Vilmos Zsigmond ( Oscar winner Close Encounters of the Third Kind) and strong supporting roles in films like " C-U-R-E " directed by Matty Rich ( Straight Out Of Brooklyn) and the soon to be released " Previous Man " directed by Sean O''Connor. Samuel has worked on the New York stage " Balm in Gilead Brooklyn 2011 " produced by Beau Willimon , starring Michael Shannon and on the Los Angeles stage " Graduating 5th Grade " directed by Debbie Allen , starring Traci Ellis Ross. Samuel can also be seen as a principal actor in National commercials. English is his first language but Samuel is comfortable with dialects and accents. Southern Memphis and Arabic are just two. Samuel is a multifaceted actor who can easily portray the post apocalyptic teen or the most gentle version of an upper class teenager. His comedy chops lead Samuel to easily merge prat-falls and improvisation with ease. Samuel''s deeply resonant voice and small frame has many comparing him to the late recording artist, Prince. Born in Paterson New Jersey, into a family with deep roots in the music business, Samuel reads and writes music and has spent his life frequenting some of the most iconic recording studios in the United States. He has had the unique opportunity to glean musical knowledge from many stars of the music world. Samuel began playing soprano saxophone at age five. At age seven, Samuel became the youngest member of the New York Jazz Academy Junior Jazz band. Samuel has recently added guitar to his musical arsenal. A lover of both music and acting, Samuel has had the opportunity to merge both; by portraying lead characters in music videos by : Aloe Blacc , Mac Miller and a recurring lead character in four out of eleven music videos by the rock band Fall Out Boy for their " Save Rock and Roll " album, as well as Fall Out Boy''s critically acclaimed long form video/film " The Young Blood Chronicles " . Grounded , Samuel is an old soul, mature beyond his years. He is serious and very observant, known to be quiet but not shy and a really good listener. Samuel is a voracious student and athlete who continues to do and seek ways to uplift others in the world around him, confessing , " It''s who you are inside that matters ".::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Samuel Caruana');
