INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2398971', 'Ryan Clark was born on October 12, 1979 in Marrero, Louisiana, USA as Ryan Terry Clark. He is an actor, known for Mike & Mike (2005), Super Bowl XLIII (2009) and Super Bowl XLV (2011). He has been married to Yonka Clark since 2004. They have three children.::Anonymous', 'Ryan Terry', 'Clark', '1979-10-12', NULL, 'Ryan Clark');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7425291', 'Born and raised in South Bend,IN, Ryan was always finding ways to stay busy. Having dreams of becoming a professional athlete early in his childhood , all the way thru college he never gave in. Until the day, when he was cast in his first theater show he never realized that he had so much more of a passion for the arts than the diamond. After 5 years working in multiple job fields, he enrolled back in college and has never looked back.. He graduated from college in 2014 with a degree in Performance. Also, Ryan has studied and spent time working on his craft in London, UK mostly working on European approaches to text and movement techniques at the exquisite Royal Academy of Dramatic Art. Now residing in Los Angeles, CA. He devotes his hard work ethic and performances on screen to his supporters and everyone who has sacrificed so much for him to have this opportunity and gift to be a performer.::Ryan Hafron', NULL, NULL, '1982-07-13', NULL, 'Ryan Hafron');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2414250', 'Carl Clemons is an American actor based out of Pittsburgh Pa. Clemons credits his career to God, as well as Pittsburgh based casting director Nancy Mosser of Nancy Mosser Casting who helped him get started. Carl is mostly known for his role on Season 4 of HBO''s "The Wire" where he got shot in the rear end during a robbery with Method Mans character alongside Michael K Williams known as Omar. Carl has been fortunate in his career working alongside veterans such as Christian Bale, Tyrese Gibson, Jake Gyllenhaal, Wesley Snipes, among others. Carl grew up in poverty, in the streets of Wilkinsburg Pa, a Pittsburgh borough surrounded by crime! In Carl''s words, in life you can choose to be apart of the problem or part of the solution, I chose the solution! His goal is to show the underdogs like him self there is a way out & bring films to his community & other poverty stricken areas of Pittsburgh, and providing hope for those who are lost. All his life, he has been the under dog, both personally & professionally, quitting is never an option, he says, he "welcomes adversity" as it makes him "stronger"!! Carl has overcome numerous obstacles in life, while seeing friends die and imprisoned engulfed in the environment around him it changed his mentality. I''m blessed to have a beautiful daughter named Camarra,I pray I always can motivate her in life to have what I didn''t Carl says. My mom Barbara Clemons, and Grandma Arbeulah Clemons raised me alone, we were very poor, yet rich within. I look to show my daughter what having a father is all about. To know someone professionally, is to know them personally, thanks for taking time to read this. #ActorGang #TeamMakeYourDreamsChaseYou "You can show someone a path in life, the clarity of that path depends upon their vision"::No name', NULL, NULL, '1979-03-06', NULL, 'Carl Clemons');
