INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2969753', 'Justin Michael Woods was born on April 16, 1988 in Bayonne, New Jersey, USA. He is an actor and producer, known for Sully (2016), The Dark Knight Rises (2012) and New Year''s Eve (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, '1988-04-16', NULL, 'Justin Michael Woods');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0947166', 'Jason Yee is an actor, director and producer who transitioned from an acclaimed career as a professional martial artist. He was born and raised in Boston''s inner city by his single mom and grandparents. In his early 20s Jason won numerous martial arts championships and became the first American to medal at the First World San-Shou Free-Fighting Championship in Beijing, China.Simultaneously a fighter and an artist, Jason attended classes at The School of the Museum of Fine Arts in Boston & Mass. College of Art where he also studied filmmaking & illustration. Off the strength of his martial arts career, Jason opened his kickboxing school, which he ran during his twenties. His success allowed him the time to develop his artistic side. Jason bought his own 16mm cameras, shot several short films and started his acting training at Collinge-Pickman in Harvard Square.In 2001, Jason wrote, directed and starred in his first feature film, DARK ASSASSIN, which was shot on shoe-string budget on 16mm cameras. When the film was picked up for distribution in 2005 Jason took a leap of faith, turned his Kickboxing school over to his students and moved to Los Angeles to become a full-time actor and filmmaker. Jason''s second starring role in THE GIRL FROM THE NAKED EYE earned him a Best Actor nomination at The Hoboken International Film Festival. Jason has appeared in TV pilots for Nickelodeon, TNT and in several independent films. Jason continues to produce, direct & hone his acting craft with several acting groups in the LA area. Jason credits his work ethic to his working class upbringing and the discipline he developed in martial arts.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, '1970-11-04', NULL, 'Jason Yee');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4087886', 'Nikolay Yeriomin was born on June 15, 1992 in Jerusalem, Israel as Nikolay Borisovich Yeryomin. He is known for his work on The Dark Knight Rises (2012), Crudely Written Communal Fiction and Mindeath.::Anonymous', 'Nikolay Borisovich', 'Yeryomin', '1992-06-15', NULL, 'Nikolay Yeriomin');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2803524', 'Maria Zambrana is known for her work on The Dark Knight Rises (2012), Iron Man 2 (2010) and Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull (2008).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Maria Zambrana');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7009344', 'Billy Zhao is known for his work on The Dark Knight Rises (2012), Ghost Source Zero (2017) and Wall Street: Money Never Sleeps (2010).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Billy Zhao');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6542900', 'Starting October, 2015 through Spring 2016--playing Harry in the National Tour of Flashdance, the Musical.David started his love of performing at an early age having taken ballet and tap from age 5-7. In the 7th grade, David had the lead in the school play, but ended up acquiescing the role after dealing with a bout of Mono. His high school girlfriend talked him into getting back into school plays after dealing with personal issues stemming from his parents getting divorced among other things. His sophomore performance was in "Up the Down Staircase". There was no looking back after that. While there were some breaks in performing while getting a Bachelor''s degree in Math Education from Purdue University in 1995. In 1996, he was able to get back into performance with ComedySportz--Milwaukee. From there, David spent 8 years (1998-2006) at the Racine Theatre Guild performing in several shows and helping crew several more while working as a Deputy Sheriff in Racine County, Wisconsin during the same time. David moved to Mineral, VA in 2006 after he married the love of his life, Andrea, who allowed him to pursue acting full time which included obtaining an MFA in Theatre from Virginia Commonwealth University, 2012. David spent the summers of 2012 and 2013 traveling up and down the east coast for auditions. In March, 2014, David moved to NYC to give acting a full time shot.::David T Zimmerman', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'David T. Zimmerman');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0919952', 'Shannon Welles is known for her work on Inception (2010), Forces of Nature (1999) and Freaks of Nature (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Shannon Welles');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4466210', 'John was born and raised in Queens New York in 1965. He joined the New York Police Department in 1990, rising to the rank of Lieutenant before retiring in 2010. While considering career options, he tried his hand at work as an extra in movies, where he realized that Acting was the Career he wanted.::John Zion', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'John Zion');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0700445', 'Born and raised in Columbus, Ohio, Nicole knew from a very young age that she wanted to pursue a career as a performer. To that end, she participated in several school productions while growing up, and completed numerous acting classes throughout her life. She started out slowly by taking on modeling and commercial gigs in her native Ohio, and eventually worked up the courage to move out to Hollywood. Living bi-coastal between NYC and LA, Nicole began the tedious process of auditioning. She quickly landed small roles in films and television and has been a working actress ever since.::Midwest Talent Management', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nicole Pulliam');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3462529', 'Peter Basham is an actor, known for Inception (2010), Skyfall (2012) and World War Z (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Peter Basham');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2900021', 'Alex Ziwak was born in New Haven, Connecticut and has been featured in commercials, films and television. Ziwak has worked regularly on the CBS crime drama Blue Bloods, and also appears in television series such as Gotham, Person of Interest and Law and Order. He also has appeared in several full length feature films including John Wick, The Equalizer, and Run All Night.Ziwak is an accomplished martial artist, who began is formal training in the art of Tae Kwon Do at the age of 10. Under the instruction of Grandmaster Yi (Lee), Grandmaster Suk Jun Kim and Grandmaster Hee Il Cho. Mr. Ziwak has attained his current ranking of 8th Dan Black Belt. He owns and operates Ziwak''s martial Arts in Hamden Connecticut.Ziwak has been featured in projects alongside James Gandolfini (The Drop) Liam Neeson (Run All Night, A Walk Among the Tombstones), and Ray Liotta (Pawn).Ziwak''s prominent cheek bones, pale complexion, and dark hair distinguish him well as a villain, but his versatility as a actor has afforded him roles outside that genre. Ziwak also was a lead singer in a local band in Connecticut.::Penny Aicardi', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Alex Ziwak');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2573812', 'Rafael Zubizarreta Jr.(known affectionately by his friends as "Raf") is of Cuban and Mexican descent. Rafael''s father (born and raised in Cuba) spent over 20 years in the United States army and is a Vietnam Veteran. The military life gave Rafael and his family the opportunity to travel around the world a great deal. Among all his travels, Rafael most enjoyed spending several years in Germany.Like most successful actors, Rafael was bit by the acting bug when he was very young. Throughout his childhood, he and his friends would put on skits for anyone who would watch. At the age of 19, Rafael began seriously studying acting in local community theaters as well as studying under several acting teachers, including established acting coach Susan Grace Cohen of the Lee Strasberg Theatre Institute in New York City. Being cast in major stage roles quickly followed. Rafael has taken on a wide range of roles on various stages around the country. Some shows which include: "The King and I", "Over the River and Through the Woods", "Halfway There", "Oklahoma", "A Perfect Wedding", "Nice Guys Finish", and "Barefoot In The Park" among many others. Rafael made his west coast stage debut in 2011 when he appeared in North Hollywood as Joe Connelly in the zombie horror show of "The Revenants".While continuing his acting career on major stages, Rafael has been recruited by Hollywood. He has appeared on television in critically-acclaimed shows as well as blockbuster and indie films, with starring roles in the 2013 Indie Fest USA award winning feature "Mobster", as well as the 2013 Directors Guild of America award winning short "For The Birds".Although success in Hollywood is coming quickly for Rafael, it has been based on a lot of time paying his dues and honing his acting skills in the theater all across the country, including Off Broadway in New York City. This experience is what gives his performances such depth. Rafael lives near Los Angeles with his wife, young son, and daughter.::Andy Crash Kelly', NULL, NULL, '1981-04-02', NULL, 'Rafael Zubizarreta');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0015997', 'Zakaria Alaoui is a producer and production manager, known for Inception (2010), The Bourne Ultimatum (2007) and Gladiator (2000).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Zakaria Alaoui');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0109103', 'Chris Brigham is a producer and production manager, known for Inception (2010), Shutter Island (2010) and Argo (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chris Brigham');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0371669', 'Thomas Hayslip is a production manager and producer, known for Jurassic World: Fallen Kingdom (2018), Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 2 (2017) and Mission: Impossible - Rogue Nation (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Thomas Hayslip');
