INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2554469', 'John Ceallach was born 18 February 1972 in Biloxi, Mississippi. John Ceallach''s father was a Boston, Massachusetts native and his mother was from the Biloxi, Mississippi area (Pass Christian). He had small roles in films and TV as a child and teenager. John attended college for short time, before enlisting in the US Navy as a Hospital Corpsman (Naval medical corps). He served alongside the Navy and the US Marines during the Gulf War era. John left military active duty a few years later, transferred to reserve military and went on to work in state and local law enforcement while completing his college degree.In 2001 while working as a State Police officer, he was selected for a national television show with the ABC television network. However, it was canceled at the time of the September 11th attacks. In response to the pending war, he switched to the US Army Reserve (U.S. Army Civil Affairs & Psychological Operations Command). He served in Iraq and other places as a US Soldier and later as a US Govt. protective service officer (Contracted) with the Department of Defense for several years.He returned to the United States to work as military tactics and warfare instructor near Los Angeles that gave him the chance to pursue his goals in the entertainment industry using prior gained skills to work as a writer, actor and military advisor for film and television.::NoBody@gmail.com', 'John Robert Actis', 'II', '1972-02-18', NULL, 'John Ceallach');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0189162', 'Garvin Cross is known for his work on Revenant - Redivivo (2015), Inception (2010) and Fantastic Four (2005).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garvin Cross');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3769592', 'Born and raised in Los Angeles, California - straight out of General Hospital. At the age of 10, I was diagnosed with Alopecia Areata (Baldness). It made me who I am today. When I attended Citrus College, I became an avid tennis player, and when I attended Cal State L.A. I entered into Criminal Justice for a year and a half, and left it because I was hired by Wells Fargo Bank and my tenure was 17 years. Next in line of experience is working for the U.S. Postal Service, as a Mail Carrier for 5 years. In 1992 I also worked for the City of Hope, and the following year I acquired my Real Estate License which is current today. I managed to take care of my parents and purchase a house for myself and for them to live with me till they passed on. I enjoy genuine sincere people and love to have conversations about entertaining subjects.::Youlanda Davis', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Youlanda Davis');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1994157', 'Julie Eagleton is an actress and producer, known for Miss Peregrine''s Home for Peculiar Children (2016), Maleficent (2014) and Fury (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Julie Eagleton');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4131076', 'Stage and screen actor, musician, comedian and designer, Esposito has excelled at most all of the arts. Bronx born, he graduated Fordham University with a Bachelor of Science degree in Psychology and Communications. He then rejected his acceptance to New York University Law School to pursue his dream, a career in the arts.Although he attained success as a brand building package designer and strategist, both for corporations such as Playtex and Kraft Foods as well as for his own businesses, formerly Bronz-Esposito Design and currently Zunda Group, LLC, his true passion has all been the performing arts.::GME', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Seve Esposito');
