INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5147126', 'Eric Frank was born March 5th 1977 in Canton Ohio. He is originally known for his work as the singer songwriter and guitarist of Religion Against Religion that was formed in late 1997. The band often works on new material in the studio to the present day. He also was the singer for the band Fire Breathing Bear from 2009 - 2011. In 2011 Eric got his first acting roles in Falling Backwads and The Avengers. Eric Frank is the Father of actors Clay Frank and Jace Frank.::DLL Productions', NULL, NULL, '1977-03-05', NULL, 'Eric Frank');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5115715', 'Kirby Burgess is an actress, known for Il grande Gatsby (2013), Jack & Jill (2012) and The Scrying.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kirby Burgess');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7602518', 'Jace Frank is an actor, known for In Search of Fellini (2016), which was his 1st movie production on September 20th 2015. He is the youngest son of Actor/Musician Eric Frank (Avengers, Promised Land, Underdogs) bands (Religion Against Religion, Fire Breathing Bear) and the brother of Actor Clay Frank (The Bronze). Jace was born June 21st 2007.::Eric Frank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jace Frank');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2706291', 'Logan Fry was born William Logan Fry in Columbus, Ohio in September, 1944. The son of a Federal Administrative Law Judge and an elementary school teacher, he graduated from Oberlin College in 1967 and Case Western University Law School in 1970, concurrently serving in Artillery, then Judge Advocate General, units of the United States Army Reserve. In addition to reserve duty, Logan earned his tuition by working on the family Christmas tree farm near Akron, Ohio, as a janitorial assistant in a rubber company research lab, a shipping and receiving clerk in a light fixture factory, a rake and shovel man for a landscaping company, a food runner in the college dining hall and a night bellman at the local Holiday Inn.Acting wasn''t even a wayward thought in his early years; and his first career was as attorney serving successively in the Law Department of the City of Cleveland, Antitrust Division of the United States Department of Justice, The Goodyear Tire & Rubber Company, Goodyear Atomic Corporation (which operated the Piketon uranium enrichment plant) and private practice. He retired in 1987 to become a world-class weaver, and an artist, writer and web designer. Logan has traveled the world, from active war zones in the Middle East to the brothels of Amsterdam and San Francisco.Acting was a fluke, an opportunity that presented itself when Spider-Man 3 (2007) came to Cleveland, Ohio. Logan was hired on as a precision driver for scenes with Sandman attempting his escape from Spider-Man in an armored truck. Although he had no formal training, he was hooked. Since then, he has done background work in major studio films projects like I Am Legend (2007), Taking Chance (2009), Real Steel (2011), Oz the Great and Powerful (2013) and Gotham (2014); as well as event participant, soldier, zombie or undead in regional independent film. Background in major film built knowledge--the opportunity to see the greatest directors and actors at work; while featured work in indies like Death of the Dead (2011), 25 Hill (2011) and Revenge of the Spacemen (2014) provided confidence in speaking roles.More recently, Logan has undertaken the production and direction of his own film, starting with micro-short film, and proceeding into short feature, often performing every role and task of the filmmaking process. Success has come swiftly, and his films have screened not only in his home state of Ohio, but also such venues as NYC, Fargo, ND and Muskogee, MO. He counts Robert Rodriguez as a primary inspiration: ferocious self-confidence, independence and resourcefulness. Necessary qualities for the independent filmmaker.A note on stunts: Logan is primarily an actor, not a stunt actor. Where stunts are shown in filmography, it is where Logan has performed his own stunts, instead of relying on a stunt extra. In Spider-Man 3 (2007), he was both a precision driver and pedestrian background; in Death of the Dead (2011) and Zombie Apocalypse: Redemption (2011), he took his own hits and falls; and in Bunker of Blood (2011), he had his first introduction to the use of squibs. All clearly stunt work, but not his primary role in each of these films. They represent a way, instead, of bringing more complexity to each his characters.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Logan Fry');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8536682', 'Bert Gliatta Jr. is an actor, known for Gene Pool, Unbreakable Faith (2017) and White Boy Rick (2018).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bert Gliatta Jr.');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5379412', 'David Neil Gragg was born on November 16, 1951 in Morgantown, West Virginia. He is the second oldest of six boys born to Neil Gragg and Nellie Rennie, who is a distant relative of British Actor Michael Rennie. David was raised in NE Ohio where he currently resides with his wife and family.David''s early experience as a performer was as a keyboard player in several bands. A published writer and lecturer, he graduated from The University of Toledo College of Pharmacy in 1976. He has since received subsequent degrees and fellowships from The Weatherhead Schoool of Business , Virginia Commonwealth University and the University of North Carolina.His first appearance in a major film was in The Avengers , where he appeared as an Art Dealer/Museum Patron. He has since appeared in films and television series as coaches, doctors, detectives and public officials.David has trained at The Houde School of Acting.::David Neil Gragg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'David Gragg');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8430720', 'Beshoy was born and raised in Egypt, moved to the U.S. when he was 14 to study Medicine and continue to strive in the Film industry. His love and passion for acting is endless, Mean while, he is a man of all trades; likes to build things, draw, play sports, write and direct. His dream is to be a star one day and live everyday doing what he loves.::truth known', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Beshoy Hanna');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0577560', 'Christopher Meledandri is a producer, known for Despicable Me (2010), Ice Age (2002) and Despicable Me 2 (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Christopher Meledandri');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4953206', 'Denny Hazen, aka: Blazin Hazen, was born in Louisville, Ohio. He grew up in the television production field. Denny earned a Degree in Journalism and Mass Communications from Kent State University. Denny works professionally on both sides of the camera. He has been Talent for Network Television and Major Motion Pictures, as well as, being a Producer and Videographer. Denny became an Internet Sensation when a video that he produced, Average Homeboy, went viral on YouTube.::Ray Hazen', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Denny Hazen');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7692603', 'Dominique N. Henderson is a 25 year old East Cleveland, OH native! Father of 1 (Ava Henderson) with Jasmine Longmire. He graduated From Bedford Highschool in 2009 and attended the university of Toledo the same year, he soon realized college wasn''t the route he felt in his soul he should be taking. Dominique got his start in acting back in 2010 when him and two cousins of his found out about a casting call for the first avengers movie which was filmed in parts of downtown Cleveland. After standing in line for 5 hours in 90 degree weather to be seen for 3 minutes, Dominique was chosen to be an extra on set for the course of 2 weeks. In that period of time he fell in love with the entire process of creating a film and knew it was something he wanted to pursue further. It''s was then that he started to get active in Cleveland''s emerging film scene, picking up all the extra work he could in order to understand the ins and outs of a actual Hollywood set and understand the nuances of working with different talent and people. Dominique also used this as an opportunity for networking and it was this way that he learned of Angela Boehm and her casting agency. Angela provided Dominique with steady work to help him move up in his rank and get out of the "extra" mindset and fulfilling larger duties on sets, such as stand in and even some minor principle roles. Through this network Dominique was able to meet and work with others looking for talent and able to start putting together a meaningful resume and got his first taste of SAG work. Dominique decided to attend classes at the House School of acting in order to try to improve on his acting by learning specific techniques in hopes of taking everything further. It was here he got lessons on Meisner, Scrip study, Improve, & On-screen Audition which all added elements he previously lacked. Once Dominique had a decent Resume and demo put together he decided to follow his dream and go full time with his acting and cut his safety net which was his full time job at Key Bank.Doiminique''s story is still being written!::Dominique N Henderson', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dominique Henderson');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6854023', 'Born in January of 1989 in the small town of Wakeman, Ohio, Tara Olivia Horvath has always had the singular dream of becoming an actress. Her inspiration came from her parents'' obsession with Marilyn Monroe, Elvis Presley, and the singular 1970s art form: Disco dancing. There wasn''t a day in the Horvath household that Tara didn''t hear an Elvis record spinning on her parents'' hi-fi or watching her dad dance to Michael Jackson or Prince.Spending summers in Tennessee at her family reunion escalated her love for art even more, as they would be very lively and full of both music & dancing. Her mom bought an ungainly ''90s video camera for Christmas 1993 and from then on, Tara was hooked.Earlier in life, Tara overcame several adversities: Cancer, the loss of both of her grandparents, and her father''s death in 2012 gave her strength and endurance. Art has been her outlet, her passion, and her savior.Her passion for film has grown over the last several years; she has done many independent films and short film productions all over the state of Ohio.Recently, she delved into modeling and has been internationally published through David Ford Eyewear and Beyond Curves Magazine. Doubling as a promotional model at large events supporting such diverse topics as childhood cancer, sled hockey, and "Feed America," Tara has become recognized as a multi-talented individual. She most recently had the opportunity to be featured in an episode of the national television show Outsiders, and major motion picture productions such as Cleveland Abduction, My Friend Dahmer, and Red Acquisition, which showcased her burgeoning range as an actress.Tara''s hobbies include exploring nature, spending time with her family, traveling, painting, and lounging around her house relaxing while watching YouTube videos!She is always looking for new projects.A true Ohio original; this girl is never giving up!::Brian Lumley', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tara O. Horvath');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7789761', 'Steven Hudson was born on March 11, 1977 in Chicago, Illinois, USA. He is an actor and producer, known for Tales of Poe (2014), Our Bloody Hallows Eve (2017) and Animal (2017). He has been married to Cynthia Hudson since April 21, 2007.::Anonymous', 'Steven', 'Hudson', '1977-03-11', NULL, 'Steven Hudson');
