INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5418959', 'Shea made a television appearance on The Today Show while still in the womb. At the age of 1, she was hired as the back up baby for the Jimmy Fallon Capital One commercials. She was not called in front of the camera, however, until the age of 2 when she landed the role of Skylar (2 years) in Martin Scorcese''s The Wolf of Wall Street. She has a successful modeling career having worked for Huggies, Osh Kosh, and Macy''s to name a few. She enjoys dancing in front of her church on Sundays, and occasionally, mommy lets her storm the stage for a post service performance, which as of late, has been Annie''s "Tomorrow". She lives in Connecticut with her mom, dad, older brother & sister, and her #1 pal, Winnie The Pooh.::Danielle Coleman', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Shea Coleman');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5338034', 'Giselle Eisenberg has quickly become one of film and television''s most sought after young actors, impressively segueing between comedy and drama on both the big and small screens. Giselle currently stars as sassy, spunky, "tell-it-like-it-is", Sophia Hughes in CBS''s hit comedy "LIFE IN PIECES".Giselle made her feature film debut at just 5 years old as daughter to Leonardo DiCaprio & Margot Robbie in "THE WOLF OF WALL STREET" (2013) directed by Martin Scorsese. Following this impressive start, she received rave reviews for her leading role of "Hope Donnelly" opposite Al Pacino, Jennifer Garner and Bobby Cannavale in "DANNY COLLINS", written and directed by Dan Fogelman. Critics said her performance as granddaughter to Mr. Pacino "offers one of the screen''s most convincing portrayals of a kid with ADHD." They continued, she''s "a child actor but a miracle of one; she''s got comic-timing, makes funny faces and has real chemistry with Pacino." She "steals every scene she is in" and is "the film''s biggest treat".Giselle''s all-star experience continued in the critically acclaimed drama "A MOST VIOLENT YEAR" as youngest daughter to Jessica Chastain & Oscar Isaac, and in the hilarious comedy "SEX TAPE" as daughter to Cameron Diaz and Jason Segel. This holiday season, Giselle stars as "Gracie Foster" in "I''LL BE HOME FOR CHRISTMAS" alongside James Brolin and Mena Suvari.Additional television credits include: Guest Starring Roles in the award-winning STARZ drama series "FLESH & BONE" (recurring) as well as NBC''s "LAW & ORDER SVU" and "BELIEVE" (recurring) as the lead''s younger self - Young Bo Adams. Giselle has also lent her comedic skills to several national commercials for brands such as Kraft Mac & Cheese and Cheerios.Her first audition was for Holiday Inn and included eating a jelly donut and telling a joke. She got the part! Giselle was born in Poughkeepsie, NY. Her role on LIFE IN PIECES means splitting her time between Los Angeles and New Paltz, NY in the beautiful Hudson Valley. She loves swimming, skiing, rock-climbing, painting and enjoys playing the Cordoba guitar given to her as a gift from her "LIFE IN PIECES" & "I''LL BE HOME FOR CHRISTMAS" grandpa, James Brolin.Giselle credits her introduction to acting to her older sister, Julia.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Giselle Eisenberg');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5425819', 'Ariela''s first recording endeavor was in pre-school and she has never looked back. A Florida native, she participated in over 50 theatrical productions before moving to New York- including a two-time stint at Broadway Theatre Project and Broadway Across America''s Class Act. She got her BA in the Theatre program at UCF , graduated early, and moved to NYC where she immediately booked the lead in a national tour. Since then, she has worked on numerous voice overs, commercial, and TV projects for MTV, Food Network, Oxygen and many more. You can see her on upcoming episodes of Oxygen''s Cinematherapy, Bio''s Celebrity Ghost Stories, and the feature film The Wolf of Wall Street. Proud member SAG/AFTRA, AEA.::ariela arnon', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ariela Arnon');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5272722', 'Jordan Asinofsky is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Person of Interest (2011) and Moving In (2010).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jordan Asinofsky');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1913158', 'Sean Velie is an actor, known for Horrors of War (2006), Johnny Appleweed (2008) and The Bag (2006).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sean Velie');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2655834', 'Tough, compelling characters are no stranger to this Ukrainian born Actor. Deema is attracted to the darker, grittier side of life. His Film debut this spring 2015 will come in the form of Travis, the young bully in "The Sisterhood of Night" a modern-day Salem witch trial directed by Caryn Waechter (2014 Woodstock Film Festival Winner "Best Director") and starring Georgie Henley (Narnia) and Kara Heyward (Moonrise Kingdom). Deema will also be seen in "Stealing Cars" (2015) with John Leguizamo, William H. Macy and Emory Cohen as Earl The Skinhead. He made his Off-Broadway theatre Debut in David Rabe''s "Early History of Fire" at The New Group directed by Jo Bonney. His other Film credits include Martin Scorsese''s The Wolf Of Wall Street, Yelling At the Sky, August Rush and several Shorts: Thanksgiving Break, Eggs and Soldiers (Imelda O''Reilly, director), The Good Boy (2015), Little Shadow (2013 London Shorts Festival and BAFTA short list), Immaculate Reception (Official Selection 2014 Sundance Film Festival Shorts Program) and Rattlefly. His TV credits include: a recurring role on Season 5 of Royal Pains as Slack, Law & Order, and the Naked Brothers Band. Deema was born in Kiev, and moved to the US when he was 8 Years old. He''s bilingual English and Russian and when not acting is a drummer in a metal band based out of New Jersey.::C. Anthony', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Deema Aitken');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1488410', 'Ashley Springer is an actor and producer, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Teeth (2007) and The Visitor (2007).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ashley Springer');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5370181', 'Justin Anthony Long is an actor and director, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), City of Dreams (2012) and Dr & Dr (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Justin Anthony Long');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4432729', 'Gregory Perri is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Not Fade Away (2012) and Bastards of Young (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gregory Perri');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5317813', 'Viki Boyle is an actress, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and The Leftovers (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Viki Boyle');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0129651', 'Chris Caldovino was born in Brooklyn, NY. He began his acting studies in NYC at The Gene Frankel Theater. Chris subsequently moved to Los Angeles and quickly began building his body of work in film and TV, while continuing to study at Playhouse West under Jeff Goldblum. Chris later studied under Robert D''Avanzo at The Tamarind Theater, where he performed in a multitude of stage productions. In 2004 Chris booked the recurring role of Billy Leotardo, in HBO''s "The Sopranos". Chris went on to book many more roles on TV and film, including FOX''s "The Good Guys", and the film "Brooklyn Rules" with Alec Baldwin. Chris has had roles in Martin Scorsese''s Oscar-nominated film "The Wolf Of Wall Street", and the film "Stealing Cars" produced by Oscar-nominee Rachel Winter of "Dallas Buyers Club". In 2015 Chris finished up a three-season stint as Tonino Sandrelli on HBO''s "Boardwalk Empire", for which he received a SAG-nomination for ensemble cast. As of late Chris has appeared on network episodic TV, and has series regular roles in two pilots currently in post-production including "Dirty Dead Con Men", and "Confessions of a Hollywood Bartender".::ZTPR', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chris Caldovino');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4863188', 'Marcos Gonzalez was born in the Dominican Republic. On his 10th birthday his family brought him to America to join them. He was raised in New York''s Spanish Harlem and heavily immersed in the culture and lifestyle of the Hispanic heritage there. He first started acting at a very young age in school plays and enjoyed it.Then he found music and shifted his focus - playing many percussion instruments with many Latin rhythms that enable his collaboration with salsa and merengue bands. Later, he discovered a talent for the guitar and piano and immediately began collaborating with a Spanish rock band and also began songwriting in many different types of music, especially ballads and Spanish rock. He does love performing in front of an audience (live or virtual).Ten years ago, he was introduced once again into acting and rediscovered his true passion for the art. He has been focusing on film and television, though he also hopes to expand into theater as well. He performs in both Spanish and English easily. He joined SAG in 2011. HE has played principal roles on "The Wolf of Wall Street", "About Ray", and "Goodtimes", and has worked on most of the television shows shot in NYC during 2010 and 2015&16. He has also made several appearances on CNN''s "The Hunt with John Walsh", leading in one episode, and on The Discovery Channel''s "Scorned, Love Kills", "Evil Eye" and recently played the lead in an episode of "I, Witness". He collaborated with director Baz Luhrmann on Netflix''s "The Getdown" He has played a variety of roles including secret service men, detectives, policemen, EMTs, janitors, bodyguards, reporters, lawyers, doctors and fathers. His ethnic appearance allows him not only to play Hispanic roles, but also Italian, Middle Eastern, and Caucasian.He is extremely professional and serious about his work. He enjoys working with teams of fellow actors & crew and does his part to make the work both enjoyable and successful.::Trish Voelkel, FabTalentNYC', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Marcos A. Gonzalez');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5670245', 'Chris Matesevac is known for his work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Lovestruck: The Musical (2013) and Inside Amy Schumer (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chris Matesevac');
