INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8218359', 'Jesse Michael Fullington was born in Humboldt, Tennessee, and grew up in a small community in Lavinia, Tennessee. He was raised by his parents, Hope Leann Fullington, a nurse, and father Timothy Alllen Fullington, a local business owner.Jesse attended West Carroll Jr./ Sr. High School and graduated in 2009. He went on to join the Tennessee Army National Guard during his Junior year of school, and served 7 years in, going on one military deployment to the Middle East. He attended both the Art Institute in Nashville for Photography, and Bethel University in Tennessee, where he received a Bachlor''s in Criminal Justice. His acting career started in the summer of 2011, when while on vacation in Florida, was presented the opportunity to appear as an extra on Transformers: Dark Side of the Moon. Where he adopted the Persona of Felix, to keep unknown. Since then, he performed locally both on and off screen, in local productions, but went quite around early 2014, then moved to Nashville, TN.He resurfaced back into the public spotlight in the late part of 2015 an extra in Star Wars: The Force Awakens.He is very involved within the Indie Game Developer community and different social media circles, both as a tester and reviewing the games for the studios for promotion. He is also a member of the Libertarian Party, and acts as both a journalist, social media manager, and an interviewer.::nostalgiacritic', 'Jesse Michael', 'Fullington', '1991-01-19', NULL, 'Jesse Michael Fullington');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5135001', 'Steve Garfanti was most recently starring as Rodrigo Rameriz in "Mi America" a feature film. Other credits include: Al Capone''s Body Guard in Boardwalk Empire; Surgeon in "The Knick"; Mafia Cop Det Steve Caracappa in "Inside the American Mob". Steve has appeared in many Investigation Discovery crime shows playing detectives, perpetrators, and citizens.Steve was born in New York City and lives just north of Manhattan with easy access to the tri-state area for various film and television projects. Upon request he will travel globally.He graduated with a Bachelor of Science degree in Organizational Management from Nyack College (Nyack, NY) and holds an MBA from Cornell University (Ithaca, NY) While contemplating future goals; he decided to pursue a career in acting. Never having formally studied theatre or acting, he enrolled in Weist Barron School and Stellar Adler School, He has done scene study and improv. And has several acting coaches.As an actor, Steve is compelled by dramatic and comedic film, television and commercial projects. He firmly believes in the transformative power and story telling power of the various acting mediums of -- as a social, political, emotional, and humanistic force. Above all, he is committed to a life acting as a means of participating in the artistic dialog that is so vital to the global entertainment business and society.Steve is a team player and will do what it takes to contribute and deliver value to all projects he works on; he is both a collaborator and a creator when performing in this most privileged and noble profession.::Steve Garfanti', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Steve Garfanti');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3345563', 'Ryan Genualdi is an actor and director, known for 10 (2011), The Lady in the Looking Glass (2011) and State of Mind (2007).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ryan Genualdi');
