INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3313144', 'Thomas Raimondo is known for his work on Larkin (2011), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and Anchorman 2: The Legend Continues (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Thomas Raimondo');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3923798', 'Jennifer Rainey is known for her work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Through the Glass and Take Me Home (2010).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jennifer Rainey');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5246417', 'Tanja Givens is an actress, known for Bernie (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tanja Givens');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5245911', 'Glenda Jones is an actress, known for Bernie (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Glenda Jones');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5810131', 'Born in Surrey, England, Matthew began acting at a young age; his mother putting him through weekend classes at the Stage Coach Theatre Arts School for the duration of his early childhood, he would soon bow out a year before receiving his silver ballet shoes to fulfill sporting commitments but upon returning to secondary education, his early training and engagement with performance truly came into play.For the most part of his time at secondary school, improvisation and comedy was a huge part of his life, that is until he starred as Petruchio in The Taming of the Shrew at the Shakespeare Schools Festival. His performance earned him an invitation to audition for the National Youth Theatre of Great Britain. Upon auditioning at fourteen years old, he was unsuccessful however he returned the following year and was accepted into the NYT at fifteen, one of just 250 from 5,000 applicants in the 2012 intake. Following his summer intake course in London he returned home inspired and began seeking out professional acting work.After a string of short films he signed with a prestigious talent agent and began booking commercial work, soon landing a small role in Martin Scorsese''s ''The Wolf Of Wall Street'' and the lead role in award winning British Independent film ''Little Pieces'', a role he secured at just sixteen years old.He soon landed television work including the BBC''s ''Our World War'' and ''Mr Selfridge'', along with a role in British gangster film ''Top Dog''.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, '1996-06-09', NULL, 'Matthew William Jones');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5054903', 'Silvia Kal is an actress and writer, known for Mobile Strike Live Action Trailer (2016), Goya''s Ghosts (2006) and The Wolf of Wall Street (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Silvia Kal');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5373933', 'Adam Kaster is an actor, known for The Hunted: Encore (2016), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and Blind Date (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Adam Kaster');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5015833', 'Brian Kealty was abandoned by his mother or father at the age of eighteen months in a bar in Harlem and spent his childhood in and out of The New York Foundling Hospital (NYC Orphanage / "Annie") being, "tried on for size" by several families and one who eventually "adopted" him for a brief time where his name was legally changed to Brian Pasquale. In Los Angeles, CA in 2011 at the height of his 2007 birthed Outdoor Advertising company, Equity Outdoor Advertising''s success and himself dangling over 150 feet above the ground on a swing stage installing a massive building wrap advertisement for "Guess Jeans" on an LAX adjacent building he received a call from his aunt who informed him that the mother he had never met and that no one could track down for forty years was in fact, a coma in Harlem Hospital in NYC. Brian flew to NYC immediately only for his mother to die three days after spending each day talking to her lifeless body, asking her to come back to consciousness and allow him to take care of her and get to know her. To honor her he took back his original birth name, Brian Kealty and has been since. With no intention of ever being an actor Brian found himself with no choice late in 2012 in NYC. Now an LA native, Brian had invested all of his savings in expanding his business to NYC. Unfortunately, after being conned and embezzled he lost his assets in Los Angeles and found himself with a very expensive East Village apartment, no income, no money, no food, and no job. The only job that was available immediately to him was extra or background work on network television and feature films. He took what was available after spending the previous day on a soup kitchen line in the Lower East Side. After a few days on set he was quickly shoved in to a NYPD, FBI, or any other Law Enforcement Officer''s costume and soon began strand-in, photo-double, and even some stunt work. Brian has had principal roles in Television and Feature films to date and has an intense understanding film and television production absorbed by years of not mistakes allowed pressure by network television''s best cinematographers and director''s like Martin Scorcese. While Brian now lives in LA and would love to work as a principle actor, he will not chase down an agent to compete with the other 1 million that that are auditioning for the same Cop character''s 5 lines that every script has. He is seeking representation realistically while writing a part only he can play.::Brian Kealty', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brian Kealty');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1239796', 'Born in New York City, Allison studied at The Lee Strasberg Film & Theatre Institute & with Wynn Handman. She began her career in NYC Theater & Independent Film. Allison loves animals and actively supports the Humane Society. She''s also involved with Camp Boggy Creak, a camp started by Paul Newman & Bruce Rossmeyer, for seriously ill children.::Webmaster', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Allison Kelly');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1651119', 'Chris Kerson appears next as a series regular in the season two cast of the acclaimed HBO crime drama television series True Detective. He portrays the mesmerizing character "Nails," a survivor of a brutal nail gun attack and loyal company man, to "Frank Semyon" played by Vince Vaughn.He is most recognized for his starring role in Sean Kirkpatrick''s feature film "Cost of a Soul." The independent film opened in 50 theaters nationwide and was the winner of Relativity''s Rogue and AMC''s "The Big Break Movie Contest."Since 2008, Chris has been a lead in 24 films including Thomas Kim''s "The Ride" which was named by Martin Scorsese as the best short film of that year. He played a pivotal supporting role as the villainous drug supplier, Saveno in the New York feature "''Broadway''s Finest" which won awards in numerous film festivals in the metropolitan area. Chris is a lead and an antagonist in Independent Spirit Nominee Tim McCann''s "Zero in the System."Chris has worked off-Broadway in lead roles in such theatre productions as Franz Xaver Kroetz'' play "The Nest" at the Mint Theater, Stephan Morrow''s "Hurry" which had a sold out run at the Blue Heron Art Center. He originated the lead role of "Carl the Usher" in the New York premiere of the recently discovered "These Are the Stairs You Got to Watch" by Tennessee Williams. He starred opposite theater icon Rose Gregorio ("Shadowbox") in Mario Fratti''s "Missionaries", read opposite the legendary Judith Malina (The Living Theater), and was involved in a sold-out, NY Times reviewed, staged reading of Norman Mailer''s "The Deer Park" which Norman Mailer attended and proudly praised.Chris Kerson was born in New York City and raised both in Manhattan and Westchester. He received his degree in Psychology from the College of William and Mary. He has studied acting with some of the best teachers and coaches for stage and film, most notably the renowned teacher and mentor of Al Pacino, Charles Laughton.::Gail Parenteau', 'Christopher Buckley', 'Kerson', NULL, NULL, 'Chris Kerson');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6317513', 'Natasha Key is an actress and composer, known for Growing Up Fisher (2014), Goliath (2016) and THE END: Inside the Last Days of the Obama White House (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Natasha Key');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5109850', 'Alex Korik is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), The Secret Life of Walter Mitty (2013) and Law & Order: Special Victims Unit (1999).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Alex Korik');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5399233', 'David Kubicka is an actor known for The Knick (2014) and The Family Fang (2015). Born in Madison, Wisconsin, David is a graduate of the Stella Adler Conservatory in New York, NY.Prior to coming to New York, he graduated from the University of Colorado at Boulder with a Bachelor of Science in Mechanical Engineering, and was a two-time recipient of the prestigious National Collegiate Inventors and Innovators Alliance (NCIIA) grant. He founded the University of Colorado Snowboarding Team, now the largest team of its kind in the nation. Post graduation, he traveled the country competing on the snowboarding pro circuit, calling the Sierra Nevada of California his home.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'David Kubicka');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5037908', 'George Lalov was born on October 27, 1989 in Bulgaria. He got education in fine arts as a painter and a sculptor. At the age of fourteen he sighed with an acting studio and started studying performing arts. He has been in both plays Shakespeare''s Love''s Labor''s Lost as Biron and Sophocles''s Electra as Orestes. He graduated with a degree in Theatre.::Michael Marks', 'Georgi', 'Lalov', '1989-10-27', NULL, 'George Lalov');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8202671', 'Alec is a New York based comedic actor with an extensive background in improvisation and sketch comedy. He is graduate of the Upright Citizen''s Brigade New York City, and has also trained with The Second City Chicago & Improv Asylum Boston. He was published in Backstage magazine''s #IGOTCAST.He is currently a writer and actor for the company Three Bridge''s Productions. He actively performs improv and sketch comedy live around New York City with his comedy troupe Drunk Orphan, and since season 41, he has been a regular stand in for Taran Killam on Saturday Night Live.He extensively performed theater & Improv while attending Suffolk University. He has lived in London, is an exceptional whistler, and can sing baritone. He wrote and directed the theater production "Sitcom," which was performed at the C. Walsh Theater in Boston.::anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Alec Lawless');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4062786', 'Nyell Leahy is an American actor from New Jersey. He was born into a diverse family of musicians, artists, and filmmakers. He has a rich multi-racial heritage, which has helped to bestow upon him a unique and handsome screen personality. Nyell discovered his passion for acting as a teenager and developed his skill through extensive training in New York City and through various acting opportunities. He was also born with exceptional athletic abilities, and he works daily to hone both the precision of his craft and his physical agility.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nyell Leahy');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4371164', 'J Kamron Leal was born in Wakefield, Massachusetts,a suburb of Boston. and now resides in New York City. Mr. Leal had a long and very successful career in emergency medical services (EMS), having served as a paramedic at the most prestigious EMS services in Massachusetts, including Boston EMS. While serving at Boston EMS he had occasion to serve as a 911 call center operator where he received national recognition for actions on duty, after talking an eight year-old boy through assisting in his mom''s childbirth over the telephone. He was later featured with the family on "CBS This Morning" with Mark McEwen.While working full-time on the midnight shift at Boston EMS, Mr. Leal attended Northeastern University in Boston, Massachusetts, and earned his Bachelor of Science in Political Science, graduating early with highest honors, in 2001. He was nominated by the faculty to be a Truman Scholar, and he was named to numerous honor societies, and included in the prestigious "Who''s Who at American Universities & Colleges", 2001.Mr. Leal left Boston EMS when he was recruited to become Director of Clinical Operations at a large private ambulance service in 2003, where he served into his first year of law school.In 2004 Mr. Leal enrolled at Suffolk University Law School. While at Suffolk he received a "Distinguished Oral Advocate" award, provided leadership on the Student Bar Association, competed on the Constance Baker Motley National Constitutional Law Moot Court Team, and was selected by his peers as the first part-time law student to serve as Editor-in-Chief of one of the school''s law journals. He was also a member of the Moot Court Honor Board, before graduating with honors. Mr. Leal passed the Bar Exam, and is a licensed attorney in Massachusetts.After graduating from law school he began a judicial clerkship and realized that this role took him away from what he loved most, dealing directly with people.In January 2011, he began hosting a radio show on WRBB Boston - Top Shelf Tunes. While hosting this show he scooped every other DJ in the world when he had occasion to host the sensational Ryan Andreas of America''s Got Talent Season 6 for his first ever radio broadcast, and for two live phone interviews, which Ryan''s growing fan-base enjoyed as it was streamed worldwide over the Internet. He also had occasion to provide the first radio broadcast for the Boston Irish Gaelic rock band Dublin Free Press, and his fans were then treated to a special live in-studio performance by the band.Although bitten by the performance bug and the cheering crowds at a young age after competing in a championship marching band, The Conquistadors, and skating in Boston''s "Ice Chips" with "Tai & Randy", Mr. Leal did not begin his acting career until late 2010. He has appeared in several feature films, as well as several independent and student films. He also had occasion to twice be pulled from the crowd onto the stage in Las Vegas, once at Cirque Du Soleil''s "O" to dance with a clown, and once at "Legends" to sing with an Elvis impersonator. Mr. Leal''s favorite hobby is singing, and frequents karaoke establishments, with a voice described as "Sinatraesque", and also sings Neil Diamond well. He is known for his striking resemblance to Philip Seymour Hoffman.Building on his successful career bringing people back to life as a paramedic, it is his dream to bring characters to life in the same fashion.He is focusing his energies on screen acting, theater, television, and voiceover work.::SDS', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kamron Leal');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4756446', 'Blago was born in Sofia, Bulgaria. He moved to New York at the age of 13 where he fell in love with music, theater and the arts. After completing his education with a degree in architecture, he moved to Los Angeles to pursue a career in film. Besides acting, Blago enjoys playing tennis, soccer and most of all, his guitar.::Adriana L', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Blago Simon');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5153976', 'Robert Skelly is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), The Final Table (2015) and Nurse Jackie (2009).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Robert Skelly');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4983709', 'Ben Leasure was born in Rochester, NY to Jeanne and Rick Leasure, the brother to four and uncle of five played college basketball and is a classically trained actor from the prestigious Stella Adler Studio Day Conservatory and Michael Chekhov Studios in NYC, as well as Upright Citizens Brigade. Ben is known for playing James Dean in Tim Heidecker''s Cartoon Network Oscar Special, appearing in and on the poster of the Wolf of Wall Street, and his rubber faced portrayal of Donald in the hit web sit-com Gentlemen''s Dwelling, which Leasure also Co-Executive Produced. Ben also has been a guest or co-star on 12 cable TV programs in the last two years. In the Summer of 2013, Ben produced and starred in the action-comedy Pilot, Flipsters, with Emmy nominee Mark Margolis. Ben has acted in countless independent films before entering the studio world, and can be seen in film festivals and screenings across the country with an array of lead roles in various genres. His favorites being Lloyd, the silent introspective clock repairman in "Men With Arms" the feature film with several festivals and a NYC Anthology Film Archive screening under it''s belt, and "Love at a Coffee Shop" Peter Panagos'' brilliantly penned Romantic Comedy. Leasure has also played in a multitude of classical and contemporary theatre pieces in NYC and Regionally. His favorite''s being "Sorry About Your Penpal" by Joe Lankheet, with Tyler Burke at Dixon Place, Heraculus in ICImedia''s Zenobia in Princeton, and The Drum Major in Stasz/Pruitt''s Woyzeck. As a Producer and Ghostwriter, Ben has several feature film projects in development.::Rep.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ben Leasure');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3837389', 'Born and raised in Central New Jersey, Billy Lee has always had a love for entertaining. His entire life had been spent playing music and perfecting his skills on the drum set, but the acting bug had bitten him fairly later than most actors, having realized his love for the craft at 19 years of age. With no training or experience in the industry what so ever, he threw himself head first into it and has never looked back since.::Mj537', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Billy Lee');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4533468', 'Adam Leong is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), The Secret Life of Walter Mitty (2013) and Us (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Adam Leong');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5357553', 'Fenton Li is an actor and writer, known for The Blacklist (2013), New Year (2017) and The Tiger & the Guru (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fenton Li');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2473588', 'Leonard Logsdail, born in London, England, is a Savile Row trained bespoke tailor with over 45 years experience. Based out of New York City, he is known for assisting costume designers in the wardrobe production and design of over 40 films, television shows, and Broadway productions. He occasionally makes cameo appearances in the films he works on, as a tailor.::Leonard Logsdail Bespoke Tailors', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Leonard Logsdail');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3900626', 'Andrew J. Lonsdale is known for his work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Delight in the Mountain (2017) and Muhammad Ali''s Greatest Fight (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Andrew J. Lonsdale');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4581092', 'Erika Lynn Gressen was born and raised in Philadelphia PA. She was born on May 8th 1989. She graduated from Abington Senior High School. She also graduated from Jean Madeline Aveada Institute for skin care and makeup artist. Erika Lynn is a model and actress. She was in the 2009 November issue of Penthouse Magazine. She plays the character Bunny in the Potent Media film, "Deer Crossing," which will be available this September 2012 on I tunes, Red Box, and Netflix worldwide; also in "Deer Crossing 2: The Legend of Carvin County," which is scheduled for filming in January 2013. "Apocalypse Kiss", is also another Potent Media Film, directed by Christian Jude Grillo; will start the filming process in January 2013 as well. Erika Lynn plays the main character Gladys. "Sucka For Luv" directed by Patrick Pierr, is finished production as of now, in which she plays the character Mya. She plays the part of a dancer in the Martin Scorsese film The Wolf of Wall Street starring Leonardo DiCaprio, Matthew McConaughey, and Jonah Hill. Erika Lynn is signed with Donatelli Modeling and Casting Agency.::Erika Lynn Gressen', 'Erika', 'Lynn', NULL, NULL, 'Erika Lynn');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2809508', 'Will MacAdam is an actor, known for According to Greta (2009), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and The Last Five Years (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Will MacAdam');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6004110', 'Stephen Macari is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Cpr City Park Ranger (2012) and The Idealist (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Stephen Macari');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4871027', 'Evelyn Madera is an actress, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and Blood Allegiance (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Evelyn Madera');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5509316', 'Mike Malvagno is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Gotham (2014) and Before I Disappear (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mike Malvagno');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5393876', 'Stephanie Manescu is an actress, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), The Money (2014) and ScottChurch''s Drag (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Stephanie Manescu');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5102611', 'Shawlini Manjunath-Holbrook is known for her work on Louie (2010), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and Casting Call, the Project (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Shawlini Manjunath-Holbrook');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6740504', 'Max William McLaughlin was born on the 28th of March 1992 in Ridgewood, New Jersey. He was raised in Franklin Lakes, New Jersey by his parents Michael and Kathryn McLaughlin. The summer before his first year at Loyola University Maryland, Max watched the movie "Good Will Hunting", and amongst other classic hits. That summer triggered his start for acting. The ''Experience of Theatre'' class, during his freshman year in 2010, was when Max got bit by the acting bug. He performed on the stage as the male lead, Adam Sorenson, in "The Shape of Things" the following year. In May 2014, Max graduated from Loyola and earned a Bachelor of Arts in Communication (Digital Media specialization) and minored in Theatre. Max currently resides in Los Angeles.::William McLaughlin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Max McLaughlin');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5378437', 'Tiffany Messam is an actress, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Old 37 (2015) and My Dirty Little Secret (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tiffany Messam');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4815722', 'Zach Miko is an actor and writer, known for Those in Glass Houses (2015), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and A Leg Up (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Zach Miko');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5693748', 'Bryan A. Miranda is known for his work on Madam Secretary (2014), Broad City (2014) and Unforgettable (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bryan A. Miranda');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5899930', 'Alexander Moitzi is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Splashes of Dye (2017) and He Belongs to Us.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Alexander Moitzi');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6116426', 'Ben Monahan is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), The French Minister (2013) and The Lennon Report (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ben Monahan');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4803119', 'Chris Skeries is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Boardwalk Empire (2010) and Un disastro di ragazza (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chris Skeries');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4302007', 'Kelly Southerland was born on September 28th, 1983 in Chapel Hill, North Carolina. Known for his work on The Leftovers (2014), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and Birdman (2014). Has recently performed stunts on Tracers (2014) and The Americans (2014). He graduated from Wilde Lake High School in Columbia, MD and attended the Stella Adler Conservatory.::Agent', 'Kelly Reed', 'Southerland', NULL, NULL, 'Kelly Southerland');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5456171', 'Tucker Sparkman is an actor and writer, known for Flipsters (2013) and The Wolf of Wall Street (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tucker Sparkman');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4874091', 'Kellen Moriarty was born in Shawnee Mission, KS. The son of a former NFL player & a fitness model - Kellen is a natural competitor. Having 3 younger sisters, Kellen has a innate maturity & sensitivity. Kellen is a former child catalog model, transitioning into theater in middle school & early years of high school. Deciding to follow in his father''s footsteps, Kellen focused all his energy into athletics; baseball & football. Kellen graduated from Dos Pueblos High School (Santa Barbara, CA), ranked as the #11 prep quarterback in the state of California; earned first team All-Conference & first team All-County. This focus & determination earned him a full, 4-year scholarship to play football at UNLV, where he received a BS in Business. Kellen''s passion & drive did not lead him to the NFL but found its way back to his other passion, acting. After graduating, Kellen moved to Los Angeles where he has had a successful transition from the field to the screen. Kellen credits his discipline & passion that sports helped nurture & acting has tested & helped master for his early success.::Kellen Moriarty', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kellen Moriarty');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6388236', 'Karen Morris is known for her work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), American Hustle (2013) and Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Karen Morris');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2849578', 'Lee Navlen always had a big mouth, full of opinions and as others will tell you, full of himself. As a hard partying teen growing up on the streets of Livingston, New Jersey, he regularly made the trek into NYC to check out the local comedy clubs where he fell in love with the craft, even lying about his age to get on stage.After graduating from college, Navlen did his best to keep comedy close to his heart but for reasons that never seemed to make sense to him, it was hard news networks that hired him. The immature Navlen eventually landed at Fox News as a Sr. Producer overseeing the news department''s most challenging assignments. After leaving Fox News, a decade later, Navlen returned to the stand-up stage full time, becoming a club regular throughout New York City.His no holds barred act that some have have compared to a heavy metal concert without instruments or topless audience goers (so far) mixes current events, politics and true stories about his career and at times dysfunctional but loving family. He''s a true original comic who refuses to play by the rules.When not on stage, Navlen has acted in films usually cast as the angry Irish dad, angry Irish cop or angry Irish drunk. Sometimes, all three at once! He''s also played an an angry Jewish lawyer in in the Web-Series Goodstein.Navlen also dabbled in New Jersey Politics, even running for office in hopes of meeting some real life gangsters. Sadly, none would have anything to do with him. He did meet Governor Chris Christie during his campaign, telling the governor that they had attended the same NJ High School.::Lee Navlen', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lee Navlen');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2576979', 'Nicole Neuman is known for her work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), That Little Yellow Pill (2011) and The Secret Life of Walter Mitty (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nicole Neuman');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2360853', 'Chris Nuñez is known for his work on Live by Night (2016), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and 2 Broke Girls (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chris Nuñez');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1662562', 'Seregon O''Dassey was born on July 3, 1981 in Allentown, Pennsylvania, USA. She is an actress and producer, known for Absynthia, Heartlines (2012) and Organs of Opportunity (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, '1981-07-03', NULL, 'Seregon O''Dassey');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6270026', 'Daniel Olson is an actor, known for The Blacklist (2013), American Genius (2015) and Death and the Maiden (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Daniel Olson');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5565515', 'Erik Olssen is an actor and writer, known for You Will Love On (2014), The Tests in Life (2014) and Letting Go (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Erik Olssen');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6597053', 'Jennifer Ortiz is known for her work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Zordon of Eltar (2015) and Teenagers With Attitude (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jennifer Ortiz');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4388566', 'And Palladino is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Powder Room (2016) and Birdman or (The Unexpected Virtue of Ignorance) (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'And Palladino');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5355530', 'Rocco Palmieri is an actor, known for Diamonds to Dust (2014), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and Physical Attraction (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rocco Palmieri');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7786344', 'Thomas Patrick is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Love Cupcakery: The Club (2016) and Missed Connections (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Thomas Patrick');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3283969', 'Geoffrey JD Payne was born in upstate New York, though later raised in the artistic seaside community of Rockport, Massachusetts. Growing up with a powerful imagination, Payne discovered his passion to become an actor at a very early age after being inspired by the movie ''Back to the Future''.At the age of 16, Payne attended a workshop in upstate NY to begin his training. There, he was scouted by Lanny Mitchell and went on to mentor him for 3 years in musical theater.At the age 19, Payne is encouraged to branch out into New York City. After receiving a scholarship, he attends the Weist Barron School for TV & Film where he studies with television producer, director and writer Michael Laibson.In 2006, Payne begins his extensive training at the prestigious Stella Adler Studio of Acting. Upon graduation in 2008, Geoffrey appears Off-Broadway and Off-Off Broadway. Some credits include; "Choose Your Grown Adventure", "This is Our Youth", "Books On Tape" and "Humans Anonymous". At that time, Geoffrey co-founded The Altruistic Theater Company with his friend and director, Brock H. Hill. With his acting career on the rise, unexpected bad news comes in 2012. With his mothers Parkinson''s condition now at the final stages; Payne decides to move back home with his family in Connecticut to tend to his mother during her last days. After her death in 2013, Payne ends up taking a hiatus from his acting career. Not being able to cope with his loss and state of depression, Payne turns to alcohol and drugs for an escape. In 2015, he was faced with the reality of his addiction, still choosing to ignore it; he progressed to other extremes as a greater high. Soon after, Geoffrey attempted suicide. Payne describes its failure as "divine intervention" and provided to be the pivotal moment where he chose life over death. With the support of family, he admitted himself into an inpatient rehab. Following his completion, Payne knew sobriety was his new way of life and never wanted to go back to using again. He describes his experience as being ''reborn''.After passing 1 year of complete sobriety, Payne is more focused and determined than ever before. Growing up he always knew what he wanted to become, but without strong intent or purpose. Now, after Payne has overcome so many tribulations, he has strong intent, purpose and more drive than ever before to not only turn his dreams into a reality, but to also give back to others. Recently, Geoffrey has been focusing his efforts on the TV and Film, booking work on the CBS "Bull" and starring in the recent short film written by the Oscar winning writer Nicolas Giacobone entitled "Da Capo" ("Birdman or The unexpected Virtue of Ignorance" & "The Revenant"). Some other film credits also include "The Wolf on Wall Street" "Across The Universe".When asked how he is able to push onward with such a refreshing and determined mentality, Payne recites his favorite quote by a long time inspiration of his, Stella Adler, "Life beats down and crushes the soul and art reminds you that you have one". "That quote always brings me hope" says Payne.::Geoffrey J.D. Payne', 'Geoffrey John David', 'Payne', NULL, NULL, 'Geoffrey J.D. Payne');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6377412', 'Originally from the Arizona desert, Jon is a Brooklyn based actor and writer. He earned his BA in Acting from Arizona State University, studying under famed theatrical director, Marshall W. Mason. He moved to New York City in 2006, and earned his MFA in Creative Writing from Long Island University, Brooklyn Campus in 2010.::Jon L Peacock', NULL, NULL, '1982-05-30', NULL, 'Jon L Peacock');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6174416', 'Grew up in West New York, NJ until moving to Ridgefield in early teens. Son to Ray and Mercedes. Graduated with a B.S. from Rutgers University in New Brunswick with concentrations in Sport Management and History. Took first acting class at Rutgers. Attended HB Studio. Completed training with 2-yr acting program at William Esper Studio under Bruce McCarty and Suzanne Esper. Writer and also Voiceover Artist.::Andrew Penabad', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Andrew Penabad');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2904710', 'North Carolina born, Katrina Perkins is "a shining, spirited" actress. Artistic talents leaning first toward poetry, she started performing at an early age. Her passion for acting was truly ignited studying Meisner Technique at Playhouse West and Baron/Brown Studio while living in Los Angeles. Meticulous preparation for each role, an exemplary asset as the voice of multiple characters with Tsunami Radio Theater, earned her honor of "Hardest Working Actress" and "Rising Star" award. Clear elocution and confidence pronouncing challenging words lead to a position as an on-line questioner for the Ryan Seacrest 12-day game-show event: "The Million Second Quiz". The lead in an award winning independent short screened in the Cannes International Film Festival, as well as feature length films, her path has also led her to work with local NY Repertory players in several works of Shakespeare, including Ophelia in "Hamlet". A full-time working actress, she can be seen on Hulu''s "The Path" and movies including Martin Scorsese''s "The Wolf of Wall Street", "Five Flights Up", and soon to be released "The Comedian" with Robert DeNiro.::The Powers that Be', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Katrina E. Perkins');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3883865', 'Mike Perkins was born and raised out of the beautiful state of New Jersey. He is an improv comedy alumni of The Upright Citizens Brigade Theatre in Los Angeles and has also been trained in improvisation techniques and sketch comedy with The Second City Training Center. He currently produces and hosts two monthly shows at Flappers Comedy Club in Burbank called Eat, Drink, Improv! and It''s My Party, and I''ll Laugh if I Want To. He''s also part of an improv comedy team named Hat-Trick that hosts their own monthly show #Hashtags with Hat-Trick the second Tuesday of every month at The Clubhouse in Hollywood. He graduated with a Bachelor of Arts Degree in Radio, TV, Film and has produced many independent feature films and documentaries alongside his comedy career; most recently the documentary I Am Santa Claus that is now streaming on Netflix and DVD worldwide.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mike Perkins');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5457886', 'Noelle Wilcox is an actress, known for Dallas Buyers Club (2013) and Parker (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Noelle Wilcox');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1909028', 'Jon Douglas Rainey was born in Camden, New Jersey. He made the Presidents List & Deans List at Camden County College while majoring in Communications. Jon served honorably in the United States Coast Guard & returned to the mainland to work as a licensed Private Detective on domestic, insurance fraud & missing person cases. Years later, while moonlighting as an actor in Philadelphia theater, he decided to switch from being in the investigative business to the entertainment business & moved to New York City where he continued acting & also hosted the Discovery Channel show "It Takes a Thief" in which he educated millions of people on home security & personal safety. Since then, Jon has been working in film, television & theater as a writer, actor, voice over artist & host, plus he is a producer with 2 studios, Radio Vision Network & Letter 8 Media in New Jersey.::Jennifer Rainey', NULL, NULL, '1970-01-27', NULL, 'Jon Douglas Rainey');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4752751', 'Dennis Rees is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Hungry Hearts (2014) and Golden Boy (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dennis Rees');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6225860', 'Neil Reese is known for his work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), The Amazing Spider-Man 2 (2014) and Sam (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Neil Reese');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6664291', 'Abbie Richards was born on July 31, 1990 in Reading, Pennsylvania, USA. She is an actress and writer, known for A Crime to Remember (2013), Perversion (2017) and The Wolf of Wall Street (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, '1990-07-31', NULL, 'Abbie Richards');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3438385', 'Brittney Parker Rose is known for her work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Under the Silver Lake (2018) and Nightwing: Escalation (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brittney Parker Rose');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3204171', 'Jamie Rosen is known for her work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), When Harry Tries to Marry (2011) and War Dance (2007).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jamie Rosen');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5278113', 'Rachel Rossin is known for her work on Till We Meet Again (2016), Walking and Falling (2014) and The Wolf of Wall Street (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rachel Rossin');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6320847', 'Tyler Evan Rowe is an actor and producer, known for Forever Into Space (2015), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and Noah (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tyler Evan Rowe');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3510245', 'Nicole Rutigliano is an actress/model for her role in award winning horror/comedy Jersey Shore Massacre. She has modeled for celebrity photographers, including Steve Azzara, and Richard Warren, which has helped lead to appearances in several national commercials and TV shows such as Blue Bloods, Prime Suspect and Royal Pains. Born and raised on Long Island, N.Y., Nicole first fell in love with acting as a teen studying film in the Pratt Institute in Brooklyn. Nicole continued on to the Stella Adler Studio of Acting in Manhattan, where she was both a student in the teen conservatory and took follow-up classes in the adult program. Later, Nicole studied Misner Technique intensively at the Neighborhood Playhouse. She currently resides in the East Village, NYC.::Marc Schwartz', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nicole Rutigliano');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5373081', 'Meki Saldana is an actress, known for The Other Woman (2014), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and Club Life (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Meki Saldana');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0721479', 'For over 30 years, Sibyl has been involved in film, television and stage production both in the US and Asia. Born in San Francisco, lived in Manila and raised in New York City, Sibyl has been an actress since the age of 2 with her first walk on role with mom, veteran actress Lorli Villanueva in Lino Brocka''s "Maynila sa mga Kuko ng Liwanag", recently restored and screened at Festival de Cannes. She went on to play the role of Charlie Perez in the very popular Soap Opera "Flor de Luna" and was a mainstay in television shows like "Kulit Bulilit" and "Kaluskos Musmos", and the film "Maricris Sioson: Japayuki" to name a few. She runs Sitting Cat Productions, with several films slated for release including the feature "SAM" with Executive Producer Mel Brooks, and directed by Nicholas Brooks. Sibyl is a recent recipient of The Outstanding Filipino Americans in New York, Arts & Culture Award at Carnegie Hall, and remains an active member of both SAG-AFTRA and Actor''s Equity. She trained with the Philippine Educational Theater Association, and has performed in several high profile companies including La Mama, May-I Theater and INTAR''s "Night Over Taos", directed by Academy award-winning actress Estelle Parsons. Sibyl also serves as Executive Director and Head of Programming for the SOHO International Film Festival.::Anonymous', 'Princess', 'Reymundo', '1972-07-22', NULL, 'Sibyl Santiago');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2078920', 'Chuck Schanamann is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Silver Linings Playbook (2012) and Kurbaan (2009).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chuck Schanamann');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4763438', 'Max Kolby was born in Villach, Austria, on April 4, 1990. His mother Silvia (née Kolb) is a former teacher and his father Josef Schoendorfer is a store manager. He has three older siblings, two brothers and a sister. Kolby''s interest in the stage goes back to his early childhood both in the fields of acting and music. After a school performance Kolby started to take acting classes and at the age of 17 he decided to pursue a career in acting. He landed a lead role in the independent feature film 3te Chronik in Germany. After high school and a year in the military he moved to New York to study acting. He graduated from the famous Lee Strasberg Theatre & Film Institute and has since worked on numerous productions, among them the award winning short film Forever Changed and the independent feature film Digital Physics. In March 2014 Kolby made the transition from NYC to Los Angeles due to professional reasons. Recently he portrayed Joric, one of the lead characters in the web series Skyrim: The Shadow Cult and the title role in A Boy Called Boris.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Martin Schöndorfer');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5431219', 'Vin Scialla is an actor and composer, known for Law & Order: Special Victims Unit (1999), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and The Deuce (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vin Scialla');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5483983', 'Jay Scott is known for his work on Admission (2013) and The Wolf of Wall Street (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jay Scott');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6964938', 'Terra Kimberly Scott is known for her work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), 911 Nightmare (2016) and The Advocate (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Terra Kimberly Scott');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4165329', 'Vitaliy Shtabnoy is an actor, known for The Equalizer (2014), Katya (2011) and The Wolf of Wall Street (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vitaliy Shtabnoy');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5510315', 'Born in Rochester, NY and raised in Saratoga, CA, Gabriel Sickel is the son of Joshua, a pathologist, and Julie, aphotography. He grew up with 2 younger brothers, Eli and Jacob and an older sister, Jessica.Being a middle child sparked his competative drive, started acting in 4th grade with Jessica in a musical at the Congregation Beth Am in Los Altos Hills, CA. Started making homemade shorts using his sisters camcorder.Gabe took theatre rolls and acting courses graduated from Lynbrook High School, where he graduated from in 2004. He continued film studies at De Anza Community Colege and transfered to San Jose State University in 2006, where he performed in the theatre troupe "Company One" directed by Broadway actress Janie Scott. In 2009 he branched outside of homemade shorts to play a doctor in an internet pilot produced by a classmate, then graduating in 2010 with a Bachelors of Music, concentration in composition.Moving to New York City in 2011, he began his first paying acting jobs in 2012 grabbing roles in feature films, shorts, and TV shows.::thisisgabe', NULL, NULL, '1986-07-23', NULL, 'Gabriel Sickel');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4348361', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bradford Cox');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1982444', 'Born and raised in Alabama, Meredith adds country charm, along with big city sass, to all the projects she''s involved in. After graduating from the University of Alabama with a double major in biology and dance, she performed professionally as a dancer and actor in Philadelphia and New York. Meredith currently resides in Los Angeles; she is also a dual citizen of Ireland.::B. Stewart', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Meredith Riley Stewart');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2171060', 'Matt Strickland is an actor and producer, known for Love''s a Bitch, and Then You Die (2011), The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and L is for Loser (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Matt Strickland');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5696510', 'Charles Hunt is an actor, known for Now You See Me (2013), Dallas Buyers Club (2013) and Escape Plan (2013). He has been married to Stephanie Hunt since March 2, 1996. They have two children.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Charles Hunt');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3948429', 'Corin Grant is known for his work on That Awkward Game Show (2016), Spartan: Ultimate Team Challenge (2016) and Do or Die (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Corin Grant');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4996083', 'Born in New York on March 5, 1956 in the Fordham section of the Bronx , Gerard had his first taste of acting at the age of six when he played the King in his school play "The King in his Kitchen".after performing in school productions Gerard began doing stand up at the age of 17 on Monday open mike nights at the legendary Catch A Rising Star comedy club on Manhattan''s upper Eastside where he shared the stage with Freddie Prinze, Robin Williams, Pat Banetar and Richard Belzer. After high school , Gerard waited tables so he could afford to take acting classes at the Lee Strasberg Theater Institute. He has written,produced, and performed in several comedy theater productions between 1992 and 2003. After a hiatus to raise a family Gerard has returned to stand up performing at the world famous Comic Strip Live and honing his acting chops at The Stella Adler Acting Studio.::JERRY SULLIVAN', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gerard Sullivan');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2720386', 'Lauren Susan was born as Lauren Susan Obertubbesing. She is an actress, known for Café Society (2016), The Vampires of Zanzibar (2010) and The Wolf of Wall Street (2013).::Anonymous', 'Lauren Susan', 'Obertubbesing', NULL, NULL, 'Lauren Susan');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5262202', 'Rafael Svarin is known for his work on Chelsea International (2016), Ruin (2016) and The Wolf of Wall Street (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rafael Svarin');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6014690', 'Temple University Diamond Marching Band is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and Annie (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Temple University Diamond Marching Band');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4149498', 'Nicholas was born on May 13th, 1990 in Woodbury, New Jersey. Nick played a variety of sports growing up including baseball, football, wrestling, boxing, and basketball. Nicholas started acting during his freshman year of college, where he played James "Ketch" Freeman in the schools production of "Our Country''s Good". He then went on to move to New York City to pursue an acting career, where he studied under Jim Parrack and Andrea Dantas, at Playhouse West-Brooklyn Lab.::anonymous', 'Nicholas Joseph', 'Teti', NULL, NULL, 'Nick Teti');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4251868', 'Logan James Thoreau is an American filmmaker born September 6th, 1982 in Fort Pierce, Florida. Known for his work in production on ''The Amazing Spider-Man 2'' and ''Time Out of Mind''. He is also known for writing & producing short films ''Jungle Fever'' (2012) and ''Katherine''. In 2014 Logan founded the independent production company Thoreau Entertainment based in Manhattan, New York.Logan Thoreau was encouraged into acting by his elementary school music teacher at age of 8. He often appeared in school plays, talent shows, and also served as the student program director for his school''s morning news broadcast, ''Good Morning Garden City''.As a teenager, Thoreau was heavily involved with community organizations the ''Explorer'' program, a division of the Boy Scouts of America, and the Junior Reserve Officers Training Corps, or J.R.O.T.C., at Fort Pierce Central High School. Logan was also a member of the Future Business Leaders of America (F.B.L.A.), earning him a regional award for public speaking in 1999.After graduating high school in 2001, Thoreau joined the United States Air Force, instantly becoming a model airman in the Air Mobility Command Regional Supply Sqaudron (A.M.C.R.S.S.). As a vital member of his squadron''s executive briefing team, Logan''s accolades include a National Defense Service Medal and a Organizational Excellence Award for ''Operation Enduring Freedom''.In 2006 Thoreau relocated to Boston, Massachusetts where he studied theatre at The Huntington Theater Company of Boston, literature at the University of Massachusetts Boston, and acting at The Atlantic Acting School in Manhattan.Thoreau also showed early potential as a writer when asked to pen a feature length screenplay for Marble Mountain Productions in 2008. In 2010, Logan relocated to New York City and began working in production. Today he continues to write & produce short films in addition to his work in film & television production.::Fran Mimms', 'Richard L.', 'Turner', NULL, NULL, 'Logan Thoreau');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5916340', 'Ryan Timberlake is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Thick Water (2016) and Impure (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ryan Timberlake');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5547226', 'Cassi Torres is an actress, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013) and The Cook, the Thief, the Bag, the Officer, His Love, and Her Ring (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cassi Torres');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6524785', 'Kathleen Trip was born in Long Island, New York where she grew up with an older brother and sister. She quickly found a love for performing and competing in baton twirling. She was on the competitive baton twirling team close to where she lived and won numerous of titles and champions throughout her competition years. Her first glimpse of the acting world was when she was a featured majorette in The Wolf of Wall Street (2013). After that, she knew she wanted to pursue acting as much as she can, while going to school. Kathleen graduated CUNY Baruch College in 2015 with a Bachelors of Advertising and Communication Marketing. As with acting, she also grew to love the business world as well. After graduating, Kathleen set out some goals; acting and to create her own business, which is exactly what she is doing now. She is focusing on her phone app STUDR, as well as acting in New York City.::Kathleen Tripp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kathleen Tripp');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6179757', 'Alex Van Zeelandt was born on February, 9th, 1991 in Brooklyn, New York. She relocated to Tennessee with her family 2002, and has been professionally acting since 2009.Alex started her career as a model, and quickly gained recognition within the industry. Modeling was never a permanent career path for her. She always wanted to be an actor, and decided to focus her time, and attention towards becoming a good one. Alex is a dedicated student of Stanislavski theatre, and film history.To date, she has been in twenty seven music videos, two billboards, four commercials, three feature films, two television shows, as well as winner of Nashville Model Of The Year. She was awarded best supporting actress at the 54 Hour Film Festival (in Nashville,) and appears in The Wolf of Wall Street as well as on The Wolf of Wall Street movie poster / DVD cover in three different places next to Leonardo DiCaprio. Alex is also a proud SAG-AFTRA member.::Lisa Bergmark', NULL, NULL, '1991-02-09', NULL, 'Alex Van Zeelandt');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4303442', 'Although John was born at the foot of Pike''s Peak mountain in Colorado, he grew up in Northern California; attending school and engaging in all of the arts: cartooning, drama productions, and playing in a garage band during the exciting days of The Summer of Love in and near San Francisco. After migrating to Santa Cruz, where he lived with his new bride and young daughter in a redwood canyon, he worked for the local energy company for eight years, and served his country during the Vietnam era in the U.S. Air Force Reserve and U. S. Army Reserve for six years. He then moved his family to the sun of Florida in 1978 and began a 32-year long career with the energy company there. He also earned his AA, BS and MBA degrees while raising his family. An early retirement option presented itself, so John hopped on board and has never looked back.Since then he has engaged in two of his great interests: writing American Revolution history, and being in front of the camera.His historical articles have been published in Journal of the American Revolution, Smithsonian Magazine, Knowledge Quest and the National Review. He''s very busy right now writing an entertaining/educational book for "regular people" of the American Revolution. His passion is to make the stories of America''s founding easier and more fun to learn than boring, stodgy history books usually make them.He has acted in at least fifteen films, numerous commercials, TV shows, and commercial videos.His very first venture into films was as an extra in "The Conspirator", a historical Civil War film directed by Robert Redford. After a few weeks of production, Mr. Redford gave John some speaking lines, which in turn gave John a SAG card. He says he''s very thankful to Mr. Redford for that first great opportunity. After parts in following films and TV shows such as "Iron Man 3", "X-Men: First Class", "Magic City" and "Hindsight", John was cast as Robert Redford''s photo double and stand-in during the entire production of "A Walk in the Woods". In 2016, John was cast as President Jimmy Carter in the TV movie "Killing Reagan".::John L. Smith Jr.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'John L. Smith Jr.');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2580719', 'Rick Espaillat is an actor, known for Dallas Buyers Club (2013), Temple Grandin (2010) and A Thousand Cocktails Later (2009).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rick Espaillat');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5245717', 'Travis Blevins is an actor, known for Bernie (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Travis Blevins');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5356479', 'Stefano Villabona was born in Montevideo, Uruguay. In 2001, at the age of 12, Stefano moved to New York City with his family. He studied film and video editing at LaGuardia College in Queens. In October 2012, Stefano began his acting and modeling career as a background artist. By 2013, Stefano had his first speaking role in Adult Swim''s web series show "Paynt Boyz" where he portrayed a European tourist. Stefano has worked on several TV shows, music videos, commercials, and films.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Stefano Villabona');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0511983', 'Madeleine was born in Lampertheim, Germany to German parents. Her mother died when she was a little girl and she was subsequently raised by her Aunt and Uncle. She grew up primarily overseas, having lived in Europe, the Middle East and Asia. She began modeling in Korea and Japan after being scouted by an agent at the age of 15. She moved to the United States after graduating from high school and continued modeling before embarking on an acting career. She is also a Burlesque performer with a background in ballet and has parlayed that skill into being cast as a dancer in movies and television.::A.O.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Madeleine Wade');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3340411', 'Sylvia Ward was born as Sylwia Wardaszka. She is known for her work on The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Dirty Pigeons (2008) and Standing Eight (2016).::Anonymous', 'Sylwia', 'Wardaszka', NULL, NULL, 'Sylvia Ward');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5963479', 'Sky Watersend is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Penne Vodka with Chicken to Go (2014) and Main Man (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sky Watersend');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4684806', 'Fredrick Weiss is an actor and producer, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), Spider-Man 3 (2007) and Rapid Eye Movement (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fredrick Weiss');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0921173', 'David Wenzel is a two time AOKA National full contact Karate Champion, was selected to the 2010 United States Martial Arts Hall of Fame.David Wenzel was born in Methuen, Massachusetts and came to NYC to study acting. David studied martial arts all his life and is a 4th Degree Black Belt in Issin-Ryu Okinawa Karate and holds three national titles. He also boxed professionally. He has appeared in a variety of TV series, films, and daytime serials, including Rescue Me, New Amsterdam, Extreme Forensics, and Lipstick Jungle. David''s film work includes Old Dogs and Duck Hunt (In Trouble Zone Productions) to name only a few. He has worked on and off as Brad Pitt''s stand-in/photo double for the last ten years, beginning with the film Sleepers. Through his extensive experience David has cultivated working relationships with the likes of Fisher Stevens,, Scott Ruden, Jace Alexander, and the great cinematographer, Emmanuel "Chivo" Lubezki.Think Tank, written by David''s brother, Kevin Wenzel, was conceived when David called Kevin from the set of the Cohen Brothers film Burn After Reading. David and Kevin had once discussed writing a series based on the concept of Domestic Surveillance and the CIA. David told Kevin, "if we don''t write something ourselves I''m never going to make it in this industry." As has always been true for David in his acting career, when the right opportunity didn''t present itself, he created it. David is also an part owner in one of Manhattan''s most popular teen acting studios, Actors Technique New York (ATNY).::International Martial Arts Council', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'David Wenzel');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0924918', 'Jaleel White was born on November 27, 1976 in Pasadena, California, USA as Jaleel Ahmad White. He is an actor and writer, known for Family Matters (1989), Adventures of Sonic the Hedgehog (1993) and Sonic Underground (1999).::Anonymous', 'Jaleel Ahmad', 'White', '1976-11-27', NULL, 'Jaleel White');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5676454', 'Darren Whitfield is an African-American Actor from the USA. Born & raised in New York City, his introduction to acting began in High School beginning with Shakespeare, musical comedies such as The Pajama Game & Improvisational Workshops.After several years in the workforce, he developed an interest for nightclub promotion & operations. His passion for entertainment led him to his first recording contract & ultimately an introduction to radio & television hosting. He then began co-directing & co-producing several music videos, documentaries & independent films.::Darren Whitfield', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Darren Whitfield');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4453132', 'Nicholas Wuehrmann is an actor, known for The Wolf of Wall Street (2013), St. Vincent (2014) and Ricki and the Flash (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nicholas Wuehrmann');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3093384', 'Born and raised in Harlem and Washington Heights, Mr. Yaniv has worked consistently in the New York theater and film scene for almost a decade in a variety of independent projects. His multi-faceted looks have allowed him to convincingly portray a seemingly limitless array of characters, backgrounds, and personality types. Never shying away from gritty or vulnerable subjects, he has portrayed an old world German pianist (A Man''s World), Mussolini in italian (Power of the Trinity), a young heroin addict trying to come clean (Chinese Rocks), and the developmentally challenged younger brother in the forthcoming Delivery Hour (Celluloid Rain Productions).Yaniv''s passion for acting was sparked in high school, where he was enrolled with a number of international students and teachers, and was exposed to the writing of Shakespeare, Ionesco, Brecht and Dostoevsky. At Wesleyan University, he successfully completed a double-major in Sociology and Theater, and was awarded High Honors for his solo project "Word Infirmia," based on interviews he''d conducted with prison inmates, ex-cons and victims of crime. This project was picked up for the New York International Fringe Festival and was also presented in Boston and Montreal. Since then, he has appeared in over 20 off- and off-off-Broadway productions with Obie-winning and Drama Desk-nominated companies such as Metropolitan Playhouse, Medicine Show, Marvell Repertory Theatre, and Nicu''s Spoon Theatre Company.::Yudy Fernandez-Pau', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Perri Yaniv');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0953654', 'Actor and filmmaker, Joseph Zaso was born on November 20, 1970 in Queens, New York. A performer of both the stage and screen, Zaso formed his own film production company, Cinema Image Productions in 1986. Since then he has primarily produced and acted in films of the suspense/thriller genre.::Anonymous', 'Joseph Louis', 'Zaso', '1970-11-20', NULL, 'Joe Zaso');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5046980', 'Multilingual film, TV, theater and voice-over actor. Identical twin. Nenad graduated from the New York Film Academy in New York City. Prior to that, he graduated from Switzerland''s AMS School of Theater, where he was trained by the esteemed Sonja Speiser.::J.B.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nenad Zezelj');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4920159', 'Jeremy Zierau was born as Jeremy Vincent Zierau. He is an actor and director, known for H.I.M. (2013), Dreadbox (2012) and We (2014).::Anonymous', 'Jeremy Vincent', 'Zierau', NULL, NULL, 'Jeremy Zierau');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0948885', 'Joji Yoshida was born and raised in Tokyo, Japan. He had his stage debut at the tender age of eight years old, playing an angel in his third-grade school production. He also began playing baseball and excelled at the sport. Joji dreamed of one day playing baseball in the major leagues. However during his college freshman year in California something happened. Joji was lost on campus looking for his first class. He wandered into the school theatre and immediately knew what he wanted to do with his life, thus resurrecting his love for acting. Goodbye baseball, hello Hollywood!::Anonymous (revised)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Joji Yoshida');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7014467', 'Jacquelyn Twodat Jackson is an actress, known for Django Unchained (2012), Dallas Buyers Club (2013) and Now You See Me (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jacquelyn Twodat Jackson');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5246194', 'Sylvia Froman is an actress, known for Bernie (2011) and Sin City: A Dame to Kill For (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sylvia Froman');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0107509', 'Academy Award nominated Producer Robbie Brenner is President of Film at The Firm where she oversees all theatrical projects.Prior to The Firm, Brenner was President of Production at Relativity Studios. Among the projects Brenner has overseen for Relativity are director McG''s 3 Days to Kill, starring Kevin Costner, and Luc Besson''s The Family, starring Robert De Niro, Michelle Pfeiffer and Tommy Lee Jones. She also spearheaded the company''s acquisitions of Joseph Gordon-Levitt''s directorial debut, Don Jon, starring Gordon-Levitt and Scarlett Johansson as well as the action-adventure Earth to Echo. Brenner also supervised production on director Tarsem Singh''s stylish Snow White adaptation Mirror Mirror, starring Julia Roberts, and 3-D epic Immortals, starring Henry Cavill, which grossed more than $225 million worldwide. Other productions include The Fighter, which earned seven Oscar nominations and won two; and Lasse Hallström''s hits Dear John, starring Channing Tatum, and Safe Haven, starring Josh Duhamel and Julianne Hough.Brenner joined Relativity in 2009 as Executive Vice President of Production, and was integral to the studio''s acquisition of the Sundance documentary Catfish, which became a cultural sensation. She was promoted to President in 2011.Prior to joining Relativity, Brenner produced Marc Forster''s Machine Gun Preacher, starring Gerard Butler. Her additional producer credits include Dallas Buyers Club, starring Matthew McConaughey and Jennifer Garner; Escape Plan, with Sylvester Stallone, Arnold Schwarzenegger and Jim Caviezel; A Perfect Getaway, starring Timothy Olyphant and Steve Zahn; Deception, starring Hugh Jackman, Ewan McGregor and Michelle Williams; and Haven, with Orlando Bloom and Bill Paxton.Previously, Brenner ran the classics division at Davis Entertainment, where she aided in the development of feature remakes of Taps and Romancing the Stone and produced the monster-showdown sequel Alien vs. Predator: Requiem. Between 2005 and 2006 she held the position of Senior Vice President of Production at Twentieth Century Fox, acquiring and developing movies for the studio. Before that, Brenner spent nine years as a production and development executive at Miramax Films, working her way up the ranks to Senior Vice President.After attending NYU Film School, Brenner began her entertainment career at Mickey Rourke''s Red Ruby Productions, where she assisted in the production of Bullet, directed by Julien Temple, and the bank-heist comedy-drama Fall Time.::The Firm', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Robbie Brenner');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0124239', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'David L. Bushell');
