INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1219336', 'Nicole was born and raised in New Orleans, LA. She booked her first acting job at age 15-a commercial for Easy Spirit Shoes. Nicole graduated from Destrehan High School and then attended the University of New Orleans as a Drama/Communications major. While studying at UNO, she began working behind the scenes in TV/movie production. Nicole has worked on countless movies, TV shows, commercials and music videos as a production assistant, director''s assistant and personal assistant.During her time in production, Nicole had the opportunity to assist and work with some top names in the entertainment industry including Academy Award Winning cinematographer Robert Richardson, who shot films such as JFK, A Few Good Men, Casino, The Aviator and Kill Bill Volumes 1 & 2 and world-renowned, eccentric music personality and producer, Kim Fowley, who is best known for discovering Joan Jett and The Runaways and also for co-writing songs with rock legends KISS and many other artists.In 2000, Nicole moved to Los Angeles, CA where she was offered a prestigious job working as a personal assistant and nanny to Academy Award Winners Angelina Jolie-Pitt and Brad Pitt and their family. Her work with the Jolie-Pitts enabled her to travel around the world and offered many unforgettable and invaluable life experiences. The Jolie-Pitts were gracious and inspiring employers.During her down-time working for the Jolie-Pitts in Los Angeles, Nicole was also able to take acting classes in Los Angeles where she studied for several years with Steve Helgoth who was trained under the esteemed and legendary New York actress and teacher, Uta Hagen. Nicole credits Steve with molding her into the actress she is today.In 2007, Nicole decided to switch gears and focus entirely on her acting career back home in New Orleans, where her heart was.In addition to acting, Nicole has found a passion for teaching acting as well. She teaches at Launch Model and Talent Academy in Metairie, LA and is available for private coaching and audition coaching.::Nicole Barre''', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nicole Barré');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3873798', 'Lorrie is the oldest of 5 daughters and all their names begin with an "L".........Lorrie, Lindy, Lisa, Leigh Ann and Lacy. Lorrie was born and raised in Oklahoma and is still there, today. She''s an "Okie all the way!". Lorrie and her husband of 32 years, Glenn, have 3 married sons and 5 gbabes, (though she swears she is only 23 years !!) On a Saturday in 2009, she became an ''empty nester'' when her youngest son went off to college. The next Tuesday, she was laid off from her job in the medical field, an industry where she worked as a sales rep for 20 years. On Thursday, her husband''s job took him out of state for a month. Her world was totally shaken in those few days. Instead of laying in bed crying and eating bon bons, she decided to transform herself and experience new excitements in life. She bought a Cannondale road bicycle and has since then, ridden across Oklahoma twice, camping along the way, and has ridden 108 miles in the infamous Hotter n Hell bicycle ride in Wichita Falls, Tx. In October of 2009, she took a "How to Audition" class and has been taking acting classes/workshops ever since and is SAG eligible. "I''m an eternal optimist and hope to live to be 130! There''s a lot of greatness to experience in this world, and I wanna do it all!" A child''s joyful laughter is her favorite sound. Lemon/citrus is her favorite scent, and her favorite quotes are: 1) "Never be afraid to trust an unknown future to a known God." Corrie Ten Boom 2) When people of integrity are not believed, they let time prove them right. 3) "Lord, show my heart how to beat in rhythm with the song you are singing through my life" (Jake Chilcoat 5/2009) Her friends say that her laugh is infectious and has started many belly laughs! Lorrie believes laughter is good for the soul, So let the laughter begin!::Lorrie Chilcoat', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lorrie Chilcoat');
