INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0444858', 'Frederick Keeve produced, wrote, directed and composed the score for From Russia to Hollywood: The 100-Year Odyssey of Chekhov and Shdanoff, which featured many award-winning and nominated actors such as Gregory Peck (in his last screen role), Jack Palance, Patricia Neal, Anthony Quinn, Robert Stack, Leslie Caron, Beatrice Straight, Sharon Gless, Lloyd Bridges and many more. Mr. Keeve''s other producing credits include: Maxine Waters EPC, Small Town Conspiracy, and Purple Sail. He has several feature films he has written or optioned as a producer in various stages of development, including Cadillac City and Letters from Heaven. Mr. Keeve recently completed a short film of Cadillac City with Peter Dobson, and six up-and-coming young actors.Keeve has optioned and developed screenplays from best-selling novels by noted writers such as Edgar winner T. Jefferson Parker and Pulitzer-nominated author Bill Granger. He has also developed a slate of eight independent feature films with budgets ranging from $2.5M to $20M with Sonny Ritscher, Chief Controller for mega-budget films at both Warner Bros. and 20th Century Fox (Watchmen, Green Lantern, Unfaithful). Keeve is a sought-after script doctor and enjoys writing screenplay coverage. He was hired to adapt a vampire novel, Vengeance Comes, for the screen.In addition, Keeve has produced not only films, but special events. He wrote and organized "An Evening with George Shdanoff," at the world-famous Argyle Hotel in West Hollywood, celebrating Mr. Shdanoff''s 90th birthday with world class ballet dancers, a concert pianist, and over 100 celebrity guests flown in from around the world. Keeve hired two-time Emmy winner Sharon Gless, screen legend Douglas Fairbanks, Jr., and screen icon Oscar-winner Patricia Neal to co-host the prestigious event.Keeve wrote the book, music and lyrics for the original musical Three: Songs from the Heart, with Ilene Graff (On Broadway: Promises, Promises, I Love My Wife, Grease), and directed by Lance Roberts (On Broadway: The Pee-Wee Herman Show, Sister Act, Ghost.) He has also recently organized and implemented two road shows for 100 actors in Salt Lake City with noted Hollywood Talent Agents and Casting Directors. Mr. Keeve is a proud member of the Producer''s Guild of America (PGA) for ten years and SAG/AFTRA for 20 years.::Lilli Keeve', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Frederick Keeve');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0446018', 'Kirk E. Kelleykahn is an actor, known for Detention (1998), Road to the Altar (2009) and Private Number (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kirk E. Kelleykahn');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4092658', 'Actor Bobby Kenney was born and raised in Cambridge, Massachusetts where he still lives today. After a long career in business he decided 10 years ago to pursue his dream of acting. Bobby has studied under many acting coaches from Boston to LA. and has played an impressive array of characters with a passion for each role. He has appeared in over 30 films such as, The Fighter, Here Comes the Boom, R.I.P.D, The Judge, Business Trip, and many independent films like ''Fedoras'' the 8 part web series based in the 1930''s where he play''s Mob boss Don Angelo Columbo, One By One, Crossing Paths, Among Them, Irish Whisper, Portico, Serena and The Rats and far too much more to list.::Bobby Kenney', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bobby Kenney');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2357821', 'Mini BiographyManos Krystalis is a BMI Songwriter/Composer since October 1, 2009. In 2009, he presented his own film with the title "The Perfect Crime", directed by Lynda Goodfriend. The film was screened at Warner Bros Studios ( May 2, 2009, Screening Rm 12 ). During that time, he teamed up with the director Leon Melas ( also well known for Simpatico with Sharon Stone and Jeff Bridges as main stars ) who directed the music video clip "Rock my World" with Manos Krystalis as the main performer. "Rock My World" has been played on Air in most TV Channels in Europe. In 2013, he was the main model for the Candyman Clothing New Line. As to his acting career, being part of several SAG and AFTRA film productions, granted him the status of being a SAG-AFTRA actor.::Webber Kleiw', NULL, NULL, '1982-11-30', NULL, 'Manos Krystalis');
