INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2746298', 'Dave Campbell is an actor, artist and musician, best known for Fist of the Vampire, Bound by Blood: Wendigo, numerous releases from his previous band "Ashes to Ashes", and for owning "Rockstar Studio Tattoos". David Frederick Campbell was born on April 17th, 1971 in Pittsburgh Pennsylvania, the second of five children to Kathleen M. Kassanitsh and Paul L. Performing became important early in life, when he started playing the trumpet in elementary school and imitating his favorite stand up comedians in front of his family and classmates. Starting his first band (Ground Zero) in 1988 with a few high school pals, and playing ever since, he spent 17 years as the drummer of east coast favorites Ashes to Ashes, recording 9 full length releases. He still performs, records and tours with his two latest musical projects, "Silk9" and "Sovereign". He also has his own signature line of cymbals and is endorsed by Soultone Cymbals. His acting career started in 2007, when a friend asked him to audition for a new film written by Len Kabasinski. Always dreaming of acting in addition to being a musician, he jumped at the chance. The result was his first role as Agent Dawkins in "Fist of the Vampire. Since then he has been part of 7 films, from an extra in "Out of the Furnace" to supporting character roles in many other films. Dave is the father of Paul Campbell, who also acts and plays drums and guitar, and can be seen in "Perks of being a Wallflower", in addition to touring with one of his bands "The Harvest Colour", "The Amplifiers", or "Tobacco Road". Dave resides in his home town of Hopewell, located in Western PA, approximately 30 minutes from downtown Pittsburgh, and spends most of his time working. He enjoys home improvement and building projects and studying the martial art of Tang Soo Do.::Tracy Kumanchik', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dave Campbell');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4051252', 'Dean was born and raised in Pittsburgh, PA. Starting to act at a young age, some of Dean''s early stage roles were as, "Charlie Bucket" and "Pinocchio". After taking several years off from performing to focus on athletics, Dean returned to Acting in a big way, landing a part in Tjardus Greidanus'', "A New York Heartbeat" where he played a NYC street thug opposite Rachel Brosnahan and Escher Holloway. In 2012, Dean took on the principal role of, "Tony" in the slasher film, "Scream Park", working alongside horror icon, Doug Bradley and Nivek Orge of "Skinnypuppy" fame. Dean can also be seen in such films as, "Won''t Back Down" with Viola Davis and "Jack Reacher" starring Tom Cruise.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dean Jacobs');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5101030', 'Christopher Kaczmarek was born in Akron OH and has always wanted to pursue acting. He began his acting career in 2011 after discovering that the film industry exists in Ohio. After his first audition, he got his first speaking role in the web pilot Hit Boys. He''s had several lead and supporting roles in films as well as web videos. Chris primarily acts, but has done production assistant work and is writing a few scripts of his own. He''s worked in the OH, KY, PA, and MI markets. Chris has been in over 30 films such as THE Wind IS Watching, Kings of Summer, Young Harvest, Underdogs, OUT of the Furnace, THE Umbrella Man, Hall of Fame, and Things Revealed. Chris has worked with and personally met Woody Harrelson, Willem Dafoe, Sophia Bush, and Mark Ruffalo. Chris was nominated for the Best Lead Actor in the 2013 Cleveland 48 Hour Film Project and his team won Runner Up for Best Film "Hi" by Cyclical Productions. It has been Chris''s dream to be in movies ever since he was a child, and he plans to continue pursuing an acting career.::Christopher kaczmarek', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Christopher Kaczmarek');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0473578', 'Raised by Czech parents in America, Mark Kubr was taught to be disciplined in arts, culture, athletics and religion. Kubr''s unique world-view gives him a talent for maintaining lasting friendships with people from diverse cultures.His career began just out of high school. While bagging groceries at the local market, an actress neighbor told Mark he had what it takes for entertainment and drove him to her agency in Los Angeles. Kubr signed with the agent and immediately began working as a print model and commercial actor, booking campaigns for Marlboro, Versace, Gucci and Ralph Lauren traveling the world. He always brought his cameras with him to build his photography portfolio. His photography has been published in Vogue, Cosmopolitain and Bride magazines.He continued modeling and acting while pursuing his education after being awarded a full athletic scholarship. His acting and athletic ability was a perfect fit for stuntwork. Kubr is Mickey Rourke''s stunt double.Where some men go golfing with their friends, Kubr goes surfing. IMDb Mini Biography By: Charisse::Charisse', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mark Kubr');
