INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5040913', 'Born and raised in Puerto Rico, Joel Isaac is one of the most exciting up and coming talents of his generation. he went to the University of the Sacred Heart in San Juan where he majored in TV, Film and Drama. For the past 2 years he trained in New York City at the Stella Adler Studio of Acting, with acting coach Grace Kiley and at HB Studio with Karen Ludwig. Some of his work in theater includes "The Fantasticks'', with favorable reviews for his role as Mortimer, "Careful What You Wish", "Joseph and the Amazing Technicolor Dreamcoat" and "La pasión según Antígona Pérez" where he had the opportunity to share the stage with some of Puerto Rico''s most respected actors such as Cordelia González, René Monclova, Jorge Luis Ramos, Yamaris La Torre, among others. In addition, Joel counts with experience in short films, TV Hosting and commercials. Currently starring in campaigns for brands such as Jägermeister and Quaker State. He is also a singer with a Tenor voice. Joel Isaac is based in Los Angeles.::Tiffany Morrison', 'Joel Isaac González', 'Acevedo', NULL, NULL, 'Joel Isaac');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1822910', 'Jeannine Kaspar is a fresh and exciting force taking Hollywood by storm. Born in Columbus, Georgia, Jeannine grew up in Durham, North Carolina as one of nine children. Jeannine got her big break starring in Freeheld (2015) opposite Steve Carell, Ellen Page and Julianne Moore.Kaspar''s interest in acting stems from growing up watching Will Ferrell on Saturday Night Live (2005). After high school she studied Communication Media at North Carolina State University, but her initial love for acting persisted and pushed her to pursue it once she completed her degree. After booking several commercials she realized it was undoubtedly what she wanted to dedicate herself to.Kaspar made the decision to go to Los Angeles to pursue her career, which proved to be a great move. Her television credits include guest star appearances on NBC''s Law & Order: Special Victims Unit (1999), USA''s In Plain Sight (2008), and recurring spots on FX''s Nip/Tuck (2003) and House of Lies (2012). On the big screen, Kaspar''s credits include the blockbuster hit Iron Man (2008) (with Robert Downey Jr.), the indie feature Paper Covers Rock (2008) (which won many awards on the festival circuit, including Best Actress for Kaspar), and the thriller Hidden in the Woods (2014) (with William Forsythe).Kaspar stars in the drama Freeheld (2015) opposite an A-list cast including Julianne Moore, Steve Carell and Ellen Page. Freeheld is based on the true story and Academy Award-winning short documentary of the same name; it follows New Jersey police lieutenant Laurel Hester (Moore) and her registered domestic partner Stacie Andree (Page) as they both battle to secure Hester''s pension benefits after she was diagnosed with terminal cancer. Kaspar has a leading role in Supermoto (2016), from Sam Bisbee and the team that brought us indie darling Infinitely Polar Bear (2014) with Zoe Saldana and Mark Ruffalo.::M Public Relations', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jeannine Kaspar');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5600192', 'Sam Klein is a producer and writer, known for Breaking Dish (2012), The Ghetto at Princeton (2013) and Alternate Route (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sam Klein');
