INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2897624', 'Geronimo Mercado is known for his work on Looking for Maria Sanchez (2013), Ana (2018) and Give ''em Hell Malone (2009).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Geronimo Mercado');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4434619', 'Diana Noris is an Actress, Artist, Writer, Animal Activist, President of Women in the Arts Miami and a very active Philanthropist. The actress combines her genuine nature, philanthropy & humility.....it equates to a Q-rating that is rising very, very rapidly!!Diana has grazed the covers of many magazines such as "Latina Magazine" , "Cosmopolitan", "Vanidades" , ''Raw", "Hip Hop", "Gente de Miami", "Latin Times", "Vitality" . She has been working in over 40 fils and soap operas in the American and Latin Market. She has an organization called "Women in the Arts Miami'' which host the yearly awards in September 18th, 2016.Diana has not only held her own in major motion picture productions but gained the respect and praise from industry colleagues.Diana was born and raised in Puerto Rico with Argentinean and German family. She resides between Marina del Rey, California and Florida.Noris, who has always been characterized as being a genuine woman, confirmed the fabulous news and also revealed that she just finished working as the lead in the film "Love Deepens" in Florence with her co-star, Lucca Spiroggni. She was in Los Angeles recently getting pre-production details to bring her character "Countess Natal" to life in the TV series "Sangre Negra" (stars Eric Estrada, Erik Roberts and Antonio Mckay).Last year Diana Noris was a part of Dwayne Johnson''s hugely-anticipated new project, HBO''s Ballers. You can also find her starring in The Familia, a mafia story. These days, the hot actress just finished "Devil''s Five" - she plays a principal role as Vala Schneider (a woman possessed by the devil). The film is currently in post-production- it was filmed and directed by Terry Reid Wickham in New York. Diana shared the spotlight with Ralf Scheepers, the lead singer of the European band "Primal Fear."Next November, 2016 Noris will be leading the Independent film "Aire de las Montañas" in Mendoza, Argentina. As part of her new upcoming projects Diana was just casted to play Sasha Cooper in horror film " Mary" who starts filming in September, 2016. The thespian just finished also working on the set of "Henri" a local film who took place in Fort Pearce, FL. She played Maria, the girlfriend of the talented and seasoned actor Eric Roberts (Julia Robert''s Brother). The actress recently finished filming "The rack pack" a family film in which she will play Mrs. Jenkins and started principal photography in July 2016 in North Carolina. She is working thru the summer in The Bahamas in the film "La vida en Negro" with Spanish Director Arturo de la O. She is rumored to work in 3 productions in Toronto and Quebec the fall of 2016.Between the amazing news, she also shared with us her recent award from the Florence Film Associated Press at the People''s Choice Awards. The press was captivated by our Miami Based actress''s participation in the film "Love Deepens", which will Premiere in February of 2017 in Italy.This mover & shaker woman is also the President of the "Women in the Arts Miami" and she is planning the upcoming Award Ceremony that will take place on September 18th, 2016. Noris founded Women in the Arts Miami in 2009 and she will be hosting the Awards for the fifth time this year. Her Organization Recognizes and honors the wealth of talent in our state pursuing excellence in their craft. An organization by and for individuals in the Fine and Performing, their purpose is to promote and offer exposure to those working in the Arts, Theater, as well as the entertainment industryHer fans and followers can read more details about her projects at her new web-site DianaNoris.com.Media Contact: The actress is currently in Miami working on some local projects. or email SteveClemonsPR@gmail.com::Steven Clemons', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Diana Noris');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3279353', 'Gil O''Brien is an actor and producer, known for Now You See Me (2013), One Hit Wonder (2009) and The Final Table (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gil O''Brien');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2195520', 'Born in Princeton to Illinois natives Sherwin and Sherry Lynn, Justin grew up in a small town in central New Jersey. After discovering his love for the craft at age 19, he began taking various workshops and programs studying with some of the industry''s most prominent teachers; Paramount film coach Bob McAndrew, Robert Easton and Margie Haber, to name a few. He went on to book small roles in ABC''s "All My Children" and HBO''s "Sex In The City", before auditioning and being selected to study with Tony award winning theater legend, Frank Langella. In four hour classes with an elite twelve students, it was here where Justin reached a deeper level in his work. Langella took a liking to Justin and they parted as friends, before Langella referred Justin to his agent. He then began to study with Emmy award winning director and Colombia University professor, Peter Miner. After working with Peter for a short time, He invited Justin to come to Colombia to work with various up and coming students in the directors program. Although Justin thoroughly enjoyed this, he withdrew after being cast on daytime television drama, One Life to Live, where he received praise for his work as troubled Navy SEAL vet, Wes Granger. He later went on to star in the film "Dry River Road", where he again played a down and out war vet, and the film got notoriety and fond review at the 2011 Palm Springs International Film Festival. Involved in various other projects, Justin is up and back between New York and Los Angeles, where he continues to expand his work.::anonymous', NULL, NULL, '1979-12-10', NULL, 'Justin Paul');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7142738', 'Jean Pierre Prats is an actor and cinematographer, known for Pirates of the Caribbean: On Stranger Tides (2011), 22 Jump Street (2014) and Che: Part One (2008).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jean Pierre Prats');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4570393', 'Mekaiela Rey was born in January 27, 1982 in El Paso, Texas to a half Belgium-French, half Jewish mother and a French-Spaniard Father. She grew up between Texas and New Mexico. During her childhood she traveled extensively throughout the United States due to having a military mother. The family includes one brother and one sister. Her sister is also active in theatre and Meka has several other family members that have done film, speaking roles and featured extra roles which has further ingrained her love of the industry.She has since audition for several roles and has some projects coming out in 2012.::Anonymous', 'Michelle Leigh', 'Rey', '1982-01-27', NULL, 'Mekaiela Rey');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7903081', 'Larissa Santiago is an actress, known for The Darkest Black (2016), 22 Jump Street (2014) and Night Job (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Larissa Santiago');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4567273', 'Manuel Gilberto was born in San Juan, Puerto Rico. He has 1 older brother, Hector (Ñequin) Santiago, and his parents are Awilda and Hector Santiago.Manuel, known to his friends and family as "Nolo" or Manolo, starts his career on Puerto Rico at the age of 22. Before Manuel became a Director and Producer, He was involved in banking and mechanic, none of which he held a passion for.In the spring of 2004, he start to work on films with the Puertorrican director, Luis Molina Casanovas working as a camera operator for few years. On 2008, Molina decides to produce a documentary film for Spain television named "Las Fiestas De la Calle". Lately this year he founded Vertiquo Films Corp. On 2011, Spain writer Carlos Exteba offered Manuel to direct a film "Dracula Dies for Us (2011)" based on his play, the film was produce by Angel Sanjurjo Delgado. On 2012, Angel Sanjurjo Delgado was a screenwriter working for Vertiquo Films Corp, who write the short film "UnderRain (2012)". The film was produce by Vertiquo Films Corp.::VFR', NULL, NULL, '1979-11-11', NULL, 'Manuel Gilberto Santiago');
