INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7217514', 'Gregory Scott Schwabe, was born on 26 June, to Kathleen and Paul Schwabe. Greg has two siblings are Ken and Mollie. The Schwabe''s grew up in Brockton, Ma "the City of Champions", where Greg competed in Baseball and Ice hockey. Greg Graduated from Brockton High School in 1988. Greg joined the US Army and was stationed around the globe. One of Greg''s highlights was the Chief of Counterintelligence Analysis Section for US Forces Korea. Greg then spent several years in some special programs within the US Government fighting terrorism. After Government service Greg has also worked at Middlesex Sheriff''s Office as a Deputy Sheriff, and Mass General Hospital.Each February, Greg works as the lead bodyguard, at the Munich Security Conference where world leaders come together to discuss global threats.Greg is also an International Security Consultant/advisor.In January 2015, Greg''s first break in the film industry came after a bad year in his life after back surgery, Oliver Stone hired him to act and help train over 50 international extras to be American Soldiers for the movie Snowden. Greg credits his rebirth to Oliver and Jaymes, since Snowden, Greg has been hired in several roles in film, TV and commercials. Greg''s biggest role is in Solar Eclipse as Lord Mountbatten. Greg Continues to learn about his new profession with private acting coaches and voice coaches and attends workshops to be a better actor.Greg is an avid sports and exercise buff, competing and coaching in baseball and exercising in the gym and competing in Spartan Races with an aim of triathlons in 2016.::Greg Schwabe', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gregory Schwabe');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3894123', 'Brigitte Sharai is known for her work on Jack Reacher: Punto di non ritorno (2016), The Exile (2011) and The Voice on the GPS.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brigitte Sharai');
