INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3079422', 'Denis Khoroshko is a Russian actor based in London UK. He played role of Polish driver Tadek in Dustin Hoffman movie Quartet (2012) co-starring opposite Maggie Smith, Ivan in Tinker Taylor Soldier Spy (2011). Many TV projects including BBC series Call the midwive, REV, Netflix series Crown-2. Various music videos and commercials.He was born Denis Khoroshko on December 16, 1979, in Belarus. His father, Ivan Khoroshko, and his mother, Tamara Khoroshko are painters. Young Denis Khoroshko studied acting in Russian acting school in Saratov (Russia). Also he took part in a few singing competitions, he is a singer and can play guitar and piano. In 2005 he moved to UK London and started his film career. Denis made his debut in feature film Are you ready for love. He played the ice skater dater. Then he took part in more than 100 projects (feature films, short films, commercials, music videos).Denis Khoroshko also made appearances on stage at Russian London Theatre RITS in the leading role of Balzaminov in play "Balzaminov''s Marriage", and as Reverend Parris in musical Witchcraft. Broadway theatre London (2010) and play "Lysastrata". He is writer and producer of comedy series "Dennis the Russian". This project also has been shown on Cartoon Network. Outside of his acting profession, Denis Khoroshko enjoys traveling. He visited around 65 countries. He likes sports: diving, cycling, horseback riding, ice skating and roller skating, football, volleyball, swimming. His knowledge of languages: English (fluent) and Russian (native fluent) and German , French, Belarusian (beginning level). He has done many voice overs including voice over for "Battlefield-3" game. Appeared at Graham Norton Show with Joan Rivers and Alicia Silverstone and many other TV shows.::Maxim Muzalevsky', 'Denis Ivanovich', 'Khoroshko', NULL, NULL, 'Denis Khoroshko');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5611131', 'Debra was born in north west London and now lives in the Chiltern area of Buckinghamshire. Acting and singing formed a major part of her early life as she realised her love of performing and became involved in a local fringe theatre west of London. During this time she learned all aspects of live performance and stage production and took on many different roles in plays that ranged from tragedy to farce which developed her versatility, whilst also taking on many leading roles in musical theatre productions. Being a strong vocalist she also became involved in recording lead and backing vocals in various studios and began writing her own material; a pursuit she still enjoys. A music video to one of her songs; Why Did You Say Goodbye, was filmed in 2015. Her transition into filming began after having a family and she now has extensive experience as a film actress. After numerous small roles in mainstream films and TV dramas such as Injustice (2011), Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 2 (2011) and Pan (2015), she has now undertaken various roles in independent productions and has proved herself a talented and versatile screen actress. These include the role of Clare in 3Some (2013), Indie Series Awards Winner 2014, June in Roots (2015) and Beth in The Attachment (2016), winner of Best Horror Feature Film 2016 (DEFF). In 2016 Debra also filmed the part of Meredith Jones for the feature film Dogged (2017).::RT', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Debra Leigh-Taylor');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5973049', 'Oliver Leitsberger was born in 1992 in Amstetten, Lower Austria, Austria. He is a producer and editor, known for Peter Kreisky Gespräche (2012), Linhardt macht''s (2013) and Die Waffen nieder! (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Oliver Leitsberger');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5855226', 'Jorge Leon Martinez was born in Malaga, Spain. In 2005 he moved to London,UK where he began his acting career, He has worked in big productions and with great actors as Tom Cruise, Johnny Depp, George Clooney, Brad Pitt, Samuel L. Jackson, and series as ''24''. Jorge Leon is Marbella Film Academy''s Honorary member since 2014.::JL', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jorge Leon Martinez');
