INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4051209', 'Lee was born in Dover in February 1974. He studied at Brockhill Park School of Performing Arts excelling in drama and theatre. His first feature was a very small speaking part in Le Petite Bande (1983) and followed up with another in Lady Jane (1986). At the age of 17 however he choose a different career path and joined The Royal Air Force where he served for 13 years, his experience in the Military and working as a consultant in the Government Sector and a "chance" role in a low budget film led him to not only pursue a new career in writing but also re-find his love of acting. His military experience and natural acting ability has led him to be cast in several major Hollywood productions, as well as domestic television. Not satisfied with just film and TV Lee was also cast as part of the main cast in the award winning theatre production "You, Me, Bum Bum Train" (2012) His determination to succeed and creative mind has allowed him to follow a new passion, writing. Reaching the semi-finals of the Creative World Annual Awards in 2013 with his script "We Are Soldier" (currently in production) has given him a new found confidence which reflects both in his acting abilities but also his writing. Lee is now working on his next script "Humpty Dumpty" a dark twisted psychological horror as well as pursuing his acting career.::Rhys Jones', 'Lee', 'Mitchell', NULL, NULL, 'Lee Asquith-Coe');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3276414', 'Chasty Ballesteros was born in Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada as Chasty Rose Ballesteros. She is an actress, known for The Ranch (2016), The Newsroom (2012) and The Internship (2013).::Anonymous', 'Chasty Rose', 'Ballesteros', NULL, NULL, 'Chasty Ballesteros');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4964040', 'Kelly Burke is an actress, known for Justice League (2017), Kill Your Friends (2015) and La mummia (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kelly Burke');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8332225', 'Born in Kent and raised in Croydon, Surrey, England. An only child. Attended Ashburton High School and Croydon College. Former lead singer of British synth-pop band Blue October UK and more recently singer/songwriter for Passion Flower Storm. He released 4 singles and 3 albums with Blue October UK up until 2010 when he left the band. The first Passion Flower Storm album is due in early 2017. Although a childhood actor at school, this was not the path he initially followed even though he had a deep and continuing passion for the industry throughout his life. He did however, re-discover acting again later in his career which coincided with his newly galvanized creativity for making music. He made his ''big screen'' debut in a Virgin Trains television commercial in 2016 followed by a role in The Hitman''s Bodyguard.::Ross Carter', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ross Carter');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7207249', 'Jade Clarke is an actress, known for Film Stars Don''t Die in Liverpool (2017), Lotus Eaters (2011) and La mummia (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jade Clarke');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4677272', 'A native of South Wales, Matt performed in theatre plays from a young age, and studied Drama at the University of Winchester. He graduated in 2011 and moved to London. Since then Matt has built a wealth of knowledge working with some of the industry''s top talent Including Angelina Jolie, Michael Caine and Tom Cruise. Matt also wrote, produced and acted in Then & Now (2015) alongside Julian Glover. The film has won 15 awards at festivals around the world.::Charlie Smith', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Matt Hookings');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7351839', 'Olivier Knox is an outstanding reporter who appears as a panelist on numerous television news shows, as well as Yahoo News video productions. Previously at outlet, AFP and now in his his current home, Yahoo News. Sometimes known to hang around a large man with skull rings. Mr. Knox has long been married to his Saintly Wife, and they their child, Nibbles.::bmaz', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Olivier Knox');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7859308', 'Christopher ''Davidson'' Collins is an English actor. Chris was born in Stevenage, Hertfordshire, on December 18, 1984. He is the son of Kathleen G Lloyd and Gary M Collins, but raised by his step-father David since he was 7 years old. Chris attended the Centre for the Arts, located in Hertfordshire, England, where he trained in the Performing Arts and graduated in 2004, at the age of 20. Aside from acting, his talent repertoire includes writing, drawing, photography, and editing . Upon graduation, Chris was encouraged to study further at Middlesex University where he studied Theatre Arts in 2012. Upon completing his training Chris was cast in a number of roles in television and film. He was cast to play "Julian" in the drama, Roberto (2013). In 2016, he played "Spike" in the new series, "Credenhill", and as a "Policeman" in the BBC Series of "Panorama". Also in 2016 he was cast as a "Tourist" in the adventure film, "The Mummy" (2017). Adjusting to the death of his step-father and his difficulties with money Chris was on the verge of quitting but worked consistently at getting more roles by applying on various websites. Toward the end of 2016, Chris found himself becoming one of the most popular online celebrities around especially on social media platforms. Chris will next be seen as the main lead in "Roofied" set for release in November, 2017 as ''Chris''.::Christian Davidson', 'Chris', 'Collins', '1984-12-18', NULL, 'Christian Davidson');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1745190', 'George trained at the prestigious Drama Centre London alongside Tom Hardy and Michael Fassbender. He grew up above his fathers grocery store in North London. His career started on the London stage in plays at the National Theatre, Theatre Royal S.E, Haymarket Theatre and numerous off West End productions. In 2012 he returned to the stage to play the leading role in a new play ''Chicken'' at the Trafalgar Studio in the heart of London''s West End. George has appeared in some of the most successful TV shows including Game of Thrones, The Honourable Woman, Homeland,The Americans, The Last Ship, Bones, Law & Order, Spooks and many more. On the big screen George starred in the mega hit movie Mamma Mia along side Meryl Streep. Other movies include 300:Rise of an Empire, RED 2, The Cut, The Mummy (2017).::Mathieu Lapeyre', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'George Georgiou');
