INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5904925', 'After his years as a TV cast, Kelvin now work in several production field performing various roles ranging from cast to acting and double up. The Nigeria born actor has studied with London school of act, East London university and motee stunt team. His career in the movie industry started after he was featured in a movie video with a Nigerian singer (Justina) in the year 2009.every since, kelvin has worked his way into Hollywood and the Nigeria movie industry. after an interview with him, The graduate ICT specialist said he intend to be an Engineer and intend to keep acting as a side career.so far, we hope to see him at the top.::Doug', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kelvin Enwereobi');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4710628', 'Marco Flammer was born in Benoni, a city in the greater Johannesburg-area, South Africa on December 12th, 1979. His mother and father, Renate and Eduard Flammer are both German and immigrated in the late 60''s to South Africa from Frankfurt and Tubingen which was then known as the former West Germany. His home language was German while his second and third languages were English, Afrikaans and Xhosa. Originally Marco''s education and vocation was as a civil engineering as a result of his father wishes to have one son to succeed him in the family construction business. He started his tertiary education in 1998 in Pretoria, South Africa at the Tshwane University of Technology and later received a bursary through a university in Groningen in Nederland. He completed his Dutch bachelor''s degree in 2003 in International Civil Engineering Project Management and returned to South Africa to work as a civil engineer in Pretoria, Johannesburg, Secunda and the Eastern Cape while completing a second bachelor''s degree part time in Transportation in 2006. During 2004 and 2006 he also completed a Diploma and started a Degree in Theology with the emphasis on Christian Counselling with the aim to better understand the emotional needs and psychology of other individuals. Marco was determined to work within the arts since a very young age as a result of the influence and inspiration his mother had on him (his mom a gifted artist and teacher). During his childhood his involvement in art was through the media of painting, photography, literature and performing arts in and outside of school hours. He originally dreamed of becoming a graphic designer and fine painting artist to express his creative gift on canvas but never found the time with his demanding career and studies. Soon after the completion of his decorous education in science in 2006 he decided to move to London in March of 2007 in the aim of developing his creative aptitude. At first the grapple to survive and remain in London anchored him firmly to his existing civil engineering vocation and science until he finally reached solidity which allowed him freedom to explore a part time career in acting and photography as a model. His first mini-role was in 2010 when he was cast as a double for Albert Ball (Vincent Regan) in the British film St Georges Day.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Marco Flammer');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2796866', 'Welcome to the official IMDb Page of award winner, Kyla Frye. Hailing from the east end of London, Kyla Frye is a multifaceted actress who has worked opposite the likes of Ashley Walters & Aml Ameen. Kyla is a remarkable talent whose intent on shaping the future of film & television across the globe remains steadfast through the launch of her production company, Fryeday Entertainment LTD and filmmaking debut ''The Key'', seen by over 22,000 people on the Community Channel & Vox Africa. In 2013, ''The Key'' had its big screen debut at Channel 4 and also became the most watched of all the British Urban Film Festival programs on BBC iPlayer. In Spring 2014, Kyla appeared in Hollywood blockbuster ''Edge of Tomorrow'' starring Tom Cruise & Emily Blunt and the following year, became a Patron for the British Urban Film Festival. Most recently, Kyla co-wrote, produced and starred in critically acclaimed crime caper short ''Double Cross'', which is being developed into a feature film in Summer 2016.::Kyla Frye', NULL, NULL, '1987-10-10', NULL, 'Kyla Frye');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5433785', 'Nazaire Gbolo is known for his work on Closed Circuit (2013), Edge of Tomorrow (2014) and Avenue to Nowhere (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nazaire Gbolo');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5299144', 'Natasha Goulden is a Swedish actress best known for her roles in Amsterdam Express (2014), Wolfblood (2016) and Obsession: Dark Desires (2016). She was born on November 27, 1992, in Stockholm, Sweden.At age 10 she attended the theatre school Calle Flygare in Stockholm, Sweden before moving to London where she got her first lead role as, Lucy, in the short film ''Rose''. The film went to the Short Film Corner in Cannes 2012 and was nominated at The Royal Television Society. Within two years of moving to the UK, Natasha had the lead roles in several films.She is originally Swedish, English and Italian and often goes to Newcastle to revisit her Geordie roots. Natasha is trained at Drama Centre London and Identity School of Acting.::Olivia Ahsley', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Natasha Goulden');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4807680', 'Goldie Green is an actress, known for Jab Tak Hai Jaan (2012), Edge of Tomorrow (2014) and Kid Gloves (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Goldie Green');
