INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4519124', 'Law is a Movement Artist, Stuntman, Actor, Instructor.Law, aka Laurent Plancel, was born in the Caribbean, in Guadeloupe. At five years old, his mother and father decided to move to France to find work in Paris. At 8 year old, during school holidays he discovered Martial arts movies such as Jackie Chan, Jean Claude Van Damme, and Bruce Lee. He was impressed & inspired & began training seriously At 16. He has studied Kung Fu/Wushu, Acrobatics, Circus, Gymnastics, Tae kwon Do & Tricking for over 10 years, & is one of the originators of tricking in Paris. At 23, he began working as an actor and stuntman. Most recently Law has moved to London to make his dream as an action actor & stuntman.::I.C Movement', 'Laurent', 'Plancel', NULL, NULL, 'Laurent Plancel');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6160211', 'Born in north wales 1978, JD grew up in Manchester, his father a builder and his mother an artist. His grandfather Felix Roth, a member of the Magic Circle, an officer in the British army and a dentist, became a great inspiration to him along with his great aunt, Dorothy Round Little, the 1930''s tennis ace and Wimbledon Champion. He worked as a builder and a stage hand in the theatres for more than 10 years where his taste for acting grew as he attended private acting tuition. Unhappy with his career choices, JD decided to follow his passion, pursuing an acting career in London and soon becoming a special action sword fighter on such films as ''Snow White and The Huntsman''. A serious actor, JD follows the creative path of an artist, writing scripts and practicing his techniques, such as Strasberg and Chubbuck, with a career goal to one day play a main ''BOND'' bad guy. Recently he starred as the lead in a TV pilot ''2024'' and directed a few interesting short films. His unusual first name is a ''nod'' to the 1950''s screen legend James Dean.::Pat Roth', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jd Roth-round');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7081441', 'Alex Sark-Geissler is known for his work on Hercules (2014), Edge of Tomorrow (2014) and Jurassic World: Fallen Kingdom (2018).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Alex Sark-Geissler');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3397453', 'Chris St. Omer is known for his work on Fit-Boy (2011), Burnt (2015) and Edge of Tomorrow (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chris St. Omer');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4571421', 'Daniel Stisen was born in Mandal, a small town in southern Norway, and grew up in a family of seven. He was the oldest in the family.Daniel''s inspiration was his father, who himself was a bodybuilder running his own gym. He was involved in body building techniques, which paved way for Daniel to enter the bodybuilding arena. Daniel spend most of his childhood learning from his father, the art of bodybuilding. Literally, it would be correct to say that he grew up in the gym and that''s how he developed a passion for body building and power sports.Daniel competed for the first time in powerlifting when he was 16 and got second place in Norwegian Championship, and he started to compete in body building when he was 20.Daniel moved to Kristiansand/Norway after finishing Norwegian collage and lived there some years. He competed in lots of bodybuilding competitions from 2002-2008 and won The Oslo Grand Prix 2002 contest,he was still a junior at that time. A year after he won the Norwegian Championship, both junior and senior class. He acquired second and third places in various contests between 2002-2008.Daniel was a very strong bodybuilder. He squatted 370kg when he was only 21 year old and weighed 99kg. In 2008 he injured and tore his left thigh, while doing some heavy squat during a photo session for Norwegian Magazine, this made a stop for his bodybuilding careerDaniel moved to Oslo, the capital of Norway in 2007. This is where he started his modeling and acting career in the entertainment and showbiz industry where he did lots of guest performances. His passion for bodybuilding was still intact in him and continued his training, but now not for competition level.From 2009 he focused more on the entertainment industry where he enacted various roles in commercials, TV shows and reality Shows. 2010 is the year when he started focusing on his acting and film career. When it comes to movies he is an all-rounder. He has written scripts, acted and even produced movies. Daniel went to Nancy Mannes acting studios in Oslo, there he teched Standford Maisner acting method. He also start go to British action academy in summer of 2011, to tech stunt, martial arts and stage combat. Daniel''s goal is to expand his career as an action star on the national and international platform in the forthcoming years. Daniel has done Norwegian and English movies. Summer 2011 he moved to London to focus at international career, and his film career is growing fast and Daniel is on his way to become one of Europes new Action Stars.::Unknown', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Daniel Stisen');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1880203', 'Jim is the youngest in a family of four and grew up on a farm near Loch Lomond in Scotland with his parents and three sisters. He got his first taste of acting when he joined his local young farmers club and took part in their annual variety concerts.On leaving school at 16 Jim worked on the family dairy/livestock farm until finally realising that it wasn''t for him, and at the age of 28 auditioned for a place in The Royal Scottish Academy Of Music And Drama where he won a place on the acting course.Jim was devastated when his father William lost his battle with cancer in 2002, and acting took a back seat as he returned to run the farm.Jim graduated in 2003 and moved to London to continue his career.As well as his film and television work Jim has also worked extensively on stage in theatres throughout his native Scotland as well as in London, he recently shared the west end stage with Kenneth Cranham and Claire Skinner in the critically acclaimed and award winning play ''The Father'', written by French playwright Florian Zellar the play tells the story of an ageing man''s struggle with alzheimer''s disease. He has also played in theatres in America and Australia while touring with Kneehigh Theatre''s acclaimed production of ''Brief Encounter'' where he played the lead role of Dr Alec Harvey.::Draw Rope Editing', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jim Sturgeon');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4244734', 'Julie Hardin is known for her work on Due Date (2010), Wanderlust (2012) and What to Expect When You''re Expecting (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Julie Hardin');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4846353', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hillary Butorac Weaver');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4260989', 'Lamin is a British actor of African descent .Born and raised in rural Gambia, West Africa, with eight siblings. He moved to the United Kingdom to pursue his career and was soon spotted by a talent agent who was captivated by Lamin''s unique striking features and engaging personality. Often described as a Directors Dream due to his quick grasp of characters, creativity and fearlessness you really need to see him perform to feel his powerful presence. It is the same irresistible charm that attracted the attention of the agent who would later become pivotal in his career in acting. Lamin was always a film, art and fashion fanatic. Marrying his love of art and creativity and an acting career was a match made in heaven. No sooner has he started auditioning than he started booking roles. It has been a meteoric rise ever since. He trained briefly at Stellar Adler Academy in Hollywood, CA, in November 2010, and in 2011 his star began to rise. Lamin later enrolled at the part-time award winning Identity School of Acting, London. He has gone on from strength to strength with some of his films making it to the big screen. His rise may surprise some but not those who worked with him. His relentless energy and desire for perfection complimented by his array of skills makes him a joy to work with. Lamin is on various film projects in the UK and overseas, with renown production houses. He often said he wants his work to be celebrated one day. His immediate priority is to ensure he delivers compelling moving pictures every time he is given the chance.::Sage', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lamin Tamba');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4000041', 'Liquid Thomas is an actor, known for Edge of Tomorrow (2014), The Newspaper (2015) and Skin Traffik (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liquid Thomas');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5319261', 'Jack Valencia is known for his work on Interstellar (2014), Indestructibles (2015) and Cycops (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jack Valencia');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2151232', 'Mikko Vartiainen is a Finnish born Actor and Producer. He studied actors work in Los Angeles, New York and Finland. In Finland he studied in the international school and research center of acting skills which was part of the international network of theatre laboratories all over the world. Extremely physical and challenging actors training program honored for example the methods of such talents as Constantin Stanislavski, Etienne Dexroux and Jerzy Grotowski leading to results very similar to method acting: The purpose of the process is to strip down the mannerism and tricks of an actor and to deal with the real, deep emotions. Mikko has also trained with such internationally acclaimed talents such as Judith Weston, Iben Nagel Rasmussen, Carlos Simioni and Ricardo Puccetti to name a few. Mikko Vartiainen now lives in Los Angeles and London working as an Actor, Producer and Acting coach.::Nina Olsson', NULL, NULL, '1977-02-20', NULL, 'Michael Vardian');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6620079', 'Daniel is an actor who excels at languages, speaking 4 fluently.In his younger years he was in the military, as well as a junior mixed martial arts champion. He enjoys physical exertion and a bit of rough-and-tumble! He was fortunate to receive a very good education via music scholarships to Bedales & Stowe school, and performed regularly with the National youth and National youth Jazz Orchestras.He went on to become a well renowned DJ having played and performed in 23 countries.He still writes, produces and remixs music in his own time, of every conceivable genre.::Daniel Westwood', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Daniel Westwood');
