INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1004737', 'John was born on October 25th 1989 in Orlando, Florida. At the age of 3 he was extremely accelerated in academic studies and skipped 3 grades which placed him in the second grade at the young age of 4. Landing commercials here and there such as Angel Soft, Cheerios, etc. John was looking for something more. He had done his first two videos (Healthy Herb, Kids For Character) when he was informed of a part in a cartoon network TV series (Big Bag). He received the principal boy role and was thrilled. After the first season, the cast of children left the show and went their separate ways. Now starting to enter middle school, John died down on acting and tried to focus on academics. Since the age of 3 he loved to sing and dance but he started to excel in it more than ever. Studying higher education at the University of Central Florida, he is looking to continue his acting career and pursue a recording contract and he has already opened for Rita Coolidge, performed at the TD Waterhouse, and won many awards. It is clear that John is one of the Rising Stars of tomorrow.::Jennifer Evans', 'John Edward Mountford', 'V', '1989-10-25', NULL, 'Jack Mountford');
