INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3763884', 'Born in Venice, FL and the son of a military pilot, Pearce was later raised in Baltimore, MD. As of 1988, Pearce resides in Fort Lauderdale, FL. Pearce was in Film and TV a number of years ago but left the business to provide for his wife and newborn son, Timothy Blair. When it came time for Tim to go off to college, Pearce decided to return to the business he loves, "acting". Over the past several years Pearce has appeared in a number of SAG and Independent Films such as David Winters, "Dancin'' It''s on!" and Taylor Hackford''s, "Parker". He''s also had a co-staring appearance in USA Channel''s "Burn Notice" and has had lead roles in many Commercials/Infomercial''s along with several Music Videos. Additionally, Pearce is also a Lifestyle Model and has appeared in a number of print advertisements. When he is not acting, Pearce runs his own "Executive Search and Consulting" firm.::Pearce Blair', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pearce Blair');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5791067', 'Andrew Blandina is an actor, known for Rock of Ages (2012), Endless (2012) and The Glades (2010).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Andrew Blandina');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5160838', 'Brandon Blondun was born in Fort Lauderdale, Florida on October 12, 1992. He is youngest of four (Melissa, Brent, Brian, and Brandon) in a very supportive family. His Father and Mother are Glenn and Kim Blondun. When he was 10 years old he moved to Punta Gorda, Florida. He got his acting bug at a very young age. He can remember being a toddler and walking around quoting Jim Carrey movies and doing impressions. He started doing Theater in Elementary School and fell in love with being on stage. Even though Football and sports were his main focus throughout life and in High School, Brandon always had the love of acting and would showcase it at any opportunity. He started acting for a local theater company (Charlotte Players) his Sophomore year of High School. He attended Charlotte High School where he was an active athlete. He played Football, Baseball, and Basketball for most of his high school career until deciding to pursue strictly acting his junior and senior year. Brandon''s senior year was a whirlwind of preparing for college while juggling Theater, including being the Drama Club President and being an active member of his school''s Show Choir, while also maintaining exceptional grades and several other extra curricular activities. He was the Homecoming King and Prom King at his school, as well as being voted "Most Talented" in his senior superlatives. He started pursuing Modeling along with Acting full time after he finished High School. He had immediate success as a Model having done multiple fashion shows including David''s Bridal and Dillard''s. He also started modeling for Abercrombie & Fitch after High School. Brandon made his on screen debut when he was cast as a Singing Bus Passenger in the star studded movie Rock of Ages. After having success on that set he convinced his Parents to allow him to put off College for a few years to see what Hollywood had in store for him. After the blessing from his parents, he packed up and moved out to Los Angeles. He immediately started getting auditions and booking work. He resides in Los Angeles where he continues to showcase his talent and pursue his dream.::Jamie Barnes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brandon Blondun');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5400453', 'Gail was born in The City of Brotherly Love (Phila.) a very long time ago. From the time she was little, she was singing songs of musical theatre which her father sang in community theatre. At Temple University she decided to get her BS in Communications & Theatre. After that, children''s theatre became her gateway to the Professional Theatre. Actors'' Equity card in hand she moved to The Big Apple (NYC) in 1977. Her SAG & AFTRA cards followed, and 100''s of auditions!!! Films, commercials, a cruise ship stint, and lots of theatre followed through the years. Marriage and a move to Mass. didn''t stop the work! One day, though, she and her husband decided to sell their business and move to Florida. And the rest, as they say, is History. Gail has appeared in shows at The Broward Center for the Performing Arts, The Wick Theatre, Maltz Jupiter Theatre, Actors'' Playhouse, Broward Stage Door Theatre, to name a few. Her Television and Commercial career has begun to blossom. She became instantly recognizable from her hilarious commercial for The Isles Casino, where her Karate Kick has catapulted her to new heights, including a few billboards on Interstate 95! Look for Gail next season as the irascible Mary Motherwell on the new TV series, In Sanity, Florida (with Burt Reynolds). And you can always follow her antics on Facebook!!::Gail Byer', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gail Byer');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3285781', 'Alex Caceres is an actor, known for Rock of Ages (2012), Taste It: A Comedy About the Recession (2012) and Mistress Emily (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Alex Caceres');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3206915', 'Lorraine is a busy/full-time, working actor & lifestyle model in south Florida, who''s come full circle... from acting/modeling up north where she grew up to training/going ''behind'' the camera in south Florida, developing a successful 2nd passion career as a professional social events photographer, and that career spanned over 20 years; then inevitably, Lorraine reunited with her 1st passion in life, as an actor! "Now I''m living that dream every day, right here in south Florida when not shooting on location somewhere! Everyone should be so lucky! ; )"Lorraine & her actor/model husband raised a beautiful family. Through the years, and in addition to family responsibilities, Lorraine held a ''secret clearance'' with the government in connection with one of her earlier business positions. She was both a team player & team leader, juggling multiple careers in ''Corporate America'', multitasking with senior management using her strong organizational, communication & process management skills to get the job done because ''NO'' was never an option.She also has exercised extended skill sets as a hard coder, having studied web design/development, plus various levels of computer graphics with prominence in Photoshop. At one point, Lorraine juggled three careers by choice... a full-time corporate position, her photography career and the ''rebirth'' of her fast-growing acting career. When the time was right, she retired two of these positions in order to focus on her 1st passion... acting!In her eyes, nothing compares to the unmeasurable satisfaction of achieving that one goal in life... to live your dream!::Lorraine Caporaso', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lorraine Caporaso');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6197348', 'Santos was born and raised in Brooklyn, New York. He is the eldest of four children of puerto rican parents. There he attended John Jay High School. In 1998 he moved to Florida to open his own business.Santos is a musician/actor and started playing guitar when he was a teenager in his best friend''s front porch in New York. He remembers learning with him how to play the Beatles...Later in the 80''s he formed a rock and roll band: BROKEN FURY. He had since performed in New York City in many venues for several years, including CBGB, Cafe Wha, among others.He started his acting career in 2012 when the movie Rock of Ages arrived in Florida. They were looking for rockers to do acting, and that was the beginning of his career in movies and TV series.::Santos Caraballo', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Santos Caraballo');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3549570', 'Brad Champion grew up in Orange Park, Florida and was always big into sports while maintaining an interest in acting. Even though he held that interest in acting he didn''t pursue it professionally until he graduated from Clay Highschool in Green Cove Springs, Florida. Since his entrance into the professional acting world he has been in many film projects including Disney''s The Last Song which was released into theaters in 2010, The Diary Of Preston Plummer starring Rumer Willis, and most recently guest starred on A&E''s The Glades as Blake Wyatt. Brad attended college at Florida Gulf Coast University in Fort Myers, Florida and received a degree in Political Science and is a member of the international fraternity Pi Kappa Alpha also known as "Pike". Brad''s long term goal is winning an Academy Award.::Anonymous', 'William Bradley', 'Champion', NULL, NULL, 'Brad Champion');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2542759', 'Christian Ijin Link was born as Christian Edwin Link. He is known for his work on Kathryn Davis: Take 2, Taped Rehearsal (2014), Relic Hunters: The Centaurian Helmet (2015) and Secluded (2014).::Anonymous', 'Christian Edwin', 'Link', NULL, NULL, 'Christian Ijin Link');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4415544', 'Heather Ashley Chase has been a performer, in New York, since the age of four months old. It was then, in 1988 that she first stepped onto a theater stage and was immediately stricken with the performance ''bug''. She has won several awards in Theatre, including Best Actress in a comedy and Best Actress in a drama as well as Best Supporting Actress in a comedy.In 2001 she moved to Hollywood California and within one week (actually two days) landed two lead roles in two different films. One a horror movie and the other a science fiction film.Chase was accepted to Yale School of Drama but after only eight months, she landed a lead role in a TV show that moved her back, once again, into into the heart of N.Y.C. A few years later, she returned to her studies and transferred to NYU. She also studied at NYU''s Tisch Performance Studies.Publications she has been featured in are Sassy (when she was 15 and 16), Palm Beach Magazine, Femme Fatale, Oxygen (Editorial Ad), Yoga Mind Body Spirit, Palm Beach Gardens Yoga Magazine,Travel & Leisure, Ocean Drive Magazine, Boca Magazine, Six Degrees Magazine as well as appearing on stage with Dr. Oz in Palm Beach Gardens for the Mind Body Sprit Health Expo. She has made several appearances in and around Palm Beach promoting Holistic Medicine. In 2013 she appeared on Good Morning Miami and the New York CBS Today Show. With her Master''s Degree from New York University, she is now earning her Ph.D.::Agent LTG of Green & Green', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heather Ashley Chase');
