INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3594623', 'Mike Guzman is a Boston native but moved to Florida as a youth. He always had a love for film and always somehow brought in attention even as a child in school. In his early twenties he began pursuing his passion and began working on film sets. Although love and his ex-girlfriends dislike of him pursuing the film industry telling him basically its a dream do something else.But he was so in love that he flew to England to pursue his relationship with her.After she had left him broken hearted in London, England he came back to the United States determined to make lots of money and be a successful in the business of finance. He came back to the United States pursued a career as a broker in both the commodities and stock business he then grew tired of smile and dial and being stuck in a room with no windows. He lost his customers money and then whenever he tried he lost his own money aswell. He then went into having a more blue collared type job and he still traded stocks on the side. One day his job of several years ended and he found himself online looking for work he was google searching bored unemployed and found a film called The Librarians and saw himself in the trailer on imdb. After he saw himself in the dvd of The Librarians he then began back into his pursuit of his dream after losing 6 or 7 years of his life away from the business.But in his second time around at an older age he was worked among Hollywood Actors,Adult Film Stars, Rappers, and even a Cartoonist in his semi-autobiographical comic.::Ron Shimshilashvili', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mike Guzman');
