INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0465298', 'Cathy Konrad is known for her work on Scream (1996), Walk the Line (2005) and 3:10 to Yuma (2007).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cathy Konrad');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0429318', 'The daughter of a preacher and a teacher, Tamara was born in Miami. Her first acting job was for Lucky Charms cereal/Star Wars commercial; she played Princess Leia. She was discovered by Claudia Black and Cami Patton at Ford Models, at the age of 10. She trained as an actress, singer and dancer in New York and was one of Ford''s top child models. Her first feature film was in Woody Allen''s Stardust Memories, in the ice cream shop scene.Tamara funded her acting habit with a successful modeling career. She worked in Paris, Milan, Munich, Tokyo, New York and South Beach. She has been cast by four Oscar winning directors, as well as Emmy winners. She is a precision driver, baby wrangler, has weapons training, runs marathons and is a terrible cook.She earned a Bachelor''s degree, cum laude, in History from F. I. U, Miami, FL. Her public service includes community and political action. In 2012, she was appointed by Gov. Rick Scott to serve the citizens of Florida on professional regulation board. She is the mother of 4 award-winning children.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tamara Jones');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6569397', 'Hailing from sunny South Florida, Margeaux has been active both behind the scenes and on screen in the entertainment industry.Margeaux can be seen as Tiffany Malone (lead) in a new comedic TV Pilot called "Coconut Wives," filmed under the direction of William Garcia and JTL Productions.Margeaux plays the lead role of Daniela Hardy in the new SAG Feature Film called "Booted" under the production of Tamara C. Moore-White, directed by Sean De La Nuez, and written by Derrick J. Johnson.She also played the lead role of Nicole Rae Torres in NBC Universal/Investigation Discovery Channel''s hit crime series "I''d Kill For You" (Episode 207).Margeaux can also be spotted in the movie "Rock of Ages," where she worked hands-on with director Adam Shankman choreographer Mia Michaels and actors Paul Giamatti and Eli Roth.Margeaux was a member of the Velvet Angels, a girl group previously signed to to DSM/Mercury/Island Def Jam. Working alongside music industry mogul L.A. Reid, then CEO of Island Def Jam Records, and David Massey, Margeaux experienced both the business- and talent-end of the recording industry for five years. She has performed at the American Airlines Arena, Hard Rock Live, Bank United Center and Universal City Walk in Los Angeles.She also lit up the stage as a background dancer for international artists including Pitbull, Wisin y Yandel, Belinda, Calle 13 and Thalia. Margeaux was the spokesperson of various companies including Pet Supermarket, Twist Air, Logo Kick, VSP Worldwide Productions and featured in both commercials including Party City and Cablevision. In addition, her experience acting in the movie pilot "Dancin'' on the Edge," by Jonathan Krane Productions of Look Who''s Talking 1,2,3, and JoAnn Jansen of Dirty Dancing Havana Nights, Margeaux has had tremendous experience in front of the camera and on the stage.With more 20 years of dance training, five years of vocal training and acting lessons with some of the top instructors in the world, Margeaux''s love and knowledge of many facets of the entertainment industry shine bright. Margeaux recorded with top music producers including J.R. Rotem, Christopher ''Tricky'' Stewart, The Dream, Brian Kennedy, Lindy Robbins, and Damon Sharpe during her experience with the Velvet Angels. Margeaux has trained with the renowned Jane Kelly at the Actor''s Workshop of South Florida, the Acting School of South Florida and at the prestigious University of Florida School of Theatre and Dance.Margeaux graduated Summa Cum Laude from the University of Florida in May 2013. With a B.S. in Public Relations from the No. 3 ranked public relations department in the nation and minor in Theatre, she was also awarded the prestigious Florida Public Relations Association Award by the UF faculty and dean for excellent service, character and academic achievement. She was also a member of the Dazzlers, the official spirit squad dance team of UF athletics.::Publicist', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Margeaux Jordan');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2292015', 'Shauna Kae Lauritzen is known for her work on The City of Lights (2009), History of Made Up Things (2009) and Rock of Ages (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Shauna Kae Lauritzen');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2877005', 'Valentina Karantoni was born on February 14, 1984 in Limassol, Cyprus as Valentina Anastasia Karantonis. She is known for her work on Healthy Body, Healthy Mind (2003), Sacred Whispers (2012) and Le théâtre, le vent et la chanteuse (2012).::Anonymous', 'Valentina Anastasia', 'Karantonis', '1984-02-14', NULL, 'Valentina Karantoni');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4330801', 'Irene Kelly is an actress, known for D.D.I.N.A.P. (2012), Rock of Ages (2012) and Play Dead (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Irene Kelly');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2331453', 'Sean Patrick Kennedy was born in Massachusetts. The son of Ballet Mistress Lynda DeChane. Being cast in the Indiana Jones Stunt Spectacular as Indiana Jones at the Disney M.G.M. Studios, Sean began an unexpected career. Sean worked on TV in the B.S.B. production Thunder in Paradise (on Disney property) under the wing of Executive producer Tom Greene as an outside contractor/Story Board artist and also working in front of the camera as stunt talent for Hulk Hogan and Chris Lemmon.While at "Thunder in Paradise" Mr. Kennedy had the good fortune of working alongside an up and coming Producer Kevin Beggs. Kevin is now the President of TV and film development for Loinsgate Entertainment. While working with Mr.Beggs, Sean was tapped to promote Thunder in Paradise at SCI-FI conventions, by providing them with talent and screenings. After T.I.P. had wrapped it''s first season, Sean joined the art department for Steven Speilberg''s Seaquest DSV, when the show arrived at Universal Studios Florida. Sean worked in the art department and helped in the re-fit and design of the new ship''s bridge after the vessels season 1 destruction. The show lasted in Orlando for two seasons.Sean moved to Los Angeles and quickly got work as an actor in Guardian of the Realm and Reflections of Evil. He then joined the cast and crew of SoCalfim Group founded by Ted Elliot and Terry Rossio (Writers of Mask of Zorro, Shrek, Pirates of the Caribbean 1,2,3,4,5,6-) where he learned the in''s & out''s of how independent and main stream films are made in Hollywood.A jack of many trades Mr. Kennedy created and designed screen used props for The Chronicles of Riddick (2004) and building and selling his personal Green 1967 Mustang Fastback ("Hero Car") to Universals Fast & Furious III: Tokyo Drift.After a tragic Car Accident forced a 5yr hiatus, Sean began acting again in 2009 and earned the lead roll in "Bye Bye Birdie" paying Albert Peterson. He then followed it up with a 2nd stage lead as Jeff Douglas in "Brigadoon." He then won the high stakes roll of a lifetime playing Sky Masterson in "Guys & Dolls" to finish out 2010. In 2011, Sean stretched his acting muscles starring in "The Secret Garden" as the evil Dr. Neville Craven and during the 2012 Presidential election season, Sean challenged his acting chops by playing a "win at any cost" Presidential candidate, (lead) Joe Cantwell in the Gore Vidal Classic"The Best Man" for which he won the W.I.T.A. Award for best actor.Sean Patrick Kennedy is the Creator/Author of: Sam Savage: PI, The Coffee Shop, Eaten..., Nightmare at 35000, Feet, Rocky Raccoon, Ebbets Deli, Coming of Age, P.R., The King vs..., Cosplay and the new reality TV show, Movie Houses Unknown with Sean Patrick Kennedy.::Sean Patrick Kennedy', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sean Patrick Kennedy');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3851181', 'Grant Koo is known for his work on Black Panther (2018), Transformers: Age of Extinction (2014) and Blindspot (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Grant Koo');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4397175', 'Helmy Lavezzari is an actress, known for Rock of Ages (2012), Sunshine State of Mind: Casting the Glades (2011) and My Heart Beats for Lola Volcán (2011). She has been married to Gustavo Lavezzari since April 25, 2008.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Helmy Lavezzari');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4135402', 'Tracy Lee is an actor, known for Percentage (2014), War Dogs (2016) and Rock of Ages (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tracy Lee');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3922399', 'Gisselle Legere is a drama writer. Gisselle''s earliest memories are of being woken up at the crack of dawn by the radio; her grandfather listening to Radio Mambi, the anti-communist propaganda that the US broadcasts towards Havana. Her family fled from Cuba as political refugees, and landed in Miami where her childhood was shaped by the intense narratives of survivors of oppression and persecution. Although she lost most of her hearing to a childhood vaccine, the memory of that early wake-up call and her family''s history led to an interest in politics and human rights.Growing up deaf in a hearing world gave Gisselle many opportunities to hone her observational skills, which helped her as she moved through various careers...as a ballerina, then as a judo competitor, and eventually, as a scientist. As a field epidemiologist, she spent a decade working in bio-defense and chasing disease outbreaks across the globe. This hands-on knowledge of medicine and research shapes the scientific speculation that set her stories apart.After writing and producing a series of shorts, a web-series and feature, it finally dawned on her that bringing stories to life is where all her different interests come together, and she began to pursue writing professionally. She was selected for the Sundance Screenwriters Intensive in 2015, as well as being a three-time finalist for various 2016 Sundance labs, including the Sundance & Sloan Commission for Science in Films fellowship. In 2017, she began writing for Disney-ABC Television.::D. Bellini', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gisselle Legere');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3987330', 'Laurel Levey is a paradox; a natural blonde with brains, talent and drive. She was born & raised in Southern California & theatrically trained by her mother, a celebrated British stage actress. Laurel grew up excelling in acting, dancing and gymnastics, which combined with her bubbly and enthusiastic persona, makes her a formidable on-screen performer. Her broad range of life experiences (marriage, divorce, single motherhood, career woman, and her many years living abroad) has prepared her to understand and inhabit the diverse personalities she has played on stage, in film, popular TV shows and in a broad range of foreign & domestic commercials. She has also handled numerous voice-dubbing assignments and is proficient in five languages; American English, British English, Spanish, Hebrew and Valley Girl. With her three daughters now grown, Laurel is passionately dedicating her full time to the show business career she was always meant to have.::Neil Golin - Screenwriter, Director', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laurel Levey');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1985070', 'Janelle Marie is a South Florida native that began her career at a very young age. She started taking dance classes for fun at age 5, where she was approached to participate in a television show known as Sabado Gigante to be apart of their children ensemble making appearances thru out the season in comedy sketches, dancing or on their children judges panel . Since then Janelle was continually booked for national campaign commercials, such as McDonald''s, Pepsi (featuring Shakira), Red Lobster, and more. At age 7 she landed a lead hosting role in a children''s bilingual television series known as "El show de Lucky" where she filmed 62 episodes. In 2005 she was invited to perform ballroom at the Apollo Theater in Harlem, NY. In 2005Initially, it was music that gave Janelle the opportunity to travel to Los Angeles. Music Producer, Andrew Lane (High School Musical, Hannah Montana,Disneymania 4, and Manny Fresh) took interest in her and they began to collaborate on projects. It was not until Fall of 2011 that she made the decision to move to Los Angeles to study her craft and broaden her opportunities in her career.Upon her move Janelle Marie has danced in the MTV VMAs, ABC American Music Awards, Shake it Up Chicago and Austin & Ally.Janelle Marie made her debut as an actress in the TNT Michael Bay Series "The Last Ship" with her role of Karina in July 2014. She has made guest appearances on NBC''s Constantine and most recently CBS''s NCIS: LA with over 11 million viewers.Currently Janelle Marie is a host for Disney Channel Movie Surfers.::JMR', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Janelle Marie');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4312369', 'Kira Marie was born as Kira Marie Chichersky. She is known for her work on Rock of Ages (2012), I Am Number Four (2011) and Wrong (2012).::Anonymous', 'Kira Marie', 'Chichersky', NULL, NULL, 'Kira Marie');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3692538', 'John McGlothlin is an actor and producer, known for Dusk (2015), Divergence (2012) and Taste It: A Comedy About the Recession (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'John McGlothlin');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0684336', 'Steve Pink was born in the USA. He is a director and writer, known for Hot Tub Time Machine (2010), Accepted (2006) and High Fidelity (2000).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Steve Pink');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3950536', 'John is a member of SAG-AFTRA and was born in the New York City suburbs to a large and proud Irish family. He was the 3rd of sixth children: 4 girls and 2 boys. He relocated to Ft. Myers Beach at the young age of 10 where his passion for acting grew. John''s earliest memories of acting began when he was 5 years old playing with his Nana and being a part of school and church productions. John''s passion for acting never diminished but he pursued other passions and interests as he grew older. It wasn''t until he moved to Miami, Florida where an opportunity arose again and his passion for acting was reignited. It was there he was able to pursue his lifelong dream. A week later, John was a part of "Marley and Me." John landed other notable roles while pursuing his acting career in Miami, starring in numerous movies such as Stalker, Swampfoot, Miami Mid-town Crew, The Killing of a Japanese Bookie, A Slice of Life, Augustus and It''s Happening, Finally. Augustus and It''s Happening, Finally both won the best film at the Miami and Boca Film Festival respectively. John has also guest starred on numerous TV shows and has been seen in numerous commercials across the nation. John is also an experienced professional trainer and fighter who enjoys helping people stay fit in his off time. He currently lives in Miami and does travel for assignments.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'John McKarthy');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5133842', 'Stephanie McLane is an actress, known for Pain & Gain (2013), Rock of Ages (2012) and Step Up Revolution (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Stephanie McLane');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5648219', 'Tom Milana is an American actor from East Meadow, NY. In 2007. Tom''s first performance was as an extra in the motion picture "The Son of Morning" staring Heather Graham, Lorraine Braco and Danny Glover. Since that time, Tom has enjoyed success on many well known motion pictures and television programs as a featured actor (Graceland), stand-in (Iron-man-3) featured extra and he continues to enjoy being a well appreciated and active SAG-AFTRA union member. He is a motorcycle enthusiast, a self proclaimed chef, a world traveler and aspiring philanthropist.::Tom Milana', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tom Milana');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3213011', 'Taylor Anthony Miller is an actor and director, known for Boats (2013), Magic City (2012) and Cross Streets: 81st St and Broadway (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Taylor Anthony Miller');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4846327', 'Jim Mitchell (James Douglas Mitchell) was born at the Christ Hospital in Cincinnati, Hamilton County, Ohio. His father Douglas was originally a research engineer with Formica Corporation in Cincinnati-his mother Linda was a high-school English teacher. However, when Jim was six months old, his father decided he didn''t want Jim growing up on the Cincinnati streets. Douglas then quit his Formica engineer''s job. He built a homemade trailer, attached it to the back of their family car (an old 1953 Plymouth Cranbrook coupe) loaded up their belongings and moved his family to Bartlesville, Oklahoma to go into the oil & gas producing/ranching/farming business with Jim''s grandfather. (Orville Anderson Mitchell) As a result, from an early age Jim was either drilling new oil and gas wells (usually with antiquated "cable-tool" oilfield drilling rigs) "pulling" wells (doing well maintenance work on existing older wells) salvaging out oilfield equipment or buying/selling oil & gas properties. He also worked cattle, baled hay, did blacksmithing/welding, mechanic work and so on. When Jim wasn''t doing that, he was working for his grandmother (Nora Vickers Mitchell-a well-known Bartlesville antique dealer) repairing/refinishing Victorian/Edwardian furniture. However, Jim always had Hollywood in his sights, as he had one great-uncle (Floyd Blackman) that had acted in two Hollywood silent films after his military service in "War One", but later worked mainly as a cameraman throughout the 1920''s and ''30''s. In addition, while growing up he knew two actors from the Bartlesville area: Gretchen Wyler and Ben Johnson. (Gretchen was in his father''s high-school class, while Ben was a close friend of his paternal grandmother.)The first film job Jim acquired was when he bluffed his way onto Tim Burton''s "Mars Attacks" film set as a Production Assistant-the location was a small Mennonite town called Burns, Kansas-completely surrounded by Kansas wheat fields. He stripped the Oklahoma license plate off a black, 1975 Cadillac Eldorado convertible, replaced them with a set of expired California plates, loaded up extra clothes, food and supplies, put the top down and then headed for Burns. When he got there, he found a mob of reporters, news crews, fans and a lot of Kansas State Troopers-who''s job it was to seal off the town''s entrances during filming. However, when he pulled up, introduced himself and said he "was running late, but still needed to get into work"....To his surprise, the troopers waved the crowds aside and let him pass...He immediately parked the car and started working for Tim Burton as if he belonged there-didn''t get caught by Security until noon the next day. Luckily, an attractive and kind-hearted Assistant Director he had been working with saved him from being thrown out of town and he got to continue working on the film. He spent his last day there assigned to Joe Don Baker, and was then invited to continue working with Burton''s crew at Kingman, Arizona.The area where Jim had grown up had cranked out a lot of other film stars, such as Tom Mix, Sid Jordan, Emmett Dalton (from "Dalton Gang" outlaw fame) Will Rogers, Clark Gable, Flora Campbell and Terrence Malick.::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jim Mitchell');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3897386', 'Karina was born in Barranquilla, Colombia. As a child she would try to play any instrument that she had in front of her, also dance and sing songs in front of her family and friends. That''s why her father bought her first guitar when she was 7 and she learned how to play and sing at school. She wrote her first song when she was 11 and performed in every event she could. After graduated she decided to go to law school and music school at the same time. She graduated for EMAS (Escuela de Musica Alvin Schutmaat) and finished the 5 basic years of law school. When she was 20, she got into the finalists of Popstars from Caracol TV Colombia and started modeling and singing more. That passion brought her to Miami, where she model for big designers and performed every week singing in one of the most prestigious private clubs in Miami Beach where she got to create her famous Karaoke nights and sing for big stars like Gloria and Emilio Estefan, John Mayer, Jennifer Aniston, Bon Jovi''s band and others. She always loved acting and took many lessons with Hector Zabaleta (Telemundo Coach), Carlos Perez (Venevision International Director and coach), recently with Adriana Barraza (Oscar Nominated actress), Stewart Solomon & Lori Wyman (casting director). Her career started going up when she was called to be on Model Latina for SITV in Los Angeles and other productions for Telemundo, Venevision and Mun2 TV. She booked her first Movie speaking scene on Ironman 3 where she worked with Robert Downey Jr. and Ben Kingsley, released on 2013.::Jorge F.', 'Karina Paola Florez', 'Velez', NULL, NULL, 'Kary Musa');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2747773', 'Maria Musebrink is an actress, known for El percance perfecto (2007), Aram, Aram (2015) and Armenia, My Love... (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Maria Musebrink');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4172506', 'Edwin Negron is known for his work on Marido En Alquiler (2013), Dama y Obrero (2013) and Grachi (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Edwin Negron');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5222491', 'Mina formally known as Ann-Marie Torres is a native New Yorker, who has made her home in Florida, she has always had a passion for entertaining.She has been formally trained by new york,California and Florida casting directors and teachers. She briefly took a course in The Meisner approach. Mina has enjoyed a career in acting for now 15 years, 10 of it was in theatre. She then took an extended break and ventured back into acting when a car accident nearly took her life.Her one true passion was acting and she stepped back into the field in 2009 but this time to work in front of the camera.In her quest to live her dreams she has been in films,shorts, voice overs, webisodes, commercials, print jobs, theater and training videos. She has training in on-camera acting, character analysis, scene study, commercials and improv. She can also do some basic stunts as seen in some of her works such as Charlie''s Angels the tv show, Hunter''s Circle feature film, Trust and the Awakening films. Mina opened up her own production company in 2013 with her Co-founder Bonnie Cobb. Their goal is to not only film their own films but provide opportunity for others who are talented but may not be given a chance to show case their work. Mina hopes to continue her career on a national level and paying it forward every chance she can.::Amt', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mina Ownlee');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4953748', 'Tatiana Paris was born into a show business family. Her father a jazz singer and her mother an actress, Tatiana Paris started her early career at 2 years of age, performing in her family''s national touring theater show. By the age of 15 years she emerged as a seasoned entertainer having done well over 2,000 live performances nationwide.Drawn to the cinema, Tatiana dove into her film acting career with a vengeance. Landing over 30 leading and supporting roles in a few short years in both local, regional and national features including A Quiet Farewell (2012), Rock of Ages (2012) and The Acquisition (2013). She soon not only honed her skills as an actress but also evolved into a professional and consummate writer, director and producer, co-founding her own independent production company in 2013.A true perfectionist in her craft who prepares meticulously for each new role, Tatiana Paris continues to build a reputation as an actress of depth, distinction and style.::Bitty Ent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tatiana Paris');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3360922', 'Jennie Parrish is known for her work on Ride Along 2 (2016), The Disappointments Room (2016) and The Last Word (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jennie Parrish');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0842765', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Marsha L. Swinton');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0642277', 'Patrick O''Neill is a writer and producer, known for Knight and Day (2010), Bang Bang (2014) and Dead Last (2001).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Patrick O''Neill');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2576700', 'Born at Andrew''s Air Force Base in Maryland. His father is a retired USAF Intelligence Officer, and his mother teaches art at a private school. They divorced when he was 5. He has an older brother and five younger half-siblings.Nicholas played baseball like most kids but was always the entertainer on the team. At age 10 he discovered being an actor could be a real job after watching the film Rebel Without a Cause (1955) along side his Grandma ''Betty'', who just so happened to grow up in the same town of ''James Dean (1)'' in Fairmount, IN. She would tell Nicholas stories of watching ''Jimmy'' act in plays and riding his Indian motorcycle through town. Nicholas was encouraged that if a kid from a small town could make his dreams a reality, so could he.At age 12 Nicholas was admitted to The Governor''s (Magnet) School for the Arts, in Norfolk, VA. Where he spent his high school time studying the World of Theater and performance. He made his professional Theater debut with The Virginia Stage Company in the musical Peter Pan at 15. He went on to receive a B.A. in Theater from George Mason University.Nicholas made his first Television appearance on USA''s Burn Notice (2007) which was soon followed by a recurring role playing the sidekick ''Stanzi Palmer'' opposite ''Scott Cohen'' on Necessary Roughness (2011), then joined USA again for a small role on Graceland (2013). His Network debut occurred with _"MacGyver"(2016)_.His big break came after being cast by Michael Bay as the "Motel Clerk" opposite Mark Wahlberg, Dwayne Johnson, and Tony Shalhoub in the dark comedy Pain & Gain (2013). This was soon followed by landing the lead role in the feature-film Power of the Air (2018) opposite Patty Duke, her last cinematic role before her untimely death.In 2016 Nicholas began work on his first Documentary A Horse of a Different Color (2018).::Anynomous', 'Nicholas Xaver', 'Parsons', '1979-10-13', NULL, 'Nicholas X. Parsons');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4167150', 'Indra has been competitive since her youth. She was in Gymnastics at age 3 and went on to compete in dance, drill team, and played volleyball in high school- as well as in college on scholarship. Working thru seven years of college she obtained her business degree from Pepperdine while in Los Angeles, pursuing her dreams of music and film. Also In college she studied- voice, acting, dance, music, and sound engineering. Her first big break was playing the Vans "Warped Tour" in 2003 and being endorsed by the bass amp company Gallien Krueger. At this time Indra had been a bass player singer for nearly six years. Her goals thru her artistry are to bring awareness that we are a world of one and that its absolutely necessary to love and accept people so that our world can co-exist and even exist at all. She believes the arts from Music, Dance, and Film- can be the voice of all people to cross boundaries and unite the world as one voice.::SJP', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Indra Patel');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5148943', 'Heathyre Perara was born on October 19, 1980 in Warwick, New York, USA. She is known for her work on Pain & Gain (2013), Chu and Blossom (2014) and The Hunter''s Moon (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, '1980-10-19', NULL, 'Heathyre Perara');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3714757', 'Ryan Powers is an actor and writer, known for The Nice Guys (2016), Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. (2013) and Grease Live! (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ryan Powers');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2766218', 'Julie Anne was born and raised in the St. Petersburg, Florida area. She was inspired to pursue a career in the entertainment business at an early age. Her mother was a stay at home mom, and children''s book / screenplay writer, who encouraged Julie to write and perform throughout her childhood and early teens.By the age of 20, Julie Anne had established herself as a spokesmodel (working with companies such as Troma Studios and Sony PlayStation), as well as a widely published alternative model appearing in such nationally distributed publications as Gothic Beauty Magazine.Soon after, she began performing small variety shows, as a way to have more action in her art. But stage performance was not enough for Julie Anne, she wanted to go even further and pursue full creative expression as an actress.Since accepting her first role, Julie Anne has been working non stop, both in front of the camera as well as behind the scenes. Presently she has an impressive film resume, ranging from feature length films, award winning shorts, to nationally televised programs.As far as future goals, she is actively pursuing projects that will allow her to grow and strengthen her skills, and expand her resume into yet uncharted territory. With a strong work ethic, unlimited energy, and unequalled passion for the business, she is poised and determined to conquer her vision as well as simply enjoying the lifelong journey.::Barry Ratcliffe', NULL, NULL, '1983-08-03', NULL, 'Julie Anne Prescott');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2721611', 'Lisa Marie Quillinan is known for her work on Beverly Hills Chihuahua (2008), Rock of Ages (2012) and Children on Their Birthdays (2002).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lisa Marie Quillinan');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3569027', 'Carl Alleyne is known for his work on What''s Your Number? (2011), Knight and Day (2010) and Furry Vengeance (2010).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Carl Alleyne');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1357069', 'Nicholas Art was born on January 13, 1999 in Connecticut, USA as Nicholas Reese Art. He is an actor, known for Syriana (2005), Taking Chance (2009) and The Nanny Diaries (2007).::Anonymous', 'Nicholas Reese', 'Art', '1999-01-13', NULL, 'Nicholas Art');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4439147', 'Jacqueline Astbury is an actress and producer, known for The Contender (2000), American Hustle (2013) and Right There (2014).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jacqueline Astbury');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5882938', 'Nicole Boucher is an actress, known for Her Velvet Underground (2014), Eye for an Eye: A Séance in VR (2016) and Those Who Can''t (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nicole Boucher');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1874994', 'Gonzalo Bouza is known for his work on Money (2016), Anomalous (2016) and Sin tetas no hay paraíso (2008).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gonzalo Bouza');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4266989', 'Jeremy Gilbert is an actor, known for Who''s Jenna...? (2016), Jurassic World: Fallen Kingdom (2018) and On Empty (2010).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jeremy Gilbert');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0391344', 'Matt Holloway is known for his work on Iron Man (2008), Transformers - L''ultimo cavaliere (2017) and Punisher: War Zone (2008).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Matt Holloway');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1436466', 'Art Marcum is a writer, known for Iron Man (2008), Transformers - L''ultimo cavaliere (2017) and Punisher: War Zone (2008).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Art Marcum');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4461741', 'Heidi Rae Anderson is a proud Native of Wisconsin, where the rest of her family currently resides. Shortly after her high school days she began her expedition to the great fame Hollywood California. To seek her craft, she immediately enrolled in as many acting classes and Drama at local theaters. She decided that she wanted to be an actress. It has always been her dream to become a world renowned actress. HeidiRae now is a character actress can be recognized among many films and television shows,and Music Videos. These are a few of her experienced films today. Rock of Ages , Step Up Revolution, Wayne''s World, Drake & Lil Wayne Music Video , The Doors, Wild At Heart, China Beach, It has always been her goal to be a memorable actress that always had a love for her audience.She puts her heart and termination into every movie part she works on. Over the years she has accumulated a considerable amount of knowledge in the movie industry and a tremendous amount of charter.Growing up through her childhood years she had a fascination with reading every book possible about acting, and the film industry of all the acting greats. She has had the opportunity to work with many well known celebrities that have given her the incentive to further her career such as Russell Brand, Tom Cruise, Harrison Ford, Burt Reynolds, Nick Nolte, Val Kilmer, Billy Crystal, Bruce Willis, Brandon Frasher, Mark Walberg, Cindy Williams, Heather Lockheart, Pamela Anderson, Dania Deleli,just to name a few. These are the most recent films I''m she''s in. Rock of Ages, Step up Revolution, Pain and Gain, The Becoming, While working in Hollywood California, before moving to Florida her work led her to travel to many different set locations all across the United States.In her free time HeidiRae has always loved the music industry as well. So she studied music and then she started to sing in plays and drama shows with her dancing experience.::H.R.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heidi Rae');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5620230', 'Andrew Raffelson is known for his work on Sharknado 3: Oh Hell No! (2015), TNA Impact! Wrestling (2004) and S.O.S.: Women to the Sea 2 (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Andrew Raffelson');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4462472', 'Terry has appeared in the movies: Confessions of a Shopaholic, Rock of Ages and The Becoming. He has also appeared in the following television shows: Burn Notice, The Glades and Americas''s Most Wanted. He has also appeared in commercials for the former Cleveland Lumberjacks Professional Hockey Team. He continues to work in the South Florida area where he resides.::Terry L. Reed', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Terry L. Reed');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4995898', 'Christina Rodriguez is known for her work on Killer Island (2018), Girlfriend Killer (2017) and Boyfriend Killer (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Christina Rodriguez');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0307776', 'Todd Garner is a producer and writer, known for xXx (2002), Anger Management (2003) and 13 Going on 30 (2004).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Todd Garner');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5653651', 'Joe Rodriguez is a New York-based actor, comedian, writer, and director. After creating short amateur sketches for the YouTube, he began studying comedic improv in South Florida when he was 18. Under the direction of UCB Alumna, Kat Kenny, Joe performed with troupes "Adult Beverage" and "Friends with Benefits." He has taken classes and performed with The Upright Citizen''s Brigade, David Razowsky, Sick Puppies Comedy, Bob Carter''s Actors Rep, Just the Funny, and more.In 2012, Joe enrolled at NYU''s film program at Tisch School of the Arts. His first student film was honored as a finalist at the 2014 Cannes Film Festival. His senior project, Mr. Madison (2014), was a comedic drama about impersonating his grandfather. The film went on to win The Russell Hexter Filmmaker Grant, Malcolm Ross Memorial Production Award, and "Best Actress," for co-star, C.J. Gelfand at the 2015 First Run Festival.After graduating, Joe made a comedic web series called "Weather Together" with fellow "Friends with Benefits" troupe member, Carrie Gregory. The duo played two terrible meteorologists who consistently blundered the South Florida broadcast. Carrie and Joe co-wrote and starred in six or so episodes, 2 to 5 minutes each. Their sketches featured wacky behavior- from getting lettuce stuck in their teeth to reacting to nonexistent tornados.::Joe Rodriguez', NULL, NULL, '1992-01-11', NULL, 'Joe Rodriguez');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4833530', 'Tony Saiz is an actor, known for Deathguard (2013), Rock of Ages (2012) and Step Up Revolution (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tony Saiz');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8807989', 'Jennifer Elderman Sanz is an actor, known for Rock of Ages (2012), Chaos in Gotham City (2012) and Money Mechanics (2013).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jennifer Elderman Sanz');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3683421', 'Katie Schaar is known for her work on Rock of Ages (2012), Katy Perry: The Prismatic World Tour (2015) and Dream in American (2011).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Katie Schaar');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6491555', 'Metisha Schaefer is a writer and aspiring actress. Born and raised in Europe, she developed a love for the creative arts and accomplished an impressive level of success hosting many television shows in her hometown of Cologne, Germany. Wanting to explore her options and take her career to the next level she bravely decided to move to Miami, Florida in 2009.Since her move to the us, her career has grown powerful. Her beauty has landed her on the covers of nationwide magazines, Maxim, being one of her most popular. Aside from being the main host at many charity events and movie premieres, she has also had acting roles in various music videos of performers such as Jennifer Lopez, 50 Cent, Nicki Minaj, David Guetta, Sean Paul, Chris Brown, Pitbull, FloRida and Timbaland.She has been accepted by the Hispanic community, appearing several times on the hit network Telemundo on shows such as "Levantate". Her premiere on VH1''s "Beverly Hils Fabulous" gave her more exposure and opened many more doors for her in the acting community. She landed a role on the Tom Cruise film "Rock of Ages" and took the leading role in a commercial production for Dr. Pepper.At now, Metisha starting her career as a fitness model and actress around the globe.::VMG', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Metisha Schaefer');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4391932', 'Ron Rafael Shimshilashvili is a Israeli Actor & Singer who has a net worth of $1.18 million. Shimshilashvili was born in Netanya, Israel, and later at the age of 3 moved to Antwerp, Belgium. His parents named hem Ron Rafael because when they were young they listened to the songs of a famous Israeli Hip Hop/Pop singer Ron Shoval and Rafael is the name of the grandfather. They gave him the nickname "Dubi", which means "Bear" in Hebrew, because he was as big and cute like a bear so often as a baby. Shimshilashvili grew up in Antwerp, Belgium, and attended Tachkemoni Atheneum. At the age of 15 Shimshilashvili moved to Miami! Shimshilashvili has said that he would "flip out" if he got a "B" and not an "A" in school, and has also described himself as having been a class clown. Although self-described as not academically gifted, he remained focused enough to achieve an overall GPA of 3.55. He subsequently appeared in theater productions at his high school, and began taking singing lessons. He was later signed to the Elite Talent Agency. Shimshilashvili began his acting career at age eight, playing Student on King Solomon Hotel. He said that he learned "everything" about how to act while on the show. He later had minor roles. Shimshilashvili has been described as having a Celebrity looks alike: Robert De Niro, Sylvester Stallone & Steven Seagal.Ron speaks various languages like Hebrew, Dutch, French, English, Georgian, Russian & Spanish. Ron at a young age of 15 started his modeling and acting career. For him, Modeling and Acting are fields that he''s truly passionate about, but at the same time too, Ron is also an athletic guy who enjoys Basketball, Rugby & Water polo. Ron appeared in the following Films: What Teenagers Want to do, Hanoar Hatzioni, The Lovers and Friends Show, Crackhead Jesus the Movie, College Rule, International Lovers & The Fighter. He also had the following Television appearances at MTV''s Is She Really Going Out with Him?, Neustria Tele''s Halloween, Sun Sports Dwayne Wade''s Buzzer, 3 on 3 Basketball Competition, Park Live, Channel 7''s Weather & Alguien te Mira on Telemundo, Nisha, Zombie Land, Santa vs. Zombies , Chocolate Star Entertainment, Romantic City, Love Divided By Money, The Glades, Burn Notice & Rock Of Ages. Theater is also something that Ron is passionate on; he had performed at Tachkemoni Atheneum for Plays La Conference De Livre1 and 2, Bourla Theaters for Coffers Op Reis, Calibri School''s for Zoo, Romi Goldmuntz Centrum for Bat Mitzvah Party & King Solomon Hotel for The Stand-up Comedy Show. Commercials are also something that Ron is passionate on; He has been on YOUniversity Commercial, Pepsi Commercial, Green Bay Packers Commercial, Taxman Commercial & Hollywood Hotels Resorts Commercial. Ron, aside from being a talented actor is also a professional model, represented by Elite Models. Ron shares in his recent interview with Next Hottest Model, which highlights the top models in both US and International scenes, "I love modeling, and acting, when I''m in the movie, I feel free, peace, just enjoying life!" Ron had taken various courses in Modeling from Ad Miami, Flair Modeling, and got what it Takes Modeling. He had done different major Print and Modeling campaigns with Fashion brand, Abercrombie and Fitch, Israel Magazines, Netanya Magazine, TKO, Armani Shirts & Modeled for Levis Jeans.In Feb 2010, Shimshilashvili appeared in "Crack head Jesus the Movie" which won first place at the "Delray Beach Film Festival". In June, 2010, Shimshilashvili appeared in the International Lovers Movie, which came out in Theaters in March of 2011. In November, 2010, Shimshilashvili appeared on a Pepsi Commercial. Shimshilashvili also appeared on MTV''S "Is she really going out with him", Later Shimshilashvili got an audition for a new movie "The Detective Story" Simshilashvili made the Audition and became the main character of this movie as "Vinny". In December 2010 Shimshilashvili Appeared on The Fighter. In February, 13th 2012 Shimshilashvili got nominated as "Best Actor" and won! Shimshilashvili also appears in Rock of Ages as a comedian! Now currently working on a new movie called "Romantic City" and on his first CD Album calls "Baby you are the one!"::IMDB Management', 'Ron Rafael', 'Shimshilashvili', '1991-11-26', NULL, 'Ron Shimshilashvili');
