INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('6165018', 'David Matthew Jenkins is an American actor born on August 21, 1973 in Evansville, Indiana. Known as Matt, in his hometown of Boonville, Indiana, Jenkins dreamed of moving to Hollywood to pursue a career as an actor. However, following high school graduation, he was extended an offer to one of the nation''s oldest military colleges and awarded an Army ROTC federal scholarship. He studied as a cadet at Marion Military Institute in Marion, Alabama, and at the age of 20, was commissioned as an Army officer. He further studied at Indiana University earning a bachelor''s degree in Education with a concentration in English and History, and he later earned a master''s degree in Public Administration from Indiana State University. Pursuing a career move to Hawaii, he began auditioning and appearing in local commercials. His relaxed Midwestern style soon proved an asset as directors found him easy to work with on camera. He was cast in the independent film ForGet Him (2013), as Will the Mechanic, a local town gossip who owned an auto repair shop. His next role soon followed in Los Angeles, in the sequel film, Wiener Dog Internationals (2014), where he played the role of the exuberant race photographer. His most dramatic portrayal is as Calvin, a sinister and violent cop who is the kingpin of corruption in the movie Popolo (2015). Most recently, he stars in the comedy Juniper Lane (2016). David Matthew Jenkins is also the author of the book, " Becoming A Great Leader, " developing your leadership attributes to better serve your organization. The self-help genre work discusses numerous techniques for leaders and Jenkins talks about his many experiences leading people. The book is scheduled for publication in 2016.::Patrick Snow', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'David Matthew Jenkins');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5454624', 'Tamika started her acting career in April 2014 while completing her last semester in graduate school at Southern University A&M College. She landed a feature role as a student leader in the movie Pitched Perfect 2, a reporter in the movie The Whole Truth, and a stenographer in the movie Best of Me.::Tamika Johnson', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tamika Shanell Johnson');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5072416', 'Wendy Clarice Jordan was born on October 26, 1977 in Louisiana, USA. She is an actress, known for Nine Dead (2010), Jurassic World (2015) and Killing Them Softly (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, '1977-10-26', NULL, 'Wendy Clarice Jordan');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5728027', 'Originally from Belarus, Eastern Europe, Olga has a degree in Political Science from the University of California, Berkeley. She has studied acting at the renowned Scott Rogers Studios in Honolulu, Hawai''i, since 2011. Since then, Olga has worked on national and international commercials, including DISNEY, FUJI, and FORD, on multiple short films, and played co-leads in "Calista House", directed by Hollywood''s Glenn Plummer, and "Angel By Thursday", an independent drama filmed in Hawai''i. She co-produced and acted in a short film entitled "Chekhov''s The Proposal", which is an adaptation of Anton Chekhov''s one-act comedic play, and is now in post-production. Make sure to catch Olga in a supporting role in "Mike and Dave Need Wedding Dates" (2016) opposite Zac Efron and Adam DeVine, which is rumored to be the best and most hilarious comedy of the summer.::Olga Kalashnikova', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Olga Kalashnikova');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2841643', 'Brent Kappel is a director and writer, known for Like Them (2017), Contracted: Phase II (2015) and Dementia (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brent Kappel');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5673216', 'Joseph Kingsley looks great in a suit, and his prominent frame and imposing voice make him ideal for roles as respected, but generally liked, authority figures. With a kindly face that suggests a sympathetic nature fronted by a confident exterior, Kingsley shows great potential in excelling in every role he attempts.He was born on October 22, 1985 at 12:55am in Ft. Lauderdale, FL. Kingsley grew up in Laurel Delaware until his enlistment in the United States Navy at the age of 20.After being honorably discharged from service, Kingsley pursued his bachelor''s degree from the University of Hawai''i at Manoa.::Joseph Kingsley', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Joseph Kingsley');
