INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7393245', 'Keiston France is a Christian actor, known for Shooting the Prodigal, BBQ Pitmasters and Journey to Appomattox. He was born on January 13, 1995 in Richmond, VA to Patricia and Keith France, and now resides in Amelia Court House, VA. Keiston graduated from Prince Edward County High School in 2013 and attends North Carolina A&T State University, with the expectation of graduating by the year 2017, on a partial tennis scholarship while majoring in Journalism and Mass Communications.Keiston loves God and is not afraid to admit it. He is also is a huge sports fan, with his favorite being NASCAR. Upon earning a degree from North Carolina A&T, Keiston inspires to work as a tire changer for an NASCAR pit crew. Aside from being a Student-Athlete, Mr. France enjoys writing, exercising, collecting, playing video games, being around family members and friends, and eating healthy.Keiston has always dreamed of doing something fun for a living. Whether it may be becoming a professional athlete, film producer/director, camera operator, actor, tire changer or even a chef. Mr. France often mentions that he wants to enjoy going to work every morning. Never the less, Keiston is willing to do whatever God wants him to. He also mentions, "We may have all of these dreams and aspirations, but we must willing to change them because God may have a different plan for us.""For I know the plans I have for you," declares the Lord, "plans to prosper you and not to harm you, plans to give you hope and a future." - Jeremiah 29:11::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Keiston France');
