INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4126892', 'Born in Detroit, Michigan to Vickie and Lamont Rippy in 1984. Growing up in Detroit''s east-side was rough, therefore DaJuan''s parents kept him and his siblings in various after school programs and activities at several youth centers. This is where he stayed busy practicing several styles of martial arts, learning gymnastics, modeling, acting in plays, playing sports, etc. Still DaJuan was a class clown during middle school and high school which caused him to fail the 7th and the 10th grade. DaJuan finally got his act together and started taking school seriously. After graduating high school, DaJuan went on to college to receive his AA. He then found interest in film production. DaJuan later attended the Motion Picture Institute. After graduated film school, DaJuan freelanced in film and television production for several years. While working in film production, DaJuan was able to attend classes and received his Bachelors of Science Degree.In recent years, DaJuan has relocated to California and has switch from working behind the scenes to working in front of the camera doing stunts and acting. DaJuan has spent the past few years training in acting and stunts. DaJuan is a proud member of SAG-AFTRA.::DMR', 'DaJuan Manwell', 'Rippy', NULL, NULL, 'DaJuan Rippy');
