INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8470500', 'Adrienne Louis Johnson is a native of Birmingham, Alabama. She started acting in church and school at a very young age. Her acting continued throughout high school and college, mostly theatrical productions. She and her husband moved to Georgia in 2015. Her passion for acting was reignited in January, 2016 when she was selected as the stand-in for Ms. Cassi Davis as Aunt Bam in the Tyler Perry movie, Boo! A Madea Halloween (2016). Adrienne has appeared in several film and television projects. She is best known for her roles in the popular TVOne series Fatal Attraction and the thriller film Spooked, both scheduled for release in 2017.::ALJ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Adrienne Johnson');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7413072', 'Maritalyn Koulebetouba was Born in Cincinnati Ohio and Raised in Florence SC. She attended Wilson High School in Florence SC. She graduated and enrolled in Wingate University where she majored in Communication.She began acting at a young age in plays and musicals. In 2013 she started taking her acting seriously by attending casting calls that led to a variety of shows and film.Some would say she is lucky while others say she is blessed. She will tell you that it is a combination of both and her will to do what she was made for. Actress Mari''s motto is "You never to Old to chase or Follow your Dreams!"::Maritalyn Koulebetouba', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Maritalyn Koulebetouba');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5420191', 'Colin Lacativa is an actor and composer, known for Messenger''s (2016), Call Girl (2014) and Waxhouse Rock (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Colin Lacativa');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1035135', 'Danny Le Boyer was born in Bien Hao, South Vietnam. His father Jean Boyer was a Colonel and Commander of the 518th fighter Squadron for the Peoples Republic of Vietnam. Due to the fall of Saigon, his mother Ba Nguyen fled the country with Danny and his younger sister Christy Boyer. They left on a Military C-130 transport aircraft, and had survived over 3000 mortar rounds fired at the airbase the previous night. His Father Jean Boyer stayed behind to lead his men, only to be taken prisoner after the fall of Saigon, and became a P.O.W. for the next 13 years.Relocating to the United States Danny grew up in the Santa Clara Valley in California. Danny started his martial arts training at the age of 8 first with Karate, Tae Kwon Do, and later Jui jit su. His success led him to a Silver Medal in the California State Tae Kwon Do Championship at the age of 18, and he was the Kenpo Karate Grand National Champion. Danny has also competed in various Full Force Open Mixed Martial Arts competitions winning 1st place in his division.Dannys aunt Wynne Wicker worked on Apocalypse Now with director Francis Ford Coppola as his Vietnamese Technical Advisor. Apocalypse now won 2 Oscars along with 14 other wins and 32 nominations. Wynne Wicker also worked on Platoon with director Oliver Stone as his Vietnamese Technical Advisor. Platoon later went on to win 4 Oscars along with 18 other wins and another 9 nominations.Inspired by his aunts work Danny Le Boyer pursued a career in Film. Danny got his big break in Hollywood in 2000 when he received a callfrom Stephen McEveety, one of Mel Gibsons producing partners at ICON Productions, to come work on the film We Were Soldiers, directed by Randall Wallace. Danny worked on the project as the background casting director and Vietnamese Technical Advisor. We Were Soldiers later won the ASCAP Award for Top Box Office Films and 5 other nominations.Danny went on to work in Hollywood as a stuntman, stunt double, actor, and more recently as a stunt coordinator. Danny has worked on major blockbuster hits such as The Last Samurai with director Edward Zwick, and actors Tom Cruise and Ken Watanabe. Inception with director Christopher Nolan, and actors Leonardo DiCaprio, Joseph Gorden-Levitt, Ellen Page, Tom Hardy, Cillian Murphy, and Ken Watanabe.Danny Le Boyer has worked as an actor alongside Johnny Depp Geoffrey Rush, Penelope Cruz, and Ian McShane on the much anticipated sequel in the Pirates of the Caribbean Franchise, On Stranger Tides, directed this time by Rob Marshall and produced by Jerry Bruckheimer.In 2007 Danny was nominated by the Screen Actors Guild Awards for Outstanding Performance by a Stunt Ensemble in a motion picture on the film Pirates of the Caribbean, At Worlds End.In 2010 Danny was nominated and won the Screen Actors Guild Awards for Outstanding Performance by a Stunt Ensemble in a motion picture for the film Inception.::Robert', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Danny Le Boyer');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7854809', 'Connie Lee is an actress, known for Thank You for Your Service (2017), Notorious (2016) and Baby Driver (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Connie Lee');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5182271', 'Kenneth Manos was born on May 8, 1984 in Columbia, South Carolina, USA. He is known for his work on The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 2 (2015), Ride Along (2014) and The Hunger Games (2012).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, '1984-05-08', NULL, 'Kenneth Manos');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5138171', 'Tony and Olivier Award-winning producer and partner at West Madison Entertainment: a New York based production, financing, consulting and development company focusing on feature films, television and Broadway productions. Recent films include "Lee Daniels'' The Butler", "The Family Fang," and upcoming "Rebel in the Rye," among others. Theatrical productions include the 6-time Tony Award and 3-time Olivier Award-winning musical "Kinky Boots" featuring music and lyrics by Cyndi Lauper (productions: Broadway, US tour, London, Toronto, Australia, Japan and South Korea), "Annie" (2013 Tony nominee - best revival), "Leap of Faith" (2012 Tony nominee - best musical) with music by Alan Menken and lyrics by Glenn Slater and "War Horse" (2011 Tony Award - best play). Off-Broadway Lucille Lortel Award-winning productions include: "Here Lies Love," with music and lyrics by David Byrne and Fatboy Slim and "In Transit," with music and lyrics by Kristen Anderson-Lopez, Sara Wordsworth, Russell Kaplan and James-Allen Ford.::Asst to Christina Papagjika', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Christina Papagjika');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0795832', 'Jason Shuman is a producer and director, known for Lone Survivor (2013), Role Models (2008) and Bangkok Dangerous (2008).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jason Shuman');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1380890', 'Trey McGriff is an actor, composer, director, and filmmaker, based out of Atlanta, Georgia. Trey is fast becoming one of the freshest and in-demand faces in Atlanta with his diverse talents and wide-ranging background in film, tv, and music. McGriff began acting at a very young age and portrayed Mowgli in a middle school play for the Jungle Book. Trey wrote the theme songs for Steve Niles'' Remains and Alien Opponent, both films continue to air on NBC''s Chiller TV, Syfy, Netflix, Hulu, and beyond. You can see Trey in Lifetime Network''s Ring Of Fire and Anna Nicole, Paramount''s Same Kind of Different As Me, Frankenstein Created Bikers, Baby Driver, and more. McGriff has gained over twenty years of stage time performing his original music in front of large crowds at House of Blues, Jagermeister Music Tour, Coca-Cola Roxy Theater, Centennial Olympic Park, Walnut Creek Amphitheater, The Ritz, Terrapin Brewery, Sweet Water Brewery, and many more. You may have heard Trey''s songs on NBC, Nat Geo Channel, ID Investigation Discovery, Showtime, World of Playboy TV(Playmate Lindsey Gayle Evans), MTV''s Real World, MTV''s Undressed, Sirius XM Satellite Radio, Comcast TV, NPR, Red Bull Films, and beyond. Trey McGriff stars in, wrote and directed the films: Gift That Kept Giving, Kuriosity Killz, Spooky Snow Day, and Something In My Attic. Trey is set to direct, compose, and act in ShovelHead The Movie, a unique Horror/Thriller feature film starring Michael Berryman.::Whiskey Child Records', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Trey McGriff');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('5009680', 'Andrew S. McMillan is known for his work on The Hunger Games: Catching Fire (2013), The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 1 (2014) and Baby Driver (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Andrew S. McMillan');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('7506601', 'Donald K. Overstreet is known for his work on Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017), Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 2 (2017) and Baby Driver (2017).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Donald K. Overstreet');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('8187515', 'Nathaniel Perry is known for his work on Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017), Baby Driver (2017) and Hidden Figures (2016).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nathaniel Perry');
