INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('4793012', 'Stephen Sayegh is a young actor and singer from New Jersey who feels fortunate to say that he''s been ''working'' since the age of 7. He has appeared in the National Touring Company of Pippin, portraying the role of Theo. His first performance was on Wednesday, February 11th and he traveled with the show in the United States and to Amsterdam.Other career highlights include appearances on Inside Amy Schemer, Saturday Night Live and Sesame Street. In 2014, Stephen was invited to sing at The Super Bowl Half Time Show with Bruno Mars. That was exciting! Stephen filmed The Comedian in 2016 with Robert DeNiro and Susan Blackwell portraying his parents. He has a love for working in the sound studio and enjoys voice over work. He has done jingles, books on tape and numerous ESL recordings. He has appeared in television and print commercials at the National level.Stephen has appeared Off Broadway in A Little Princess. He enjoyed playing the role of Poor Boy in this KOTA Production. Regional Credits included A Christmas Carol with The Workshop Theater in NYC (Tiny Tim/Young Scrooge/Goose Boy ), Oliver! with Harbor Lights (Fagan''s Boy) and Bye Bye BirdieE with Plays in the Park (Randolph). Stephen also played Jacob in the New York City reading of The Geranium on the Windowsill Just Died but Teacher You Went Right On.Stephen is an active member of the Broadway Youth Ensemble and loves performing at BYE events in the tristate area. A favorite venue so far has been Carnegie Hall. He loves to perform whenever he can. When he''s not doing that, he has many other interests. A proud member of MENSA, Stephen loves to read, edit films and enjoys playing the piano. He enjoys the beach, loves to swim and boogie board and can''t wait till his mom will let him learn how to surf!Stephen could not do what he loves without the guidance of his teachers, coaches, agents and especially Tamara at TM Talent. Most Importantly, Stephen would not be where he is today without the encouragement and support of his family, friends and his twin sister Emma.Proud Member of AEA and SAG AFTRA.::Stephen Sayegh', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Stephen Sayegh');
