INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3587072', 'Fabio Ciro is current Owner/CEO of Jago Ciro Entertainment. Fabio also serves on the Board of Directors for R.E.P.S. (Representatives in Entertainment & Publicity Services) (www.talentreps.org), a national not for profit organization dedicated to raising the standards of the profession of talent management. He is a proud member of Children in Film (www.childreninfilm.com), and advocate of many outreach organizations with missions to better protect youth and young adults in the Entertainment Industry. An active Personal Talent Manager for many years, he also has previous experience as a WGA registered Screenwriter, casting director, producer, and director of Stage & Screen. He was also an actor in his younger years but no longer. Always adept at honing and cultivating creative talent in others, Fabio believes in building relationships, creating strong foundations, and allowing a strong team driven work ethic to help predict and attain goals!::Jago Ciro Entertainment', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fabio Ciro');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2551357', 'Coy DeLuca is a classically educated actor & professional singer, with roots in Hungary & Sicily. Born in Bethlehem, PA, Coy has been a part of NYC since the 80''s. A street-smart man with a BA in Theatre, he continues to work with some of the best actors & directors.Coy was trained in classical piano as a child, playing Mozart, Beethoven, Bach, & Chopin. He began performing at a young age, eventually developing a five-octave vocal range. He discovered one of his most powerful tools of expression were his voice & a pen.Coy has delivered searing performances at iconic venues such as Starland Ballroom, State Theatre, Hollywood Casino, Webster Hall, Tammany Hall, Fat Baby, & Trash Bar. He was the lead singer for the Manhattan based heavy-metal band OLOM, and recorded a six song EP at Vibromonk studios which was released on iTunes in 2011. Coy''s rock band, GUN4GUN, released the song & music video "Dark Crown" to a die-hard Hungarian fan-base in 2013 along with an interview for the Hungarian News. Later he would collaborate with the bassist of 80''s glam rock band Howe II to release "Devil on a Treestump" & "(You''re) Addicted." From studio performances in Hollywood (360 Drone) to playing with Killswitch Engage at New York''s Smash Studios, sharing the stage with Accrassicauda, auditioning for Dino Cazares, recording in John "JD" DeServio''s (Black Label Society) home studio, or performing with UG of the Cella Dwellas in the music video "BARbarians," Coy has an unmatched love for the game.Coy''s acting training and ability to portray a wide scope of characters lends to his stunning presence on screen & stage. He''s acted with Mariska Hargitay & Ice-T in Law & Order: SVU, Debra Messing in "The Mysteries Of Laura," in Oprah Winfrey''s "Unfaithful: Stories of Betrayal," and performed on stage in the Off-Broadway hit "Tony ''n Tina''s Wedding." Coy was also featured for his unique look in Michael Alago''s book, "Beautiful Imperfections." Most recently, Coy guest-starred in a new Netflix series created by industry veterans Lawrence Bender, Gavin O'' Connor, & Veena Sud, titled "Seven Seconds."::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Coy DeLuca');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3311494', 'Ella Dershowitz is an actress, known for Phil Spector (2013), Two-Bit Waltz (2014) and I Am Michael (2015).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ella Dershowitz');
