INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('3121938', 'Heather Silvio is an actress, award-winning screenwriter, author, and singer. She has appeared on television and in movies produced by independent filmmakers and big-budget productions and is best known for 507 Beverly (2013), Eat Me! (2010), and Finding Mr. Right 2 (2016).Heather''s stage credits include productions throughout the country including Reservoir Dolls, The 39 Steps, Hairspray, and Cinderella. In addition to her acting roles, Heather is a frequent guest on news television shows, including FOX and NBC, offering her expert social commentary and psychological insights.She resides in Las Vegas, Nevada, with her business consultant and photographer husband Sidney Oster and their beloved cat, Snowball.::Heather Silvio', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heather Silvio');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('0182437', 'Alessandra Costanzo is an actress and writer, known for The Order (2003), Il sud è niente (2013) and Notte prima degli esami (2006).::Anonymous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Alessandra Costanzo');
INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('2615115', 'Chiara Teresa iezzi Cohen is an actress who became popular as pop songwriter and award winner singer in Italy in the late 1990s with Sony Music Ent. She is recently turned her career into acting and movies. At age 25 began studying at the Lee Strasberg Theatre institute, while she was continue pursuing her music accomplishments, stage performing and being on set for her music videos. She is still popular after playing the role of the villain Victoria Williams in the "Alex&Co tv series produced by Disney Channel (2015/16), as well as The Broken Key(2016), and Il ragazzo della Giudecca (2015). She appeared on "most beautiful women" lists", in 2001 on GQ and Max France and Uk, after a photoshoot with photographer Rankin.Cohen was born in Milan, Italy . In her earliest years, Chiara began absorbing the acting craft by watching movies and from her first teacher at school at 14 years old. Her good looks may derive from her ancestry, both italian and slovak on her father''s side. Her surname turned from Yetzy into naturalized italian "iezzi". At age 17, she took up a short career in modeling and appeared in some music videos . Since she was working with Sony, she realized eitght records and began to get in attention from the press. Some aspects of her personal life became news. Vanity Fair italia also spoke about her successes and her secret wedding to Meir Cohen.Off-screen Cohen become involved in some charity project in 2014 with Unicef for children. She also directed and starred in a short movie for Licantro Bros Production "The Age of wars", a cyber thriller located in Los Angeles.She recently began filming The Broken key with stars like Rutger Hauer, Geraldine Chaplin and William Baldwin.::wikipedia', NULL, NULL, '1973-02-27', NULL, 'Chiara Iezzi');
