INSERT INTO imdb.person VALUES ('1415992', 'Sergio Kato is an Brazilian/American actor. Sergio moved around a lot to many countries. He also has attended several acting trainings. Has done quite a lot in a short time. He has also been a fashion model, ballet dancer, and finally of course, actor. He got the audition for his first role as "Portuguese Cab Driver" in "Brenda Starr" with stars: Brooke Shields and Timothy Dalton. Director: Robert Ellis Miller.The Brazilian actor is willing to work hard and risk to achieve successes and victories in every area of his personal and professional life. Sergio Kato is a member of the SAG/AEA/AFTRA/SATERJ-Brazil. Worked with Mark Dacascos, Brooke Shields, Rutger Hauer, Timothy Dalton & Liza Minelli as a professional Ballet dancer.::Victor Perillo, Management', 'Sergio Luiz', 'Pereira', NULL, NULL, 'Sergio Kato');
